\id LUK  
\h Rukaxi 
\toc1 Rukaxi niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kemɨraka'utɨa 
\toc2 Rukaxi 
\toc3 Ruk 
\mt1 Rukaxi  
\mt2 Niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kemɨraka'utɨa  
\c 1  
\s1 Teukiru kemɨtiutawaɨritɨa  
\p
\v 1 Yumɨiretɨ mekaniuyuwaɨriya memɨteti'utɨanikɨ naime hepaɨtsita kemɨtiuyɨ kemɨraye'a tatsata,  
\v 2 yemekɨ kememɨtate'uxatɨa mɨkɨ matɨari paitɨ memunenierixɨ, nɨ'aritsixi memakɨ niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne memɨkuxata.  
\v 3 Neta, naitɨ kemɨtiuyɨ matɨari paitɨ nekatiniutiwauni kemɨtiwayakɨ neyukweriwayurietɨ. 'Ayumieme, pemɨmariwe Teukiru 'aku, nepɨnewaɨriya xexuime naime nemɨmaraka'utɨirienikɨ,  
\v 4 mɨpaɨ yurikɨ yapemɨretimanikɨ kemɨtiyuri 'ikɨ niuki pemuta'ɨkitɨarie.   
\s1 Wani Ti'ɨyame kemɨtitinuiwakekai  
\p
\v 5 Merikɨtsɨ kepauka Herurexi mɨti'aitametɨkai Kureya kwieyaritsie, mawari wewiwame 'akaniuyeikakaitɨni Tsakariyaxi titewatɨ, mawari wewiwame 'Awiyaxi teɨterimama wahamatɨa katini'uximayakaitɨni. 'Ɨyaya 'Eritsaweti mɨkɨta 'Aruni nuiwarieyatsie mieme kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni.  
\v 6 Yunaitɨ heitseriemekɨ yamekateniyuriekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hɨxie. Yamekatenikahukaitɨni Ti'aitame kemɨti'aitakai naimetsie, wahetsie karahɨiwakaku.  
\v 7 Nunutsi mepɨkahexeiyakai 'Eritsaweti mɨkayɨwekaikɨ meta mekani'ukirawetsixitɨkaitɨniri.   
\p
\v 8 Merikɨtsɨ heiwa Tsakariyaxi mawari wewiwametɨtɨ katini'uximayakaitɨni Kakaɨyari hɨxie kepauka 'Awiyaxi teɨterimama wahetsie mɨtiunakixɨ.  
\v 9 Mawari wewiwamete kemɨtiwayeiyaritɨkai, hetsiena katiniunake heiwa Ti'aitame tukita meutahanikɨ pɨtsi mɨtaiyakɨ.  
\v 10 Kepauka maye'a pɨtsi mɨtaiyakɨ tukita, yunaitɨ teɨteri takwa mekaniyunenewiekaitɨni.  
\v 11 Hikɨ 'ana Tsakariyaxi niuki tuayame kaniuxeiya Ti'aitame hetsɨa mieme mana 'utiweme mexa pɨtsi taiyame tserieta.  
\v 12 Tsakariyaxi 'ixeiyatɨ kaniuyuitɨarieni yu'iyaritsie, kaniutimani.  
\v 13 Hikɨ niuki tuayame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Pepɨkamaka, Tsakariyaxi 'aku, 'anenewieri kaniu'enierieni. 'A'ɨya 'Eritsaweti nunutsi kanayexeiyamɨkɨ 'aniwetɨme, Wani pekatiniterɨwamɨkɨ.  
\v 14 Pekani'atemawiekamɨkɨ waɨkawa, 'a'iyari kwini mieme ninaki'akamɨkɨ, yumɨiretɨ mekaniyutemamawiekakuni kepauka mɨtinuiwa,  
\v 15 kanimariwemɨkɨ Kakaɨyari hɨxie. Kaxie winuyari yatɨni xeime winu pɨkaye'eni, 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata kaniwiyamɨkɨ mɨtinuiwatsie paitɨtɨ.  
\v 16 'Ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari yumɨireme ta'aurie kaniwaraxɨriemɨkɨ, Ti'aitame memayexeiyanikɨ yukakaɨyari.  
\v 17 Mɨkɨ meri kananuyeyerɨmɨkɨ, Ti'aitame hɨxie, 'Eriyaxi hepaɨ tiuka'iyaritɨ tɨrɨkariyaya hexeiyatɨ, wa'ukiyarima ta'aurie kaniwaraxɨriemɨkɨ yɨtɨriyama memɨwara'eriwanikɨ meta mɨkɨ memɨkaheu'enana ta'aurie kaniwaraxɨriemɨkɨ mɨkɨ heitseriemekɨ yamemɨtekahu wahepaɨ memɨteyɨkɨhɨawenikɨ. Mɨpaɨ katiniwakuha'aritɨamɨkɨ teɨteri, Ti'aitame memɨkwewiekakɨ.   
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ Tsakariyaxi mɨpaɨ niuki tuayame katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Ke'aneme 'inɨarikɨ yanepɨtimaika? Nekani'ukiratsitɨniri meta ne'ɨya tukarieya ranutitɨari.   
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ niuki tuayame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ne Kɨrawieri nekanihɨkɨtɨni, Kakaɨyari hɨxie nekaniuweni. Yanemɨmatitahɨawekɨ nekaneyenɨ'arieni, nemɨmatsitaxatɨanikɨ 'ikɨ niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne.  
\v 20 Peru, 'ekɨ yuri pemɨkatiuta'erikɨ neniukitsie, kayuwatɨ pepɨtiyerɨni, pekaniuwetɨ pekanayeimɨkɨ mexi ka'aye'aweni. Pepɨka'utaniukani kepaukake tukari maye'ani naitɨ yamɨtiyɨni.   
\p
\v 21 Merikɨtsɨ teɨteri Tsakariyaxi mekanikwewiekaitɨni, mekani'iyarixiekaitɨni 'emɨreutewikaikɨ tukita.  
\v 22 Hikɨ kepauka muwayetɨa kaniyutatexieni warahɨawetɨ, hikɨ mɨkɨ yamekatenetimani kename tixaɨtɨ tiuxei tukita, yumamakɨ xeikɨa kaniwaku'inɨaritɨwakaitɨni, 'aniukateitɨni kaniuwetɨ.   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ heutipareku 'uximayatsikaya, yukie kaneyani.  
\v 24 Hikɨ 'ana reutiyetana 'ɨyaya 'ayehukatɨ kanayani 'Eritsaweti, hikɨ kaniyu'awietakaitɨni 'auxɨwi metseri mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\v 25 «Kamɨ, 'ipaɨ katiniuyurieni Ti'aitame, yuwaɨriyatɨ 'aixɨa mɨnetsiyurienikɨ, teɨteri memɨkanetsinanaimakakɨ».   
\s1 Mariya kemɨtiutahɨawarie Ketsutsi kemɨtitinuiwakekai  
\p
\v 26 Merikɨtsɨ 'ataxewirieka metseritsie Kakaɨyari yuniuki tuayame Kɨrawieri kaniutanɨ'ani, Karereya kwieyaritsie kiekari Natsareti mɨrakutewatsie,  
\v 27 'ɨimari mɨyuxewikai hetsɨa kanitanɨ'ani Mariya mɨtitewakai hetsɨa, kanitiwikieximekaitɨni, 'uki Kutse titewatɨ kanitiwitɨnikekaitɨni, Kutse Rawiri kaninuiwarieyatɨkaitɨni.  
\v 28 Hikɨ Mariya hetsɨa heutahaka niuki tuayame, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ke'aku. Ti'aitame 'aixɨa katiniuka'iyarini 'ahetsiemieme, 'ahamatɨa puyeika.   
\p
\v 29 Mɨkɨ yu'iyaritsie kaniuyuitɨarieni, yatiniku'eriwakaitɨni titayari mɨpaɨ mɨtiwaɨritɨa.   
\p
\v 30 Niuki tuayame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Pepɨkamaka, Mariya 'aku. Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa pɨtiuka'iyari 'ahetsiemieme.  
\v 31 Hikɨri pe'ayehukatɨ pekanayeimɨkɨ, 'ukitɨme pekanitiniwemɨkɨ meta Ketsutsi pekatiniterɨwamɨkɨ.  
\v 32 Mɨkɨ mariwetɨ kanayeimɨkɨ, 'Amutewi Nu'aya katiniuterɨwarɨwamɨkɨ. Ti'aitame Kakaɨyari kanipitɨamɨkɨ Rawiri 'uwenieyatsie mayerɨnikɨ, tutsieya.  
\v 33 'Ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari katiniwata'aitɨamɨkɨ yuheyemekɨ. Kemɨtita'aita pɨkaheutipare hatsuaku.   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ Mariya mɨpaɨ niuki tuayame katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Merikɨte, ¿kepaɨtɨtɨ mɨpaɨ pɨtiyɨni, 'uki nepɨkamate?   
\p
\v 35 Niuki tuayame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Iyari Mɨtiyupata 'ahetsie kaninuamɨkɨ, kemɨ'ane 'Amutewi yutɨrɨkariyakɨ kamani'etɨriwiyamɨkɨ. 'Ayumieme nunutsi mɨtinuiwa kanipatsiemɨkɨ Kakaɨyaritsie mieme, Kakaɨyari Nu'aya katiniuterɨwarɨwamɨkɨ.  
\v 36 Kamɨ, 'a'iwa yatewa 'Eritsaweti 'ayehukatɨ kanayani 'ukaratsitɨtɨri, 'ataxewime metseri kaniyurieka 'iya kaniweweme memɨxatakai.  
\v 37 Kakaɨyari pɨkayutatexieni, naimekɨ kaniyɨweni.   
\p
\v 38 Mariya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Merikɨte, ne Ti'aitame nekatini'uximayatameyatɨni. Kepemaine yaketiuyɨni.  
\p Hikɨ niuki tuayame kaneyani.   
\s1 Mariya kemɨreku'iwataxɨ 'Eritsaweti hetsɨa  
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ mɨixa tukari ka'anukayeiwekaku yukuha'aritɨaka kaneyani Mariya, yumexɨitɨatɨ kiekaritsie kaneta'ani mɨhɨriyatsie Kureya kwieyaritsie.  
\v 40 Tsakariyaxi kiita heutahaka 'Eritsaweti kaniutawaɨritɨani.  
\v 41 Merikɨtsɨ 'Eritsaweti kepauka Mariya waɨritsikaya mu'eni, nunutsi neukuyuaxɨani yuriepana. Hikɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata kaniwiya 'Eritsaweti.  
\v 42 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni karima:  
\p —Waɨkawa 'ekɨ 'aixɨa pepɨ'itɨarie, hipatɨ 'ukari temɨka'itɨarie hepaɨ, meta 'aixɨa kani'itɨariemɨkɨ kemɨ'ane pemɨtinuiwitɨani.  
\v 43 ¿Nehetsie ketinake neti'aitɨwame warutsieya mɨnetsi'iwatamiekɨ?  
\v 44 Kamɨ, 'awaɨritsika ne'u'enieku, nunutsi yutemawietɨ neukuyuaxɨani neyuriepa.  
\v 45 'Aixɨa pekani'itɨariemɨkɨ yuri pemɨtiuta'erikɨ kename 'aye'ani naitɨ kepemɨtiutahɨawarie, Ti'aitame kemɨmaretahɨawixɨ.   
\s1 Mariya kwikarieya  
\r (Ruk 1:46-53 – 1Tsam 2:1-10)  
\p
\v 46 Hikɨ Mariya mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\q1 —Ne'iyari mɨpaɨ paine, Ti'aitame kanitɨrɨkaɨyeni,   
\q2
\v 47 ne'iyari kaniyutemawieka Kakaɨyari hetsie Netsiwikweitsitɨwame,   
\q1
\v 48 kaneniuxeiya ti'uximayatameya kenemɨtihɨkɨ hetsiena mieme tsepa tixaɨtɨ nemɨkatihɨkɨ.  
\q1 Kamɨ, 'uxa'a warie yunaitɨ nuiwarite 'aixɨa ne'itɨariekame mekaneni'eriekakuni,   
\q2
\v 49 kemɨ'ane mɨtɨrɨkaɨye mariwemekɨ kaneniuyurieni.  
\q2 Mɨkɨ Patsiekame kanixatsiwani.   
\q1
\v 50 Kaniwanenimayaka yunaitɨ memeyemakaxe,  
\q2 meta waniwema kaniwanenimayaka.   
\q1
\v 51 Yɨkɨmana kemɨtiyuriene kanimatsiɨkɨni kemɨtitɨrɨkaɨye,  
\q2 kaniwareutaweiyaxɨani mɨkɨ memɨteyukatawe'erie yu'iyaritsie kememɨteku'eriwa.   
\q1
\v 52 Kwiepa te'aitamete kaniwarunawairieni tita memɨte'aita,  
\q2 mɨkɨ tixaɨ memɨkatehɨme pɨta kaniwaruhɨritɨani waɨkawa.   
\q1
\v 53 Memeuhakakwikukai kaniwarutihɨniya 'aixɨa mɨti'anekɨ,  
\q2 peru memeuka'ukai kaniwareutanɨ'axɨani memamaweme.   
\q1
\v 54-55 Kanitsutɨani tatsiparewietɨ 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari hetsɨana mieme temɨte'uximayatamete,  
\q2 he'eriwatɨ kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ ta'ukiyarima,  
\q1 'Apɨrahami kaninenimayaka,  
\q2 meta kataninenimayaka yuheyemekɨ tame hetsiena temɨyekɨ.   
\p
\v 56 Merikɨtsɨ Mariya 'Eritsaweti hetsɨa kaniukateitɨni 'etsiwatɨkaku haika metseri, 'arike yukie kaneyani.   
\s1 Wani Ti'ɨyame kemɨtiutinuiwaxɨ  
\p
\v 57 Merikɨtsɨ tukari kanaye'ani 'Eritsaweti mɨtiniwenikɨ, 'ukitɨme kaniutiniweni.  
\v 58 Hikɨ 'ahurawatari maremama yunaitɨ mete'utamarieka Ti'aitame waɨkawa kemɨtitanenimayataxɨ, hamatɨana mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 59 Hikɨ 'atahairieka tukaritsie mekaniu'axɨani me'i'inɨaritɨanike nu'etsi huriyutsixi waxitekiyakɨ. Tsakariyaxi mekateniterɨwakekaitɨni 'ukiyarieya hepaɨ,  
\v 60 'ana warutsieya mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Tixaɨtsietɨ. Wani katinitewakamɨkɨ pɨta.   
\p
\v 61 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Peru 'amare mɨpaɨ titewatɨ pumawe.   
\p
\v 62 Yumamakɨ mekanitahɨawe paapaya, kemɨtinake mɨpaɨ mɨtiterɨwarienikɨ.  
\v 63 Xapa 'uta'iwauka, mana mɨpaɨ katiniu'utɨani: «Wani katinitewaka». Yunaitɨ mekaniuhɨxiyani.  
\v 64 Hikɨ yapauka nenieya kaniuxɨnarieni, kaniutaniuni, hikɨ 'aixɨa 'utaitɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita kanayani.  
\v 65 'Ahurawatari yunaitɨ mekanimamakaitɨni, meta naitsarie Kureya hɨriyaritsie kemɨtiuyɨ mɨpaɨ katinikuxaxatsiwakaitɨni.  
\v 66 Yunaitɨ memɨ'enanakai mekaniyu'iyaritɨakaitɨni mɨpaɨ meteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ: «¿Ke'anetɨ payani 'ikɨ nunutsi?» Mɨkɨ meta, Ti'aitame yɨtɨrɨkariyakɨ kaniparewiekaitɨni.   
\s1 Tsakariyaxi kwikarieya  
\p
\v 67 'Ana Kakaɨyari 'Iyarieya Mɨtiyupata 'iwiyakaku nunutsi 'ukiyarieya Tsakariyaxi kaniutaniuni Kakaɨyaritsie mieme mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:   
\q1
\v 68 «'Aixɨa ketikɨhɨawarɨwani Ti'aitame, kemɨ'ane 'ixaheritsixi mɨtakakaɨyari.  
\q2 Kanitsutɨani yuteɨterima wa'ɨwiyatɨ, 'aixɨa 'iyurienetɨ memɨxɨnarienikɨ.   
\q1
\v 69 Tatsiwikweitsitɨwame tɨrɨkaɨyeme kataneyenɨ'airieni,  
\q2 Rawiri kie mieme, ti'uximayatsiriwame   
\q1
\v 70 (meripaitɨ kemutayɨkai yametekuxatakaku niukametemama memɨpatsie hetsiena mieme),   
\q1
\v 71 mɨtatsitawikweitsitɨanikɨ mɨkɨ memɨtatsi'aye'unie memɨkatatsi'a'iwakɨ,  
\q2 meta mɨkɨ memɨtatsi'uxiwe'erie memɨkatatsi'a'iwakɨ,   
\q1
\v 72 mɨpaɨ mɨtiwatinenimayatakɨ ta'ukiyarima  
\q2 kemɨraye'eri tɨratu mɨpatsie kemɨtiuwewi.   
\q2
\v 73 Kemɨtiuyuhɨritɨa yatikɨhɨawetɨ ta'ukiyari 'Apɨrahami:   
\q1
\v 74 Kename tatsipitɨanikekai tekamamatɨ 'atemu'uwanikɨ,  
\q2 tatsi'utawikweitsitɨaka mɨkɨ memɨtatsi'aye'unie wahetsɨa,  
\q1 temeyexeiyanikɨ kemɨtinake,  
\v 75 hetsiena mieme tepatsietɨ, heitseriemekɨ yatetekahutɨ,  
\q2 hɨxiena te'u'uwatɨ mexi te'ayeneniereni.   
\b  
\q1
\v 76 'Ekɨ meta, nunutsi 'aku, kemɨ'ane 'Amutewi niukameya pekatiniuterɨwarɨwamɨkɨ.  
\q2 Karikɨ Ti'aitame pepanukuhaitɨiya huyeya 'aixɨa pemɨyurienikɨ.   
\q1
\v 77 Teɨterimama wikweitsitɨarika pekaniwatahekɨatɨamɨkɨ,  
\q2 kemɨtiwareuyehɨwirieni mɨkɨ 'axamemɨte'uyuri pehaitɨ.   
\q1
\v 78 Mɨpaɨ katiniyuriemɨkɨ takakaɨyari mɨtiyukanenimayakɨ.  
\q2 Mɨpaɨ kemɨ'ane taheima mɨmieme kaninuamɨkɨ.   
\q1
\v 79 Mɨwahekɨariwiyakɨ mɨkɨ yɨwipa memu'uwa,  
\q2 meta mɨkɨ mekwi'iwarɨmetɨ memɨyɨriyarie niwahekɨariwiyamɨkɨ,  
\q1 ta'ɨkate katanitseiriyamɨkɨ temeu'uwanikɨ hake 'aixɨa temɨtetaxeiyanikɨ Kakaɨyari matɨa».   
\p
\v 80 Merikɨtsɨ nunutsi kaniwerekaitɨni, 'Iyarieya tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ kanayani, makumawetsie kaneyeikakaitɨni mexi tukarieya ka'aye'awekai 'akuxi matsiɨkɨtɨ mayanikɨ 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie.   
\c 2  
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiutinuiwaxɨ  
\r (Mat 1:18-25)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana 'aitsika neutanɨ'ariexɨani Tsetsaxi 'Akutsitu hetsɨa mieme, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ, yunaitɨ kwiepa memɨtama xapatsie memayuka'utɨanikɨ.  
\v 2 (Mɨkɨ matɨari teɨteri kememɨte'aka'utsie pɨtiuyɨ kepauka Tsireniyu mɨhɨritɨariekai Tsiriya kwieyaritsie).  
\v 3 Hikɨ yunaitɨ mekaneutayeixɨani memayuka'utɨaxɨanikɨ yuxexuitɨ yukiekaritsie.   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Kutse Karereya kwieyaritsie Natsareti mɨrakutewatsie kanayeyani. Kureya kwieyaritsie kaninuani Rawiri kiekariena Wereni mɨrakutewatsie. Rawiri kie kanimiemetɨkaitɨni, Rawiri nuiwarieya kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni.  
\v 5 Maka'utɨarienikɨ kaneyeyani Mariya 'awitɨtɨ mɨkɨ mayehukakaikɨ. 'Ɨyaya kanayanikekaitɨni.  
\v 6 Mana mexi me'u'uwakai, tukarieya kanaye'ani mɨtiniwenikɨ.  
\v 7 Hikɨ yumatɨari kaniutiniweni. Tuwaxatekɨ kaniku'eima, wakaitsixi wakanuwatsie kanikateni mɨkaxuawekaikɨ wahetsiemieme memɨwa'axɨanikekaitsie.   
\s1 Taheima miemete niuki tuayamete kememɨtewarutahɨawixɨ muxatsi wahɨwemete  
\p
\v 8 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana muxatsi wahɨwemete mana mekaniu'uwakaitɨni, yeuta meniwahɨtɨwekaitɨni yumuxatsi yɨwikɨta.  
\v 9 Hikɨ wahɨxie niutakeni niuki tuayame Ti'aitame hetsɨa mieme. Wa'aurie nakuxawatɨkaitɨni Ti'aitame hekɨariyayakɨ, waɨkawa mekaniutimamani.  
\v 10 Peru niuki tuayame mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xepɨkamamaka. Hikɨ nenixetaxatɨamɨkɨ niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne, waɨkawa kanixuawekamɨkɨ temawierika yunaime teɨteri wahetsiemieme.  
\v 11 'Ikɨ tɨkaritsie tiyuwikweitsitɨwame kanetinuiwa xehetsiemieme, Rawiri kiekariena katineyɨni, Kɨritsitu kanihɨkɨtɨni, Ti'aitame kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 12 'Ikɨ 'inɨarikɨ xekaneitimaikuni: Nunutsi xekanexeiyakuni tuwaxatekɨ 'eimeme, wakaitsixi wakanuwatsie heyekaime».   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ yapauka niuki tuayame 'aurie mekaniuti'uni muyuawitsie miemete yumɨiretɨ, 'aixɨa me'utiyuatɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:   
\q1
\v 14 «Taheima witsikatinikɨhɨawarɨwani Kakaɨyari,  
\q2 kwiepa 'aixɨa mekatenixeiyariekuni teɨteri mɨkɨ wakɨmana mɨnaki'a».   
\p
\v 15 Merikɨtsɨ niuki tuayamete muyuawitsie meheutiyunixɨaku, mɨpaɨ mekateniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni muxatsi wahɨwemete: «Hikɨmɨtsɨari tepɨyehu Wereni paitɨ, tepi'ixɨariyu kemainekai, Ti'aitame kemɨtatiutahɨawixɨ».   
\p
\v 16 Meyumexɨitɨatɨ mekanekɨne, mewaruta'iwauka Mariya mame Kutse mekaniwarutaxeiya, nunutsi meta wakaitsixi wakanuwatsie yekaime.  
\v 17 Mewaruxeiyaka mekatenikuxatakaitɨni kememɨte'utahɨawarie nunutsi hepaɨtsita.  
\v 18 Yunaitɨ memɨ'enanakai mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni kememɨtewarutahɨawixɨkɨ muxatsi wahɨwemete.  
\v 19 Matsi Mariya ni'ɨwiyakaitɨni yu'iyaritsie 'ikɨ naime, yu'iyaritɨatɨ hepaɨtsitana.  
\v 20 Hikɨ mekanekɨne muxatsi wahɨwemete 'aixɨa metekuxatatɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita naime kememɨte'uxeikɨ naime kememɨte'u'enikɨ, naitɨ yakatiniuyɨni kememɨte'utahɨawariekai.   
\s1 Tukita kemɨti'atɨarie Ketsutsi  
\p
\v 21 Merikɨtsɨ 'atahairieka tukari mekani'inɨaritɨani huriyutsixi teɨteriyari waxitekiyakɨ. 'Ana Ketsutsi katiniuterɨwarieni, niuki tuayame kemɨtiterɨwaxɨ yumaamatsie ka'ayekaiku 'akuxi.   
\p
\v 22 Metatsiere kepauka tukari maye'a, Muitsexi kemɨtiu'aitakai niwekame hepaɨtsita memɨyu'itienikɨ, Kerutsareme mekanekɨne nunutsi meheyetuanike Ti'aitame hetsɨa.  
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ katine'uka 'inɨari xapayaritsie, Ti'aitame meripaitɨ kemainekai: «Yunaitɨ 'ukitsi matɨari memɨtinunuiwa, mɨkɨ mekanipatsiekakuni Ti'aitame hetsiemieme».  
\v 24 Meta mekaniwarutimawa Ti'aitame kemainekai 'inɨari xapayaritsie kemɨre'uxa: «Kukuruxi xeiparitsi yatɨni weuraixi tɨrixi yuhutame».   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ tewi Kerutsareme kaniukateitɨni Tsimiyuni titewatɨ, mɨkɨ heitseriemekɨ yatikamietɨ Kakaɨyari kanayexeiyakaitɨni, kanikwewiekaitɨni 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari wanɨtɨwame. 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ kanihɨnekaitɨni,  
\v 26 mɨpaɨ katiniuhekɨatsitɨiyariekaitɨni 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ, kename kwitɨ kamɨnikekai, 'ixeiyameke Ti'aitame hetsɨa mieme Kɨritsitu, 'anarike kanimɨnikekaitɨni.  
\v 27 Hikɨ 'Iyari 'inɨku, huriyutsixi watukita kaninuani. Kepauka Ketsutsi nunutsi paapamama memeutahaxɨa me'eye'atɨanike kemɨtiwayeiyaritɨkai, huriyutsixi kemɨtiwayeiyari, 'inɨari niukiyaritsie kemɨre'uxa.  
\v 28 'Ana Tsimiyuni kanenutuni, 'aixɨa kaniutayɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:   
\q1
\v 29 «Hikɨrixɨa nekutsiyari 'aku, pepeye'atɨa 'aniuki,  
\q2 ne'iyaritsie neka'uximatɨariekame keneneuka'uxipitɨa ti'a'uximayatsiriwame.   
\q1
\v 30 Hikɨrixɨa nekɨmana nepɨtiuxei kepemɨtiwawikweitsitɨani teɨteri,   
\q2
\v 31 nepixei tita pemɨtiha'aritɨa yunaime teɨteri wahɨxie:   
\q1
\v 32 Kaniwahekɨariwiyamɨkɨ hipame nuiwarite  
\q2 meta witsite'aneneme katanayeitɨamɨkɨ 'ateɨterima 'ixaheritsixi».   
\p
\v 33 Hikɨ paapaya meta maamaya mekaniyu'iyaritɨakaitɨni mɨpaɨ mainekaikɨ hepaɨtsitana.  
\v 34 'Aixɨa xepɨ'itɨarieka kaniutayɨnita Tsimiyuni, mɨpaɨ Mariya katiniutahɨawe nunutsi maamaya:  
\p «Kamɨ 'ikɨ nunutsi yumɨiretɨ 'ixaheritsixi mematixɨrienikɨ meta yumɨiretɨ memanuku'unikɨ kani'ayumiemetɨni, 'inɨari kaniyɨmɨkɨ kaniniukimariekamɨkɨ,  
\v 35 'Ekɨta 'a'iyaritsie pekanitsekiemɨkɨ hiwerikakɨ, kumu 'ixipara kemɨtiyutsewe. Mɨkɨ kemɨtiyurieneni, yumɨiretɨ mematsiɨkɨtɨ mekanakɨnikuni kememɨteyɨkɨhɨawe yu'iyaritsie».   
\p
\v 36 Xewitɨta 'akaniuyeikakaitɨni 'ukaratsitɨtɨ Hana titewatɨ, mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari niukameya kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni, Penuheri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, 'Atsexi nuiwarieyatɨtɨ. Kanitseɨyekaitɨni, nauka tewiyari heimana nauka wiyari kanihɨkaitɨni, 'utiwikieka 'atahuta wiyari piteɨtakai yɨkɨna,  
\v 37 'umɨku yuxaɨta 'eniukateitɨni. Tuki kuraruyarita pɨkawayeyeikakai matsi yuhakietɨ yunenewietɨ pɨ'ayumiemetɨkai tukarikɨ tɨkarikɨ.  
\v 38 Hikɨ 'ahurawa 'uyaka pamɨpariyutsi kanipitɨani Kakaɨyari, Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita tiniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni Kerutsaremetari memɨta'ikwewakai memɨxɨnarienikɨ yunaitɨ.   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ meheye'atɨaka naime kemɨre'uxa 'inɨari xapayaritsie, Ti'aitame kemainekai meripaitɨ, Karereyatsie mekanekɨne, yukiekaritsie mekaneta'axɨani Natsareti mɨrakutewatsie.  
\v 40 Merikɨtsɨ nunutsi kaniwerekaitɨni tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ timaiwetɨ kanayeiximekaitɨni, Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa pɨtiuka'iyarikai hetsiena mieme.   
\s1 Temaikɨyari Ketsutsi tukita kemɨtiyeyeikakai  
\p
\v 41 Merikɨtsɨ xexuime wiyaritsie paapamama Kerutsareme mekaneta'axekaitɨni 'ixɨararipa kepauka meme'eriwakai, Kakaɨyari kemɨtiwarayewitɨ yuteɨterima.  
\v 42 Hikɨ kepauka tamamata heimana huta wiyari mɨhɨkai, mana mekaneutiyune, teɨteri kemɨtiwayeiyaritɨkai 'ixɨararipa.  
\v 43 Hikɨ heutipareku, yu'utɨma mehahuximekaku, Ketsutsi Kerutsareme kaniyuhayewa, 'atsimekatemaikaku paapamama.  
\v 44 Teɨteri watsata 'uyeikame me'erietɨ, xeitukari mekaniuhukaitɨni. 'Ana yu'iwama yumarema wahetsɨa mekanitiwautɨkɨne.  
\v 45 Meka'itaxeiyawawetɨ, Kerutsareme mekanakunuaxɨani me'ikuwautɨwetɨ.  
\v 46 Hikɨ hairieka tukari menitaxeiya tuki kuraruyarita 'ayekaime, te'ɨkitamete wahixɨapa 'ukaime. Kaniwa'eniekaitɨni kaniwaku'iwawiyakaitɨni.  
\v 47 Yunaitɨ memi'eniekai mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni timaiwemekɨ kemɨtiwaku'eiyakai.  
\v 48 Hikɨ paapamama me'ixeiyatɨ mekani'iyarixiekaitɨni, maamaya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Neniwe, titayari mɨya petatiuyuri. Tepɨmatsikuwautɨwe tetahiwerietɨ 'apaapa matɨa.   
\p
\v 49 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —'E'e, kari xepɨnetsikuwautɨwekai. ¿Tamɨ, 'atsixekatemaikai, meuyewetse ne'ukiyari kiya hepaɨtsita nemɨ'ayumiemetɨnikɨ?   
\p
\v 50 Mɨkɨ 'atsimepɨkateheitima niukieyatsie kemainekai.   
\p
\v 51 Hikɨ wahamatɨa kaneyani, Natsareti mekaneta'axɨani, kememaitɨkatei yakatinikamiekaitɨni. Maamaya yu'iyaritsie ni'ɨwiyakaitɨni 'ikɨ naime.  
\v 52 Ketsutsi timaiwetɨ kanayeiximekaitɨni, kaniwerekaitɨni, Kakaɨyari meta teɨteri matsi waɨkawa 'aixɨa mekatenixeiyakaitɨni.   
\c 3  
\s1 Wani Ti'ɨyame kemɨtikuxatakai  
\r (Ruk 3:2-10, 16-17 – Mat 3:1-12, Mar 1:3-5, 7-8)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana Tiweriyu Tsetsaxi tamamata heimana 'auxɨwi wiyari kaniyuriekaitɨni ti'aitatɨ, Punitsiyu Piratu kuwexinaruri kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni Kureya kwieyaritsie, Herurexi kanihɨritɨariekaitɨni Karereya kwieyaritsie mɨti'aitanikɨ, Peripe Herurexi mɨ'iwayatɨkai katini'aitakaitɨni 'Itureya kwieyaritsie meta Tɨrakuniti kwieyaritsie, meta Ritsaniyaxi katini'aitakaitɨni 'Awiriniyatsie,  
\v 2 'Anátsi meta Kaipátsi mekanihɨritɨariekaitɨni mawari wewiwamete. 'Ana Kakaɨyari yuniuki Wani kaniupitɨani Tsakariyaxi nu'aya, makumawetsie 'uyeikakaku.  
\v 3 Wani naitsarie Kurutani hatuxameyari manuyeka kaniuyeikakaitɨni, mɨpaɨ tikuxatatɨ teɨteri memɨtehayewakɨ 'axameteyurietɨ meta memɨka'ɨyarienikɨ mɨpaɨ mɨtimatsiɨkɨnikɨ kename mete'uhayewaxɨ 'axameteyurietɨ.  
\v 4 Yakatiniyurienekaitɨni kemɨre'uxa Kitsariyaxi xapayaritsie, Kakaɨyari niukieyakɨ kemɨtikuxatakai:  
\q1 «Xewitɨ makumawetsie mɨpaɨ pɨrehiwa:  
\q1 “Xekeneukuha'aritɨa Ti'aitame huyeya,  
\q2 xexeurawime huyeya xekeneutiwewi.   
\q1
\v 5 Naitɨ 'aki kananuparekutɨariexɨamɨkɨ,  
\q2 naitɨ yemuri 'emutɨtɨ 'etsimutɨtɨ 'akuweritɨ kanayeitɨariemɨkɨ.  
\q1 Tita mɨtitutune xexeurawitɨ katinayeimɨkɨ,  
\q2 tita mɨrakutetexiya 'akuharuanitɨ katinayeimɨkɨ.   
\q1
\v 6 Yunaitɨ teɨteri mepixeiya kemɨtiyuwikweitsitɨwa Kakaɨyari”».   
\p
\v 7 Wani mɨpaɨ katiniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni teɨteri memɨ'axekai mɨwaka'ɨyakɨ:  
\p —Kuterixi waniwema. ¿Kemɨ'ane mɨpaɨ pɨtixe'utahɨawixɨ xemɨyuta'unakɨ kapa 'uxa'atɨniwarie xe'uyehekarienikɨ?  
\v 8 Mɨkɨ memɨte'uhayewaxɨ kememɨteyurie wahepaɨ xeketeneyurieka, kemɨreuyewetse. Xepɨka'itsutɨaka yu'iyaritsie mɨpaɨ xeteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ: “Tepɨnaki'eriwa ta'ukiyari temexeiyakɨ 'Apɨrahami”. Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, Kakaɨyari kaniyɨweni 'ikɨ tetexi teɨteri mɨwarayeitɨani 'Apɨrahami niwemama.  
\v 9 'Ari hatsa kaniukuha'aritɨarieni kɨyexi maxɨrienikɨ, 'ayumieme naitɨ kɨye 'aixɨa 'anenetɨ mɨka'utixuxuawere kanaxɨriyamɨkɨ, taipa kaneuxɨriyamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 10 Teɨteri mɨpaɨ mekateniku'iwawiyakaitɨni:  
\p —¿Kamɨtsɨ keteteyurieka?   
\p
\v 11 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe Wani:  
\p —Kemɨ'ane huta kamixayari mexeiya, kemɨ'ane mɨkaheixeiya ke'umini, kemɨ'ane 'ikwai mexeiya yaxeikɨa ketiyurieneni.   
\p
\v 12 Meta kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tewawamete mekaniu'axɨani, memɨka'ɨyarienikɨ. Mɨpaɨ mekatenita'iwawiya:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame 'aku, ¿keteteyurieka tame?   
\p
\v 13 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kexemɨte'u'aitɨarie, heimana mieme xepɨkatewauka.   
\p
\v 14 Meta kuyaxi mɨpaɨ mekatenita'iwawiya:  
\p —Tameta, ¿keteteyurieka?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xepɨkatenawayani, 'itarikakɨ xepɨkawatawiwiyani. Xekenenaki'aka yu'iwarikakɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana teɨteri mekanita'ikwewakaitɨni yu'iyaritsie meyu'iyaritɨatɨ yunaitɨ Wani hepaɨtsita, xɨka mɨkɨ Kɨritsitu hɨkɨtɨni mexɨka katixaɨtɨni, me'utiyuatɨ.   
\p
\v 16 Peru Wani mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yunaime:  
\p —Neri hakɨ nepɨxe'uka'ɨya. Peru 'ukanamieni kemɨ'ane waɨkawa mɨtɨrɨkaɨye, nekatɨrɨkaɨyekaku ne. 'Aixɨa nepɨka'ane nehetsie mɨtinakenikɨ nemiparewiekakɨ ninemenakuwenirienikɨ kakaiya kwitaxiyari. Mɨkɨ pɨta kanixeka'ɨyamɨkɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ meta kanixe'itimɨkɨ tai kemɨtiyu'itiwa.  
\v 17 Kuxari 'itiwame pakwe'e, tɨriku mɨti'itienikɨ kuxari manuyewiwienikɨ, tɨriku kaniti'utamɨkɨ kaxetunitsie, peru kuxariyari pɨta pɨtitaiya tai mɨkatɨwetsie.   
\p
\v 18 Matsi waɨkawa kaniwatuikakaitɨni teɨteri, niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kaniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni.  
\v 19 Hikɨ Herurexi mɨkɨ kwieyari kanihɨritɨariekaitɨni mana mɨti'aitanikɨ. Yu'iwa kaniu'ɨyapieni, Heruriya titewakame kaniutiwitɨni, waɨkawa katiniyurienekaitɨni Herurexi 'axatiyurienetɨ, 'ayumieme Wani kanitate'akaitɨni.  
\v 20 Hikɨ Herurexi nayuye'atɨani 'axakemɨtiyurienekai, Wani kananutahɨani katsariyanata.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiuka'ɨyarie meta nuiwarieya  
\r (Ruk 3:21-38 – Mat 3:13-17, 1:1-17, Mar 1:9-11)  
\p
\v 21 Merikɨtsɨ kepauka yunaitɨ teɨteri memuka'ɨyarie, Ketsutsi kaniuka'ɨyarienita. Mexi yunenewiekai, taheima kananakatenire,  
\v 22 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata heimana kanakaneni hetsiena kaninuani, kukuru hepaɨ katiniyuxexeiyakaitɨni. Hikɨ xewitɨta taheima mɨpaɨ kanetayɨni: «'Ekɨ pekanineniwetɨni nekamaninaki'erieka, 'akɨmana nekaniyutemawieka».   
\p
\v 23 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi xeitewiyari heimana tamamata wiyari yakɨtɨtɨ kanihɨkaitɨni kepauka mitsutɨa mɨpaɨ tiyurienetɨ. Kutse kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mekateniku'eriwakaitɨni,  
\b  
\li1 mɨkɨta 'Eri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 24 mɨkɨta Matati kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Rewi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Meriki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kanahi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Kutse kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 25 mɨkɨta Matatiyaxi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Amuxi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Nahumi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Etsirie kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 26 mɨkɨta Nakahi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Mahati kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Matatiyaxi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Tsemehi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kutse kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Kura kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 27 mɨkɨta Kuhana kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Xetsa kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Tsuruwaweri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Tsaratieri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Nerie kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 28 mɨkɨta Meriki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta 'Arie kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Kutsani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta 'Erimurami kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Eri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 29 mɨkɨta Kutsuhe kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Eriyetsexi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kurimi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Matati kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Rewi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 30 mɨkɨta Tsimiyuni kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kura kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Kutse kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kunani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Eriyakimi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 31 mɨkɨta Mereya kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Mainani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Matata kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Natani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Rawiri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 32 mɨkɨta Kitsahi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta 'Uweri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Wuhutsi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Tsarimuni kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Nahatsuni kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 33 mɨkɨta 'Aminarawi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Aramini kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Hetsirumi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Paretsi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kura kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 34 mɨkɨta Kakuwu kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta 'Itsahaki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Apɨrahami kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Teraki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Nakuxi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 35 mɨkɨta Tseruki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Rakau kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Pereki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Ewexi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Tsara kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 36 mɨkɨta Kainani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta 'Aripatsari kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Tsemi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Nuhexi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Rameki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,   
\li1
\v 37 mɨkɨta Matutsareni kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Enuki kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kareri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Maharareri kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kainani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\v 38 mɨkɨta 'Enuxi kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Tseti kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta 'Arani kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨni,  
\li1 mɨkɨta Kakaɨyari kaninu'ayatɨkaitɨniri.   
\c 4  
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiuta'inɨatsie  
\r (Ruk 4:1-13 – Mat 4:1-11, Mar 1:12-13)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ, Ketsutsi 'Iyari Mɨtiyupatakɨ hɨnetɨ mana kaneyeyani Kurutani hatuxameyaritsie, meta 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata kaneiwitɨni makumawetsie.  
\v 2 Mana huta tewiyari tukari kaniuyurieni, meta kauyumarie kanita'inɨata. Mɨpaɨpaɨmexɨa tukari pɨkatikwakai, hikɨ 'anarike kanekahakamɨkatɨyani.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ Kauyumarie mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kamɨtsɨ, 'ekɨ xɨka Kakaɨyari penu'ayatɨni, 'ikɨ tete mɨpaɨ ketineutahɨawi, paa payuyeitɨani.   
\p
\v 4 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —'Utɨarika mɨpaɨ paine: “Tewi xɨka paa xeikɨa kwaka, mɨkɨkɨ pɨka'ayeyurini”.\f + \fr 4:4 \ft RV60 meta hipatɨ mepenanɨitɨa \fq Kakaɨyari kemutayɨ, niukieya naitɨ peuyewetseta.\f*   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Kauyumarie wapaitɨ heiwitɨka, kwiepa memɨtama wakwie naime kanixeitsitɨani xeinieriyarikɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Kauyumarie mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Heitserie nepɨmatsipitɨaka 'ikɨ naime hepaɨtsita, yunaitɨ witsimemɨmatekɨhɨawenikɨ nepɨmatsipitɨaka, 'ikɨ naime nekaniyetuiriyarieni, heitserie nepexeiya nemiminikɨ kemɨ'ane mɨnetsinake.  
\v 7 'Ayumieme 'ekɨ nenewieri xɨka penetsi'upitɨani, 'ikɨ naitɨ 'apini pɨrayani.   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenemie Kauyumarie, 'utɨarika mɨpaɨ paine: “Nenewieri pepipitɨani Ti'aitame 'akakaɨyari, mɨkɨ hɨkɨame xeikɨa pepayexeiyani”.   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Kauyumarie kaneiwitɨni Kerutsareme, watuki yekɨrita kanenutiwitɨni, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ekɨ Kakaɨyari xɨka penu'ayatɨni, 'ena keneukatsuna.  
\v 10 'Utɨarika mɨpaɨ paine:  
\q1 »“Yuhetsɨa miemete niuki tuayamete pɨtiwa'aitɨaka 'ahepaɨtsita memɨmatsi'ɨwiyanikɨ.  
\q2 Yumamakɨ mepɨmatsituikani,   
\q1
\v 11 kapa tetetsie pe'uti'ɨkamɨrekɨ”».   
\p
\v 12 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ paineta: “Pepɨka'i'itsipaneni Ti'aitame mɨ'akakaɨyari”.   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ Kauyumarie naimekɨ 'ita'inɨataka kaneyani 'ariketa 'ita'inɨatake.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiuyuri Natsaretitsie  
\p
\v 14 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi yu'utɨma kaneyeyani Karereya paitɨ, 'Iyari 'itɨrɨkariyakaku, naitsarie kaniutamariwa hepaɨtsitana.  
\v 15 Katiniku'ɨkitanekaitɨni tukiteta, hikɨ yunaitɨ 'aixɨa mekatenikuxatakaitɨni hepaɨtsitana.   
\p
\v 16 Hikɨ Natsareti kiekariyaritsie kaninuani, matawerixɨtsie, hikɨ kemɨtiyeiyarieyatɨkai, tukita kaneutahani 'uxipiya tukaritsie. Kananukukeni tititerɨwake,  
\v 17 hikɨ xapa kaniuhuritɨarieni Kakaɨyari niukieya maye'uxa, Kitsariyaxi kemɨraka'utɨa. 'Itaweraka kanitaxeiya niuki hakewa mɨpaɨ maine:   
\q1
\v 18 «Ti'aitame 'Iyarieya kaneniuwiya,  
\q2 Kaneniuhɨritɨani niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne nemɨwakuxaxatɨwanikɨ tixaɨtɨ memɨkateheuxeiya.  
\q1 Kaneneyenɨ'ani nemɨwaranayexɨrienikɨ mɨkɨ memɨyuhiwerie yu'iyaritsie, yanemɨtiwatahɨawekɨ mɨkɨ memanutaxɨriya kename me'utixɨnarie,  
\q2 meta yanemɨtiwatahɨawekɨ mɨkɨ memakɨkɨpe kename me'anutaneniere,  
\q1 nemɨwaxɨnakɨ mɨkɨ memɨwiyarietɨka,   
\q2
\v 19 nemɨtikuxatanikɨ kename tukari 'aye'a kepauka Ti'aitame muyuwaɨriya 'aixɨa mɨtatixeiyakɨ».   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ 'itakwikwieka xapa, 'iyetuirieka tiyuparewiwame, mana kanayerɨni ti'ɨkitame 'uwenieyatsie. Yunaitɨ tukita memayetekai kwi mekanixeiyakaitɨni,  
\v 21 hikɨ kanitsutɨani mɨpaɨ tiwakuxaxatɨwatɨ: «'Ikɨ tukaritsie kanaye'ani 'ikɨ 'utɨarika kemaine, xe'i'eniekaku xeme».   
\p
\v 22 Yunaitɨ mekatenihekɨatakaitɨni me'i'enieka, mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni niuki witsimanuyɨne tetana mayeneikakaikɨ. Mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni: «¿'Ikɨ Kutse nu'aya katihɨkɨ?»   
\p
\v 23 Mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe: «Patsɨ yurikɨ xeme 'ikɨ niukiyari xekanenitaxatɨakuni: “Tiyu'uayemawame 'aku, 'akɨmana keneuyu'uayema. Ketemɨte'u'enana Kaperunaume kepemɨreyuri, 'enata 'akiekaritsie yaxeikɨa ketineuyuri”.  
\v 24 Tawarita mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, nixewitɨ Kakaɨyari niukameya pɨkanaki'eriwa yukiekaritsie.  
\v 25 Yuri nepaine, 'Ixaheri kwieyaritsie yumɨiretɨ wiuraxi mekaniu'uwakaitɨni kepauka 'Eriyaxi 'amuyeikakai, kepauka muyuawitsie mɨreunamie haika wiyari heimana 'ataxewi metseri, kepauka haka mutawe naitsarie kwiepa.  
\v 26 Mɨkɨ wahetsɨa pɨka'utanɨ'arie 'Eriyaxi nixeime hetsɨa, Tsiruni kwieyaritsie pɨta kaniutanɨ'arieni Tsarepɨta mɨrakutewatsie wiura hetsɨa.  
\v 27 Mɨkɨ meta, yumɨiretɨ 'amekaniu'uwakaitɨni 'Ixaheri kwieyaritsie kwiniyakɨ meka'itiyatɨkaitɨ kepauka 'Eritseu 'amuyeikakai Kakaɨyari niukameya, nixewitɨ tɨma pɨka'u'itiya mana kiekatari, tsiriyatanaka pɨta kaniu'itiyani Nahamani titewatɨ».   
\p
\v 28 Hikɨ me'i'enieka kemɨtikuxatakai, mekaniuyeha'ani yunaitɨ tukita memayetekai.  
\v 29 Me'anuku'uka, kiekaritsie mekaneyeweiya, yemuritsie mekaneihana kiekari hetsiena mawewiyakaitsie, mana tekɨa memekahɨanikɨ.  
\v 30 Peru mɨkɨ wahixɨata heutayuneka kaneyani.   
\s1 Kakaɨyari mɨka'itiya tewi kemɨtiwiyakai  
\r (Ruk 4:31-37 – Mar 1:21-28)  
\p
\v 31 Merikɨtsɨ kiekaritsie kaninuani Kaperunaume mɨrakutewatsie Karereya kwieyaritsie, mana 'uxipiya tukaritsie tiniwa'ɨkitɨakaitɨni.  
\v 32 Mɨkɨ mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni 'ɨkitsikayakɨ, heitserie hexeiyatɨ mɨtaniukakaikɨ.   
\p
\v 33 Hikɨ tukita nayekateitɨni tewi kakaɨyari mɨka'itiya 'iwiyakaku.  
\v 34 Karima kaniutahiwa mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Aii, kepetati'uximatɨa Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka. ¿Petatsika'unake kari pepunua? Ne nepɨmatsimate kepemɨpaikɨ: 'Ekɨ pepɨhɨkɨ Kakaɨyaritsie mieme pemɨpatsie.   
\p
\v 35 Hikɨ Ketsutsi kanitatieni mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Kayuwatɨ. Keneuxɨna mɨkɨ tewi.  
\p 'Iya kakaɨyari tewi 'atihɨaka wahixɨapa, kanixɨna katikwinitɨaka.   
\p
\v 36 Yunaitɨ mekaniutimamani, meteyukuxaxatɨwatɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni: «¿Ke'aneme niuki pexeiya? Heitserie hexeiyatɨ kaniwarutate'ani kakaɨyarixi memɨka'itiyatɨka tɨrɨkariya hexeiyatɨ, mɨkɨta mekaniwatixɨnani».  
\v 37 Naitsarie kiekari 'aurie kanikuxaxatsiwakaitɨni, Ketsutsi kemɨtiyurienekai.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨrenayehɨa Pekuru warɨkaɨya  
\r (Ruk 4:38-43 – Mat 8:14-17, Mar 1:29-38)  
\p
\v 38 Merikɨtsɨ tukita wayeyaka Tsimuni kie kaninuani, hikɨ hɨiya yemekɨ kaniwiyakaitɨni Tsimuni warɨkaɨya. Ketsutsi mekaniutawawirieni miparewienikɨ.  
\v 39 'Auriena 'utakeka, hɨiya kaniutatieni, hikɨ hɨiya kanihayewa. Yapauka 'anukukeka kaniwarutiparewietɨyani.   
\p
\v 40 Hikɨ tau 'akayuneku, yunaitɨ memɨwarexeiyakai tekwikwikate mɨireme kwiniyakɨ memɨtekukuyekai hetsɨana mekaniwa'atɨani, yuxexuime wahetsie 'utimeka 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame kaniwarayeitɨani.  
\v 41 Kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene kaniwaruta'aitɨani memɨwatixɨnakɨ yumɨireme memɨtewakwinitɨakai, mɨkɨ mekaniutihiwakaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «'Ekɨ Kakaɨyari pekaninu'ayatɨni». Peru Ketsutsi warutate'atɨ kakaɨyarixi pɨkawapitɨakai memɨtiniunikɨ memimaikaikɨ kename Kɨritsitu hɨkɨtɨkai heitserie mupitɨarie.   
\p
\v 42 Hikɨ 'ukatareku kaneyani teɨteri memɨkahaxuawetsie. Teɨteri yumɨiretɨ mekanikuwautɨwekaitɨni, me'itaxeiyaka mepikuhanakai mɨkaheyeikanikɨri.  
\v 43 Peru mɨkɨ matsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Kaneuyeweka hipame kiekaritetsieta niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne nemɨkuxatanikɨ, kemɨtiyɨni Kakaɨyari ti'aitakaku, peuyewetse nemɨtikuxatanikɨ, 'ayumieme nepeyenɨ'arie».  
\v 44 Hikɨ kaniyeweiyakaitɨni tikuxatanetɨ huriyutsixi watukiteta.   
\c 5  
\s1 Kemɨ'ane meri muwaranayexei teyu'ɨkitɨwamete  
\r (Ruk 5:1-11 – Mat 4:18-22, Mar 1:16-20, Wa 1:40-42)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi Kenetsareti harakunayari tetsita kaniuyeikakaitɨni tikuxatatɨ, yumɨiretɨ mekanitsaipɨnakaitɨni Kakaɨyari niukieya me'eniekutɨ.  
\v 2 Hikɨ kanuwa kaniuxeiya hutame hatetsita 'aheikame ketsɨteweiyamete wakanuwa, ketsɨteweiyamete me'anatikɨneka yuwipi mekani'ekwakaitɨni.  
\v 3 Hikɨ xeimetsie kayerɨka Tsimuni kanuwayatsie, kanitawawirieni harakunatsie 'etsiwa meutahanikɨ. Kanuwatsie yekaitɨ katiniwa'ɨkitɨakaitɨni teɨteri.   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ yuxatsika 'unɨka, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe Tsimuni:  
\p —'Emeukatewatsie keneuyeye'a, mana wipi xeneukawiwiexɨa tsapari xemɨwaratixɨrienikɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Tsimuni mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame 'aku, tɨkakɨta naime tepayekexi, tepɨteta'uxitɨa yakɨ xeikɨa, tixaɨ tepɨkate'umi. Matsi mɨya pemainekɨ, wipi nekaneukawiwiexɨamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Mɨpaɨ mekateniuyurieni, hikɨ mekaniwaratixɨrieni ketsɨte kwini mieme meyupaɨmeme, wipi kanititsanikekaitɨni.  
\v 7 Hikɨ yu'iwama xeime kanuwatsie memɨyetekai yumamakɨ mekaniwarumawiya memakɨnekɨ memɨwaparewienikɨ. Mɨkɨ mekaniu'axɨani, yukanuwate mekaniutihɨniyaxɨani hutame, 'etsiwatɨkaku mekaniukayunixɨani.   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ naime tiuxeiyaka Tsimuni Pekuru mɨtitewakai, kaniutitunumakeni Ketsutsi hɨxie mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Ti'aitame, keneneuhayewa, ne 'axanepɨtiyuruwame.   
\p
\v 9 Kaniutimakaitɨni mɨkɨ meta yunaitɨ hamatɨana memu'uwakai mekaniutimamani mɨya yupaɨmeme memɨwaratixɨrikɨ tsapari.  
\v 10 Yaxeikɨata Tsewereu niwemama mekaniutimamani Kakuwu meta Wani, Tsimuni hamatɨa memɨte'uximayakai. Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ Tsimuni katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Pepɨkamaka. Hikɨtsɨ 'ena mɨtiyehane teɨteri pɨta pekaniwakuxeɨrimɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 11 Hikɨ kanuwa me'anatihapaka kwiepa, naime mete'uku'eirieka, Ketsutsi hetsie mekateniuwiya mekaneiweiya.   
\s1 Tewi kwiniyakɨ mɨka'itiyakai  
\r (Ruk 5:12-14 – Mat 8:2-4, Mar 1:40-44)  
\p
\v 12 Merikɨtsɨ xeime kiekaritsie kaniuyeikakaitɨni Ketsutsi, tikwikame mana kaniukateitɨni mɨka'itiyakai naitɨ heupɨnitɨ. Hikɨ Ketsutsi 'uxeiyaka, kaniutihɨximakeni, mɨpaɨ titawawirienike:  
\p ―Ti'aitame, xɨka pe'awaɨriyani, pepɨyɨwe pemɨnetsi'u'itieni.   
\p
\v 13 Ketsutsi yumama 'utatseraka kanimayɨani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Nepɨnewaɨriya, pe'itiyatɨ peke'uyuhayewa.  
\p Yapauka kwiniya kanihayewa.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'aitɨani 'atsimɨkatitahɨawekɨ xeime. Mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenemie mawari wewiwame matsixeiyakɨ, pemu'itiyakɨ ketineutimawa Muitsexi kemɨtiu'aitaxɨ pemɨtiwatahekɨatɨanikɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Perutsɨ matsi kwini mieme katinikuxaxatsiwakaitɨni hepaɨtsitana, teɨteri yumɨiretɨ mekaniyutixexeɨriwakaitɨni memi'enienikɨ 'aixɨa memɨte'uka'eritɨariwanikɨ kwiniya kememɨtehexeiyakai.  
\v 16 Ketsutsi matsi makumawetsie kaneyeikakaitɨni yutanenewienike yuxaɨta.   
\s1 Ketsutsi huriekame kemɨranayehɨa  
\r (Ruk 5:18-26 – Mat 9:2-8, Mar 2:3-12)  
\p
\v 17 Merikɨtsɨ xeime tukaritsie katini'ɨkitakaitɨni, mana menayetekaitɨni huriyutsixi teɨteriyari yuyeiyarikɨ memɨpatsiekai paritseutsixi memɨteyuterɨwakai, hipatɨta huriyutsixi wa'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai. Naime kiekaritetsie Karereya kwieyaritsie Kureya kwieyaritsie mekaneyekɨnekaitɨni meta Kerutsaremetsie. Kakaɨyari tɨrɨkariyaya kanixuawekaitɨni Ketsutsi 'aixɨa mɨtiwaruka'eritɨwanikɨ.  
\v 18 Hikɨ teɨteri mekaniu'axɨani me'ehanatɨ huriekame 'itaritsie yekaime. Ketsutsi mɨwakateitsie mekani'atɨanikekaitɨni hɨxiena me'itenike,  
\v 19 peru mekaniyutatexieni meheutahaxɨanike teɨteri memɨyumɨirekaikɨ, 'ayumieme kii heima meneutimamake, tekayari meha'unaka, Ketsutsi hɨxie mekaneikatuani tewi 'itari naime teɨteri wahixɨapa paitɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ waruxeiyaka yuri kememɨte'eriekai, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Ekɨ 'aku, 'axakepemɨtiuyuri pekatineuyehɨwiyarieni.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ paritseutsixi meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai, mɨkɨ mekanitsutɨani mɨpaɨ meteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ: «¿Kepɨpaikɨ 'ikɨ 'axamutaine Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita? ¿Kepaikɨ pɨyɨwe mɨtiwareuyehɨwirieni 'axamete'uyurieyu, Kakaɨyari xeikɨa pɨyɨwe?»   
\p
\v 22 Ketsutsi retimaika kememɨteyɨkɨhɨawekai mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayaritsɨ mɨya xeteyɨkɨhɨawe yu'iyaritsie?  
\v 23 ¿Tita matsi katikwaniwe, ketikwaniwe mɨpaɨ xɨka 'utayɨni: “Ke'axapemɨtiuyuri pepɨreuyehɨwiyarie”, katikwaniwe matsi mɨpaɨ mutayɨni, “Kenanukukexi kenekuyeikani”?  
\v 24 Peuyewetse mɨpaɨ xemɨtemaikakɨ, Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa, heitserie nekanexeiyani kwiepa nemɨtiwareuyehɨwirienikɨ mɨkɨ 'axamemɨte'uyuri.  
\p 'Ana mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe huriekame:  
\p —'Ekɨ 'aku nepɨmarahɨawe, kenanukukexi, 'a'itari kenanukwe'i, 'akie kenemie.   
\p
\v 25 Yapauka kananukukeni yunaime wahɨxie, titatsie mɨrakatei kaneikweni, yukie kaneyani 'aixɨa 'utaitɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita.  
\v 26 Hikɨ yunaitɨ mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni, 'aixɨa mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita. Waɨkawamekɨ mekanimamakaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Mamariwaweme tepɨte'uxei hikɨ».   
\s1 Rewi kemɨtiuta'ini hetsiena mɨtiwiyakɨ  
\r (Ruk 5:27-32 – Mat 9:9-13, Mar 2:14-17)  
\p
\v 27 Merikɨtsɨ kaneyani, tewi kuwiyexinutsie mieme tiwawame kaniuxeiya Rewi titewakame memɨte'ayutituayatsie 'akaime. Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Nehetsie ketineuwiya.   
\p
\v 28 Hikɨ Rewi 'anukukeka, naime tiuku'eirieka, hetsiena katiniuwiya.   
\p
\v 29 'Ana Rewi 'ikwai kaniuwewieni yukiita Ketsutsi hetsiemieme, yumɨiretɨ kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tewawamete, meta hipatɨ teɨteri mekatenikwakaitɨni hamatɨana.  
\v 30 Peru paritseutsixi meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai memɨyɨnɨkai, mɨkɨ mekaniniukixiekaitɨni mɨpaɨ metewakɨhɨawetɨ hetsɨana miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:  
\p —¿Titayarikuta mɨkɨ tewawamete meta 'axateyuruwamete wahamatɨa xetekwa'a meta xete'ie?   
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨkɨ 'aixɨa memɨteheu'erie mepɨkaheiyehɨwa tiyu'uayemawame, mɨkɨ memɨtekukuye pɨta mekaneiyehɨaka.  
\v 32 Nepɨkanua newata'inienike mɨkɨ heitseriemekɨ yamemɨtekahu, mɨkɨ 'axamemɨteyurie pɨta newata'inienike nekaninuani memɨtehayewakɨ ke'axamemɨteyurie.   
\s1 Kemɨtiuta'iwawiyarie hakiya hepaɨtsita  
\r (Ruk 5:33-39 – Mat 9:14-17, Mar 2:18-22)  
\p
\v 33 Merikɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Wani hetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mepuyuhakixime meta mepɨyunenewixime mɨixa, meta paritseutsixi wahetsɨa miemete yaxeikɨa mepɨteyurie. ¿Peru 'ahetsɨa miemete titayari yametekwa'a yamete'ie?   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —¿Ketiyɨwe mɨwahakieka neneɨkeme 'inierimama mexi neneɨkeme wahamatɨa 'uyeika?  
\v 35 Tukari kanaye'amɨkɨ kepauka neneɨkeme mɨtihanieni watsata, mɨkɨ tukaritsieke mekaniyuhakikuni.   
\p
\v 36 'Ikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ tiniwaruti'ɨkitɨatɨyani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Tewi kapitatsana 'ixuriki hekwame, mimanetsikitɨanikɨ mɨye'i. Xɨka mɨpaɨ tiuyurieni, hekwame pɨtatsanekeyu, mɨhekwa matɨa mɨye'i 'axapɨtiyuxexeiyanikeyu.  
\v 37 Meta nixewitɨ tsixai mɨyeye'itsie pɨka'ikatu'a kaxie winuyari mɨhekwa mɨkwanakɨ. Mexɨka mɨpaɨ tiuyurieni, winu mɨhekwa tsixai kanititsanamɨkɨ, winu kanitayeuriweni, meta tsixai kaneuyewautseni.  
\v 38 Matsi kaxie winuyari mɨhekwa kaneuyeweka tsixai mɨhehekwatsie mɨkatuarieni mɨkwanakɨ.  
\v 39 Tewi meripai mieme 'anieku 'anuti'ieme, kwaname pɨkaheu'imɨkɨni, mɨpaɨ paineni: “Meripai mieme 'aixɨa kana'aneni”.   
\c 6  
\s1 'Uxipiya tukaritsie tɨriku kememɨte'utikwai teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete  
\r (Ruk 6: 1-11 – Mat 12:1-14, Mar 2:23–3:6)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'uxipiya tukaritsie Ketsutsi tɨriku ma'iwiyatsie kaniuyeyani, teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete tɨriku mɨayeyari mekananutihurukakaitɨni, yumamatsie me'ititɨminatɨ mekanikwakaitɨni.  
\v 2 Hikɨ paritseutsixi hipatɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —¿Titayarikuta xeme kemɨkareuyewetse xeteyurie 'uxipiya tukaritsie?   
\p
\v 3 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Kari, tɨma xepɨka'ekaterɨwawawe kemɨtiuyuri Rawiri kepauka memuhakakwi mɨkɨ meta hamatɨana memu'uwakai?  
\v 4 Kakaɨyari kiyata kaneutahani, paa muwa Kakaɨyari hɨxie mamanekai 'anaka'ɨka, kanitikwani, mɨkɨ heitserie pɨkahexeiyakai mitikwanikɨ, mawari wewiwamete xeikɨa heitserie mepexeiyakai. Metatsiere kaniwarumini mɨkɨ 'utɨmana memeu'uwakai.   
\p
\v 5 Mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Heitserie nekanexeiyani 'uxipiya tukari hepaɨtsitata Yuri Tewi nehɨkɨtɨtɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Merikɨtsɨ tawari 'uxipiya tukaritsie tukita kaneutahani, hikɨ kanitsutɨani ti'ɨkitatɨ. Tewi muwa kanayekateitɨni mɨmamawakikai yutserieta,  
\v 7 mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai meta paritseutsixi mekanihupiekaitɨni, tsiparatsɨ xɨka 'uxipiya tukaritsie 'enayehɨanike tɨma, me'utiyuatɨ, mɨkɨkɨ memitaxanetakɨ.  
\v 8 Timaitɨ kememɨteyɨkɨhɨawekai, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe tewi mɨmamawakikai:  
\p —Kenanukukexi, tahixɨapa keneutakexi.  
\p 'Anukukeka mana kaniutakeni.  
\v 9 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ipaɨ nepɨtixeku'iwawiya: ¿'Uxipiya tukaritsie tiheitserie 'aixɨa mɨtiyurieneni, nutsu 'axamɨtiyurieneni? ¿Tiheitserie para tewi mutawikweitsitɨani, nutsu mika'unakɨ pɨta?   
\p
\v 10 Yunaime waranuxeiyatɨyaka, mɨpaɨ tewi katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Amama keneutatsera.  
\p Mɨpaɨ tiuyurieku mamaya 'aixɨa 'anetɨ kanayani.  
\v 11 Mɨkɨ kwinimieme mekateniuyeha'ani, hikɨ mekanitsutɨani metekuxatatɨ Ketsutsi kememɨyurienikekai.   
\s1 Tamamata heimana huta nɨ'ariekate  
\r (Ruk 6:13-16 – Mat 10:2-4, Mar 3:16-19, Nɨ'a 1:13)  
\p
\v 12 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana hɨritsie kaneutiyune yutanenewienike, xeitɨkari nenewieri kanipitɨakaitɨni yukakaɨyari.  
\v 13 Hikɨ 'ukatareku, yu'aurie kaniwarutahɨawe yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete, watsata kaniwaranuyeteɨxɨ tamamata heimana yuhutame, nɨ'ariekate katiniwaruterɨwa mɨkɨ:  
\v 14 Tsimuni ('arike Pekuru mɨtiterɨwaxɨ), 'Atɨrexi Tsimuni 'iwaya, Kakuwu, Wani, Piripe, Wariturume,  
\v 15 Mateu, Tumaxi, Kakuwu 'Aripeu nu'aya, Tsimuni tserutitsita mɨtitewakai,  
\v 16 Kura Kakuwu nu'aya, Kura 'Itsikariutitanaka 'arikeke miyetua.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiwaruparewi yumɨireme  
\r (Ruk 6:20-23 – Mat 5:3-12)  
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ wahamatɨa 'ukateka, makuweritsie kaniwakeni. Yumɨiretɨ hetsɨana miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete, meta yumɨiretɨ teɨteri naitsarie Kureyatsie Kerutsaremetsie memeyekɨ, hipatɨ haramara tetsita memeyekɨ Tiru 'aurie Tsiruni 'aurie,  
\v 18 mana mekaniu'axɨakaitɨni memi'enienikɨ, 'aixɨa meteheu'erietɨ memayeitɨarienikɨ kwiniya kememɨtehexeiyakai. Mɨkɨ kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene memɨwanɨkai 'aixɨa meteheu'erietɨ mepayeitɨarie,  
\v 19 teɨteri yunaitɨ mekanimayɨakukaitɨni tɨrɨkariya hetsiena mayeneikakaikɨ yunaime 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame muwarayeitɨwakai.   
\p
\v 20 Merikɨtsɨ yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete waxeiyatɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\q1 «'Aixɨa xekani'itɨarieka xeme tixaɨtɨ xemɨkatehexeiya,  
\q2 Kakaɨyari xekanexeiyani tixe'aitɨwametɨme.   
\q1
\v 21 'Aixɨa xekani'itɨarieka xeme hikɨ xemeuhakakwiku,  
\q2 xekanitihuxaikuni.  
\q1 'Aixɨa xekani'itɨarieka xeme hikɨ xemutitsuana,  
\q2 xekaniutinawekuni.   
\q1
\v 22 'Aixɨa xekani'itɨarieka xeme kepauka teɨteri memɨxe'uxiwe'erie,  
\q2 kepauka memɨkaxenaki'erie yuhetsɨa, kepauka 'axamemutiyuane xehepaɨtsita, kepauka memɨxexani'erie 'axaxemɨ'anene me'utiyuatɨ,  
\q2 Yuri Tewi hetsie xemɨtewiyakɨ.   
\p
\v 23 »Xekeneyutemamawieka waɨkawa 'iya tukaritsie, xeketeneuye'ani, waɨkawa taheima mieme xekana'iwakuni. Wa'ukiyarima yaxeikɨa mepɨwaruyuri Kakaɨyari niukametemama.   
\q1
\v 24 »Matsi xɨa'ui, xeme xemɨxikutsixi,  
\q2 'ariri yunaki'eriya xekanaye'atɨani.   
\q1
\v 25 Xɨa'ui xeme hikɨ xemɨhuxa,  
\q2 xepeuhakakwikuni.  
\q1 Xɨa'ui xeme hikɨ xemutinawe,  
\q2 xepɨyuhiwerieka xeputitsuanani.   
\q1
\v 26 Xɨa'ui xeme kepauka yunaitɨ teɨteri witsimemutiyuane xehepaɨtsita.  
\q2 Xe'ukiyarima yaxeikɨa mepɨwaruyuri Kakaɨyari niukametemama memɨte'itawakai.   
\s1 Kemɨreuyewetse memɨtatsi'aye'unie wahepaɨtsita  
\r (Ruk 6:29-30 – Mat 5:39-42)  
\p
\v 27 »Matsi mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe xeme xemɨ'enana: Xekeniwanaki'erieka mɨkɨ memɨxe'aye'unie, 'aixɨa xekeniwayurieka mɨkɨ memɨxe'uxiwe'erie,  
\v 28 mɨkɨ 'axamemutiyuane xehepaɨtsita wahepaɨtsita 'aixɨa xekeneutiyuaneni xeme, xekeneyunenewieka mɨkɨ memɨxetsewixima wahetsiemieme.  
\v 29 Kemɨ'ane 'a'aurita mɨmatsiheutiwani, ta'aurie kenawetsi tapata mɨmatsiheutiwanikɨ. Kemɨ'ane mɨmatsinawairieni 'a'ɨkari, pepɨka'ikweririeka 'akamixata mɨmatsinawairienikɨ.  
\v 30 Kemɨ'ane tixaɨtɨ mɨmatiutawawiri, ketineupitɨa, kemɨ'ane 'apini mɨmatinawairieni, pepɨka'iwiyani.  
\v 31 Kemɨtixenake, teɨteri yamemɨxeyurienikɨ xeme, kemɨtixenake xeme, mɨkɨ kanixe'inɨaritɨkamɨkɨ, yaxemɨwayurienikɨ hipame meri.   
\p
\v 32 »Xɨkate xewanaki'erieka mɨkɨ memɨxenaki'erie, ¿titakɨ 'aixɨa xetekuxaxatsiwani? 'Axateyuruwamete mekaniwanaki'erieka mɨkɨ memɨwanaki'erie.  
\v 33 Xɨkata 'aixɨa xewayurieka mɨkɨ 'aixɨa memɨxeyurie, ¿titakɨ 'aixɨa xetekuxaxatsiwani? 'Axateyuruwametetɨtɨ mɨpaɨ mepɨteyurie.  
\v 34 Xɨkata xetewaniɨtɨaka mɨkɨ kemɨ'ane memɨte'ayukatuawawe xeikɨa, ¿titakɨ 'aixɨa xetekuxaxatsiwani? 'Axateyuruwameteta mepɨteyuniɨtɨa tawari memɨte'apiniyariekakɨ.  
\v 35 Matsitsɨ xekeniwanaki'erieka mɨkɨ memɨxe'aye'unie, 'aixɨa xeketeneyurieka, xeketeneyuniɨtɨaka 'atsixekateyu'iyaritɨatɨ. Mɨpaɨ xeteyurietɨ kwini mieme xekatena'iwakuni, kemɨ'ane taheima makawe niwemama xekanihɨkɨtɨkakuni, mɨkɨ 'aixɨa pɨtiuka'iyari mɨkɨ pamɨpariyutsi memɨkateyupitɨwa wahetsiemieme, mɨkɨ 'axamemɨteyurie wahetsiemieme meta.  
\v 36 Xeketeneyukanenimayaka, xe'ukiyari kemɨtiyukanenimaya.   
\s1 Hipame wahetsie xepɨkate'ahɨpani  
\r (Ruk 6:37-42 – Mat 7:1-5)  
\p
\v 37 »Hipame wahetsie xɨka xekate'ahɨpani, xehetsieta pɨkarahɨiwani. Xɨka xekateyuxanetani, xemeta xepɨkaxanetsieka. Xɨka xekawaranutaxɨrɨwani, xemeta xepɨka'anutaxɨriyani. Xɨka xetewareuyehɨwirieka, xemeta xepɨteheuyehɨwiyarieni.  
\v 38 Xɨka xetewarini, xemeta xepɨtemikieni: 'Aixɨa ti'inɨatsiekame 'anukapɨnariekame, 'anutakatsiekame, 'anakaxɨrɨweme xepɨmikieni. Karikɨtsɨ hipame kexemɨtewaru'inɨatsiri mɨpaɨta xeme xepɨte'inɨatsiyarieni».   
\p
\v 39 Merikɨtsɨ 'ikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruta'ɨkitɨani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «¿Makɨpe ketiyɨwe menuhana xeime makɨpe? ¿Yuhutatɨ mewatixawatsie mekateheukaxɨrieni?  
\v 40 Tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame pɨkawe'eme keyuri ti'ɨkitame, peru 'aye'atɨarieme kemɨ'ane mɨti'ɨkitɨa hepaɨ timaiwetɨ kanayeimɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 41 »¿Titayari petixeiya xatsi 'a'iwa hɨxita meutawiwi, pekahe'eriwatɨ keuruwi 'ahɨxita meutawe?  
\v 42 ¿Kepaɨtɨtɨ petiyɨwe mɨpaɨ pemɨtitahɨawekɨ 'a'iwa: “Neuxei ne'iwa, nepiwaye'itieni xatsi 'ahɨxita meutawiwi”, peka'ixeiyatɨ keuruwi 'ahɨxita meutawe? Yakɨtsɨ peputaine xeikɨa. Keniwaye'iti meri mɨkɨ keuruwi 'ahɨxita meutawe, 'ana 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ peheunieretɨ pekanayeimɨkɨ pemiwaye'itirienikɨ xatsi 'a'iwa hɨxita meutawiwi.   
\s1 Kɨye kemɨtimatsiɨkɨ yu'ikwaxikɨ  
\r (Ruk 6:43-44 – Mat 7:16, 18, 20)  
\p
\v 43 »Nixewitɨ kɨyexi 'aixɨa mɨ'anene 'ikwaxi 'axa'aneneme pɨkakaxuawitɨwa, mɨkɨ meta kɨye 'axamɨ'ane 'ikwaxi 'aixɨa 'aneneme pɨkakaxuawitɨwa.  
\v 44 Xexuitɨ kɨye yu'ikwaxikɨ kanimatsiɨkɨni. Xuyatsie pɨkaka'inɨiwa piní takari, witsaxatsie pɨkaka'inɨiwa kaxie.  
\v 45 Tewi 'iti'utame tita 'aixɨa mɨti'ane yu'iyaritsie, niwayehanimɨkɨ tita 'aixɨa mɨti'ane, tewi 'axamɨtiyuriene pɨta 'iti'utame tita 'axamɨti'ane, niwayehanimɨkɨ tita 'axamɨti'ane. Karikɨ tita yu'iyaritsie mɨtihɨniyani, mɨpaɨ katinikuxatamɨkɨ.   
\s1 Tsimiyenitu 'aixɨa mɨ'ane 'axamɨ'ane  
\r (Ruk 6:47-49 – Mat 7:24-27)  
\p
\v 46 »¿Titayarikuta xeme: “Ti'aitame, Ti'aitame 'aku”, xenetekɨhɨawe, 'atsixekateyurietɨ kenemɨtixekɨhɨawe?  
\v 47 Yunaitɨ nehetsɨa memɨ'axe, neniuki memɨ'enie yametekahutɨ, kememɨ'anene nepɨtixetaxatɨani:  
\v 48 Tewi kii mutawewi hepaɨ kani'aneni, heukatewame wati'ineka, tetetsiepai netiwewieni tsimiyenituyari. 'Ana haa kaniwayeneni, kitsie kaniukexɨani, peru kaniuyutatexieni 'iwatayuitɨanike, 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ mɨwewiyakaikɨ pɨkawatayua.  
\v 49 Perutsɨ kemɨ'ane mɨnetsi'enie yakatikamietɨ, mɨkɨ xewitɨ tewi kii mutawewi hepaɨ kani'aneni, kwiepa 'akaime kaniutawewieni xeikɨa, tenariyari pɨka'utawewi. 'Ana hetsiena kaniukexɨani haa, xeimieme nekaina, karima kaniukaweni kii».   
\c 7  
\s1 Xeitsienituyari kuyaxi mɨwanɨ'a keyurimɨti'eriekai  
\r (Ruk 7:1-10 – Mat 8:5-13)  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'inɨka 'ikɨ niuki naime teɨteri me'i'enieku, Kaperunaume kaneyani.  
\v 2 Merikɨtsɨ kuya mana kaniuyeikakaitɨni xeitsienituyari kuyaxi mɨwanɨ'a, ti'uximayatame kanexeiyakaitɨni minaki'eriekai, mɨkɨ katinekuyekaitɨni kanemɨximekaitɨni.  
\v 3 Hikɨ kuya, 'u'enaka Ketsutsi hepaɨtsita, kaniwarenɨ'ani huriyutsixi teɨteriyari wa'ukiyarima memeita'inienikɨ mamiekɨ 'aixɨa reu'eriekame ti'uximayatame mayeitɨanikɨ.  
\v 4 Mɨkɨ Ketsutsi hetsɨa me'u'axɨaka kwini mieme mekateni'iniekaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —'Aixɨa kaniyɨmɨkɨ pemeiparewienikɨ, hetsiena katininakeni:  
\v 5 Kataninaki'erieka tanaime tame, tuki kataniutawewirieni yɨkɨmana.   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ Ketsutsi wa'utɨma kaneyani. Yatewa 'umiekaku, kuya yuhamikuma kaniwarutanɨ'ani mɨpaɨ memɨte'itahɨawekɨ:  
\p —Ti'aitame pepɨkati'a'uxitɨaka, ne 'aixɨa nepɨka'ane 'ekɨ pematahanikɨ nekita.  
\v 7 Meta 'ayumieme matsi 'ahetsɨa nepɨkahetɨa nekɨmana, 'aixɨa neka'aneme nene'erietɨ 'ahetsɨa nemɨmiekɨ. Peru 'ekɨ xeiniukiyari xɨka yapehetayɨni, 'aixɨa pɨtika'erieni ti'uximayatame.  
\v 8 Netsɨ nekatini'aitɨarieka nekuyatɨtɨ meta kuyaxi nepɨtiwa'aitɨwame. Xɨka mɨpaɨ netitahɨawe xeime: “Kenemie”, mɨkɨ pɨyemie, xeimeta xɨka mɨpaɨ netitahɨawe: “Kenaye'a”, mɨkɨ 'akanayeimɨkɨ. Xɨka mɨpaɨ netitahɨawe nehetsɨa mieme ti'uximayatame: “'Ipaɨ ketineyurieneni”, mɨpaɨ pɨtiyurieneni.   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Ketsutsi 'i'enieka niukieya, kaniuhɨxiyani, ta'aurie 'aweka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teɨteri memeweiyakai:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, 'ixaheritsixi watsata 'ikɨ hepaɨ 'aneme nepɨkahetaxeiyawe yuri ti'eriekame.   
\p
\v 10 Hikɨ mɨkɨ memenɨ'arie kepauka memakunuaxɨa kitana me'u'axɨaka, mekaneitaxeiya ti'uximayatame 'aixɨa reu'eriekame.   
\s1 Ketsutsi wiura nu'aya kemɨranukuketɨa  
\p
\v 11 Merikɨtsɨ 'arike kaneyani kiekari Nahini mɨrakutewatsie paitɨ, hetsɨana miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mekaniteɨtakaitɨni, hipatɨta teɨteri yumɨiretɨ.  
\v 12 Kiekari kitenie heutahaximekaku, mɨki kaniwayekweiyani, temaikɨ mumɨɨkai puyuxewikai xeikɨa maamaya pɨwiuratɨkai, kɨnaya meripaitɨ pukumawerekai. Kiekatari yumɨiretɨ mekaniteɨtakaitɨni.  
\v 13 Hikɨ Ti'aitame 'ixeiyatɨ kanitinenimayata, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Pepɨka'utatsuakani.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ mana 'uyaka mɨki kakunieya kaniumayɨani. Mɨki kwekwewemete mekaniti'uni. Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Temaikɨ 'aku, kenanukukexi nepaine.   
\p
\v 15 Tewi mɨmɨkikai kananukuyerɨni kaniutiniutɨyani, hikɨ Ketsutsi kaniyetuani maamaya hetsɨa.  
\v 16 Hikɨ yunaitɨ mekaniutimamani, 'aixɨa mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Kakaɨyari niukameya mɨtɨrɨkaɨye tatsata kaninuani, Kakaɨyari kaninuani kanitsutɨani tatsiparewietɨ yuteɨterima.   
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ kemɨtiuyuri kanikuxaxatsiwakaitɨni naitsarie Kureya kwieyaritsie meta 'auriena mamanetɨkatsie.   
\s1 Ketsutsi meta Wani Ti'ɨyame hetsɨa miemete  
\r (Ruk 7:18-35 – Mat 11:2-19)  
\p
\v 18 Merikɨtsɨ Wani hetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete Wani mekateniutaxatɨani naime kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita. Hikɨ 'ana Wani waruta'inieka yuhutame yuhetsɨa miemete,  
\v 19 Ti'aitame hetsɨa kaniwarenɨ'ani mɨpaɨ memɨte'ita'iwawiyakɨ:  
\p —¿'Ekɨ petihɨkɨ kemɨ'ane 'umamienikekai, nutsu xeime 'akuxi tepɨtakwewieka?   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ hetsɨana me'u'axɨaka mɨkɨ, mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Wani Ti'ɨyame 'ahetsɨa katanetanɨ'ani mɨpaɨ temɨmateta'iwawiyakɨ: “¿'Ekɨ petihɨkɨ kemɨ'ane 'umamiekai, nutsu xeime 'akuxi tepɨtakwewieka?”   
\p
\v 21 'Ana mana kwitɨwa Ketsutsi yuwaɨkawame 'aixɨa katiniwaruka'eritɨani, mɨkɨ kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene memɨwarexeiyakai, hipame meta waɨkawa kwiniyakɨ memɨ'uximatɨariekai, meta yuwaɨkawame memɨkaheunenierekai kaniwaranutanieritɨaxɨani.  
\v 22 Hikɨ memeyenɨ'arie mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xekenehu, xeketenetaxatɨa Wani tita xemɨte'uxei tita xemɨte'u'eni hepaɨtsita: Memɨkaheuneniere meheunenieretɨ kememɨte'akɨka, huriekate kememɨte'anuku'uwe, mɨkɨ nawi kwiniyayari memexeiya me'itiyatɨ kememɨte'akɨka, memɨkaheu'enana meheu'enanatɨ kememɨte'akɨka, mɨkite kememɨte'anuku'uitɨariwa, tixaɨtɨ memɨkatehexeiya niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kememɨtekuxaxatɨariwa.  
\v 23 Mɨkɨ meta, 'aixɨa kani'itɨarieka kemɨ'ane mɨkakunuani nekɨmana.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ Wani hetsɨa miemete mehekɨneku, Ketsutsi kanitsutɨani tiwakuxaxatɨwatɨ teɨteri Wani hepaɨtsita mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «¿Tita xetehekuxei makumawetsie? ¿Haka 'ekakɨ 'uyuaneme xeteheku'ixɨari? Tixaɨ xɨari.  
\v 25 ¿Kamɨtsɨ tita xeteheku'ixɨari? ¿Xiku 'ixuriki mɨyumeni manakatɨkɨ xetehekuxei? Nekatixaɨtsietɨ. Matsi mɨkɨ witsimɨ'anene memanakatɨtɨka xikutsixi wahepaɨ memɨyɨa, mɨkɨ te'aitamete wakiita mepayetei.  
\v 26 Kamɨtsɨ, ¿tita yemekɨ xeteheku'ixɨari? ¿Kakaɨyari niukameya xeteheku'ixɨari? Huu, mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, Kakaɨyari niukameya xepekuxei, yemekɨ Kakaɨyari niukameya keyuri hipatɨ.  
\v 27 'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni 'utɨarika mexaxata mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\q1 »“Kamɨ, ne neniuki tuayame nekananunɨ'amɨkɨ 'ahɨxie paitɨ,  
\q2 mikuha'aritɨanikɨ 'ahuye pekanuawekaku 'akuxi”.   
\m
\v 28 Mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, 'akuxi pɨkatinuiwawe nixewitɨ Wani hepaɨ timariwetɨ, peru matsi tewi tixaɨtɨ mɨkatihɨkɨ Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie, Wani reuyeta katinimariweni».   
\p
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ mete'u'enanaka, yunaitɨ teɨteri, meta kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tewawamete yunaitɨ Wani me'u'enieka mekatenihekɨatakaitɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita heitserie kemɨrexeiya, kepauka memuka'ɨyarie Wani hetsɨa.  
\v 30 Peru paritseutsixi meta hipatɨ 'inɨari niukiyari memɨmate, mɨkɨ mekanitixani'erieni Kakaɨyari kemɨtiyurienikekai wahetsiemieme, Wani hetsɨa mepɨka'uka'ɨyarie.   
\p
\v 31 «'Ayumieme nepaine, ¿Tita 'inɨari netitaxata hikɨ miemete teɨteri wahetsiemieme?  
\v 32 Tɨɨri wahepaɨ mekani'aneneni kiekari hixɨapa memɨtitei mɨpaɨ memɨte'uyuhiwiwa:  
\q1 »“Tepɨxekɨrautawiyakai,  
\q2 xemeta xepɨkate'ukanei.  
\q1 Hiwerika kwikariyari teputakwikaxɨ,  
\q2 xemeta xepɨka'utitsua”.   
\m
\v 33 Wani Ti'ɨyame kaninuani, paa kakwa'atɨ kaxie winuyari kaye'etɨ, xemeta mɨpaɨ xeputiyuanekai: “Kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane kaninɨka”.  
\v 34 Neta Yuri Tewi nehɨkɨtɨtɨ nemunua netikwa'atɨ meta netiye'etɨ, mɨpaɨta xeputiyuane: “'Ikɨ tewi 'ikwaikɨ xeikɨa pɨyɨane, winukɨ xeikɨa pɨyɨane, pɨwahamiku mɨkɨ kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tewawamete meta 'axateyuruwamete”.  
\v 35 Peru yunaitɨ yurikɨ memɨtemaiwawe kememɨteyurie kanimatsiɨkɨni heitserie kemɨrexeiya Kakaɨyari timaiwetɨ».   
\s1 'Ukaratsi 'axatiyuruwame Ketsutsi witsimu'ɨa kemɨtiukawiri  
\p
\v 36 Merikɨtsɨ xewitɨ paritseu kanita'inieni hetsɨana mɨtikwanikɨ, paritseu kiita heutahaka mana kanayerɨni.  
\v 37 Hikɨ 'uka mana mɨkiekametɨkai mɨmariwakai 'axamɨtiyuruwametɨkai, tiutamarieka paritseu kiita kename Ketsutsi hayekatei, kaninuani tete puteyuyari 'ahanatɨ witsimu'ɨa hɨneme.  
\v 38 Ketateya 'aurie kaniutakeni 'utatsuatɨ, 'ukaiya kanikaxɨrɨwekaitɨni ketateyatsie kanitihawiyakaitɨni, meta yɨkɨpakɨ kanitiwatsiɨxa, metatsiere kaniku'itsewekaitɨni ketateyatsie meta witsimu'ɨa kanitiwiriwakaitɨni.   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ 'iya paritseu mita'ini mɨpaɨ katiniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni yu'iyaritsie: «Kari 'ikɨ xɨka yurikɨ Kakaɨyari niukameyatɨni, pimaikakeyu 'ikɨ 'uka mikumaɨwa, kemɨtiyuriene pɨtimaikakeyu, 'axatiyuruwame kemɨtihɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 40 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Tsimuni 'aku, 'etsiwa nepɨmatitaxatɨani.  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ tita'ei:  
\p —Tita 'aku, Ti'ɨkitame.   
\p
\v 41 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Merikɨtsɨ heiwa kaneuyewekaitɨni yuhutatɨ memɨte'ipitɨanikɨ xeime, meripai kemɨtiwaruniɨtɨa. Xewitɨ 'auxɨwime tsienituyari 'inɨariyari kani'ɨitɨanikekaitɨni, xewitɨta huta tewiyari heimana tamamata 'inɨariyari kani'ɨitɨanikekaitɨni.  
\v 42 Tixaɨtɨ memɨkatehexeiyakaikɨ memɨte'ipitɨanikɨ, mɨkɨ katiniwareuyehɨwirieni yuhutame. Merikɨte, ¿kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ matsi waɨkawa pɨnaki'erie tewi mɨtiwareuyehɨwiri?   
\p
\v 43 Tsimuni mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Xɨari kemɨ'ane matsi waɨkawamekɨ mɨreuyehɨwiyarie, mɨkɨ matsi waɨkawa kaninaki'eriekamɨkɨ.  
\p Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Heitseriemekɨ pepɨti'akuhɨawe.   
\p
\v 44 Hikɨ ta'aurie 'aweka, 'ukaratsi 'uxeiyaka, mɨpaɨ Tsimuni katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Keneuxeiya 'ikɨ 'ukaratsi? Ne 'ahetsɨa nenuaku 'akiita, 'ekɨ haa pepɨkanetsi'uhanitɨa neketate nemɨtihauxinikɨ, mɨkɨ pɨta yu'ukaikɨ kanitihawiyatɨyani neketate, meta yɨkɨpatekɨ kanitiwatsiɨxa.  
\v 45 'Ekɨ penetsitapatɨ pepɨkanetsi'utawaɨritɨa, mɨkɨ pɨta ne'atahaku hikɨ 'akuxi pɨkatihayewa netsiku'itsewetɨ neketatetsie.  
\v 46 'Ekɨ pepɨkanetsi'ukawiri nemu'utsie, mɨkɨ pɨta witsimu'ɨa pɨnetsi'utiwiri neketatetsie.  
\v 47 'Ayumieme nepɨmatikɨhɨawe, kemɨtiyukanaki'erie kanimatsiɨkɨni waɨkawa kemɨreuyehɨwiyarie 'axatiuyurieka. Kemɨ'ane 'etsiwa xeikɨa mɨreuyehɨwiyarie, mɨkɨ 'etsiwa xeikɨa katiniyukanaki'erieka.   
\p
\v 48 Hikɨ 'ukaratsi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Axakepemɨtiuyuri pepɨreuyehɨwiyarieri.   
\p
\v 49 Hikɨ hipatɨ 'auriena mematekai mɨpaɨ yu'iyaritsie mekateniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni: «¿Kemɨ'ane pɨhɨkɨ 'ikɨ mɨtiwareuyehɨwirie 'axakememɨte'uyuri?»   
\p
\v 50 Peru Ketsutsi 'ukaratsi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Yuri pemɨtiuta'erikɨ peputawikweitsitɨarie, 'a'iyaritsie peka'uximatɨarietɨ kenemie.   
\c 8  
\s1 Ti'iwiwame niukiyari  
\r (Ruk 8:4-15 – Mat 13:2-23, Mar 4:1-20)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'ariketa, Ketsutsi kanikuyeikakaitɨni kiekari 'emɨyeyeutsie meta 'etsimɨyeyeutsie, kanikuxatanekaitɨni niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne, tiwakuxaxatɨwatɨ kemɨti'ane Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie. Tamamata heimana yuhutatɨ hamatɨana mekaniu'uwakaitɨni,  
\v 2 hipatɨta 'ukari 'aixɨa meteheu'erietɨ memayeitɨarie kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨteyurie mewarunɨku, meta metekukuyekaku: xewitɨ mɨkɨ Mariya Mararatanaka katinitewakaitɨni, meripai muxɨnarie kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene me'inɨkaku 'atahutatɨ,  
\v 3 xewitɨta Wana katinitewakaitɨni Tsutsa mɨ'ɨyayatɨkai, mɨkɨ Tsutsa mɨhɨritɨariekai Herurexi mɨtimikwanikɨ, xewitɨta Tsutsana, hipatɨta yumɨiretɨ, mɨkɨ mekaniwaparewiekaitɨni tita memɨteheuxeiyakaikɨ.   
\p
\v 4 Merikɨtsɨ yumɨiretɨ teɨteri hetsɨana mekaniyuxeɨriekaitɨni, mɨireme kiekaritetsie meheyekɨneka, hikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruti'ɨkitɨatɨyani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\v 5 «Ti'iwiwame kanayeyani 'imɨari ka'iwienike. Merikɨtsɨ 'imɨari 'iwienekaku, hipatɨ huye tetsita kaniukaxɨrieni, hikɨ kaniutiketsinarieni, meta wikixi mekanikuxɨni.  
\v 6 Hipatɨta mutetexiyatsie kaniukaxɨrieni, 'utineka kaniutiwani mɨka'akuhawirekaikɨ.  
\v 7 Hipatɨta xuyatsata kaniukaxɨrieni, hamatɨana 'utinexɨaka xuya kanenukanani.  
\v 8 Hipatɨta kaniukaxɨrieni 'aixɨa mɨraku'anetsie, 'utineka kaniutixuawere xeitsienituyari payeixɨa».  
\p Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka karima mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Xewitɨ netɨ mu'enaxɨ, ke'u'ena».   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ hetsɨana miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mekaniku'iwawiyakaitɨni keri haine mɨkɨ 'ɨxatsi.  
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Xeme xekanipitɨarieka xemimaikakɨ tita mɨtiuti'awietsiekai, xemɨtemaikakɨ Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie timieme, hipatɨ pɨta 'ɨxatsikɨ xeikɨa mekanipitɨarieka,  
\q1 »“para meheunenieretɨ memɨka'ixeiyakɨ,  
\q2 meheu'enanatɨ, memɨka'i'enienikɨ”.   
\p
\v 11 »'Ɨxatsikɨ 'ipaɨ katinimatsiɨkɨni: 'Imɨari, Kakaɨyari niukieya kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 12 Huye tetsita miemete, mɨkɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni memɨ'enana, peru kwitɨwa kani'axeni Kauyumarie, wa'iyaritsie kaninawani niuki kapa me'utawikweitsitɨarienikɨ yuri mete'uta'eriekaxɨame.  
\v 13 Makutetexiyatsie miemete, mɨkɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni memitanaki'eri niuki meyutemamawietɨ me'u'enanaka, peru mɨkɨ mepɨkahananatɨka. Yatewimekɨ yuri mekateni'erieka, peru kepauka memɨta'inɨatsienitsie mekatenikuhayeikawani.  
\v 14 Xuyatsata mukaxɨri, mɨkɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni memɨ'enana, peru 'iyaritɨarika, tuminikɨ, hikɨ mieme tukari naki'eriyayakɨ meyɨatɨ mekananukanaka, meta mepɨka'aye'axɨani.  
\v 15 'Aixɨa mɨraku'anetsie miemete, mɨkɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni niukitsie memɨtewiya 'aixɨa 'iyarikɨ meyuwaɨriyatɨ me'u'enanaka. Mɨkɨ mekaniutixuxuawereni mete'uka'eniwatɨ.   
\s1 Kɨxeme  
\p
\v 16 »Kɨxeme 'utaiyame pɨka'iti'awieta, xarita pɨkaheikayeni, 'utatɨa pɨkaheitayeni, matsi wapaitɨ kaneitiyemɨkɨ, mɨkɨ memɨwatahaxɨaxime hekɨariyaya memɨxeiyakɨ.  
\v 17 Karikɨ naitɨ tita mɨti'awietsie katinahekɨarimɨkɨ, meta naitɨ tita mɨti'awietsiekai katinitamariwamɨkɨ.  
\v 18 'Ayumieme, yemekɨ xekeneu'enana. Kemɨ'ane tixaɨtɨ mɨrexeiya, tawari matsi pɨtimikieni, kemɨ'ane mɨkarexeiya, tsepa 'etsiwa rexeiyame muyu'erie mɨkɨ katininawaiyariemɨkɨ».   
\s1 Ketsutsi 'iwamama meta warutsieya  
\r (Ruk 8:19-21 – Mat 12:46-50, Mar 3:31-35)  
\p
\v 19 Merikɨtsɨ maamaya meta 'iwamama mekaniu'axɨani hetsɨana, mekaniyutatexieni me'itahɨaweke, teɨteri yuwaɨkawatɨ memayetekaikɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawarieni:  
\p —'Amaama meta 'a'iwama takwa mekaneti'uka mematsixeiyakutɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Peru mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —'Ikɨ Kakaɨyari niukieya memɨ'enie yamemɨtekahu, mɨkɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni nemaama meta ne'iwama.   
\s1 Ketsutsi 'eka kemɨreunuitɨa  
\r (Ruk 8:22-25 – Mat 8:23-27, Mar 4:36-41)  
\p
\v 22 Merikɨtsɨ heiwa kanuwatsie kanikayerɨni, hetsɨana miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wahamatɨa. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Harakuna 'anutaɨye tepanukɨne.  
\p Hikɨ mekanayekɨne,  
\v 23 hapa me'uhukaku Ketsutsi kaneukuni. Hikɨ 'eka kaniuyutawewieni tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ wiyerimatɨ harakuna hetsie, hikɨ kanuwatsie haa kanitahɨnirɨmekaitɨni meta mekanikayunirɨmekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ mekanenutahɨtɨani mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, Ti'ɨkitame, tepɨkayunirɨme.  
\p Ketsutsi 'anukukeka kanitatieni 'eka hamewari meta, hikɨ kaneunuani, kayuwatɨ kaniutamare.   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teyu'ɨkitɨwamete:  
\p —¿Keri yuri xete'erie?  
\p Meheumamatɨ mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni mɨpaɨ meteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ: «¿Ketsɨ pɨpaikɨ 'ikɨ, pɨtiwa'aitɨa 'eka meta hamewari haa, yamepɨtekahu kemaine?»   
\s1 Kakaɨyarixi kememɨte'iwiyakai katarenatanaka  
\r (Ruk 8:26-39 – Mat 8:28-34, Mar 5:1-20)  
\p
\v 26 Hikɨ Katarenatsixi wakwieyaritsie mekaneta'axɨani kanuwatsie meyetetɨ, Karereya 'anutaɨyetsie.  
\v 27 Heukakeximekaku kwiepa, tewi nenukunake mana mɨkiekametɨkai, kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene meminɨkai mɨixa. 'Ayumieme mɨkɨ 'ixurikite pɨka'anakatɨkɨkai, kiita pɨka'ayekatei, matsi teukiyatsata kaniuyeikakaitɨni.  
\v 28 Ketsutsi 'uxeiyaka, 'utahiwaka kanatiweni hetɨana mɨpaɨ tiuhiwatɨ:  
\p —¿Kepeneti'uximatɨa Ketsutsi, Kakaɨyari taheima makawe pemɨnu'aya? Nepɨmatsiwawirie kwerietɨ, penɨkahɨrixɨa netsi'uximatɨaka.   
\p
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni mɨkɨ, Ketsutsi mɨtita'aitɨakɨ kakaɨyari mɨka'itiya, mixɨnakɨ tewi. Mɨixa wiyari kaniwiyakaitɨni kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane, tewi nanutahɨiwakaitɨni tepɨakɨ 'akuwietɨ yumamatsie yɨ'ɨkatsie, kanititekekaitɨni tepɨa karenayari meta kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane kaneiwitɨkɨkaitɨni makumawetsie paitɨ.   
\p
\v 30 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Kepetitewa 'ekɨ?  
\p 'Iya yumɨiretɨ kakaɨyarixi meminɨkaikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xeiwaxayari nekatinitewaka.   
\p
\v 31 Mɨkɨ kwerietɨ waɨkawamekɨ mekaniwawiriekaitɨni Ketsutsi mɨkawatanɨ'anikɨ meukatewatsie memɨkayehukɨ.  
\v 32 Merikɨtsɨ mana hura yumɨiretɨ tuixuri mekatenikwatɨwekaitɨni yemuritɨa, mekanitawawirieni kakaɨyarixi mɨpaɨ mɨtiwapitɨanikɨ memɨwatiwiyakɨ tuixuri. Mɨpaɨ yakatiniwarupitɨani.  
\v 33 Hikɨ kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene me'ixɨnaka tewi, mekaniwarutiwiya tuixuri, hikɨ tuixuri yunaitɨ mekaniutinautsa. 'Axa'anekɨa mekaneukanautsaxɨani, harakunapa mekaneuxɨrieni.   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ tuixuri wahɨwemete me'uneniereka kemɨtiuyɨ mekaniyuta'unaxɨani, kiekaritsie mekatenikuxatakaitɨni kiekari 'aurie meta,  
\v 35 mana mekaneyekɨne me'ixeiyake kemɨtiuyɨ. Ketsutsi hetsɨa me'u'axɨaka tewi mekaniutaxeiya kakaɨyarixi memixɨnaxɨ. 'Aixɨa reukemaritɨ Ketsutsi hetɨa kaniukateitɨni heuyumarietɨ, hikɨ mekaniutimamani.  
\v 36 Hikɨ memunenierixɨ mekateniwarutaxatɨani kemɨtiutawikweitsitɨarie tewi kakaɨyarixi meminɨkai.  
\v 37 Hikɨ yunaitɨ Katarenatsixi wakwietsie memɨtamakai meyumɨiretɨ mekanitawawirieni mana mayeyanikɨ, kwinimieme memɨtemamakaikɨ. Ketsutsi kanuwatsie kayerɨka kaneyani yu'utɨma.   
\p
\v 38 Hikɨ 'iya tewi kakaɨyarixi memixɨnaxɨ kanitawawirieni hamatɨana mɨkuyeikanikɨ, matsi Ketsutsi kanitateutɨani mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:   
\p
\v 39 —'Akie kenemie, mana ketiniwaretaxatɨa naime Kakaɨyari kemɨmatsi'uyuri.  
\p Kaneyani naitsarie kiekaritsie tikuxatatɨ kemɨtitawikweitsitɨa Ketsutsi.   
\s1 Kairu nu'aya meta 'uka Ketsutsi 'ɨkarieya mumayɨa  
\r (Ruk 8:40-56 – Mat 9:18-26, Mar 5:22-43)  
\p
\v 40 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi 'anutaɨye heta'aku, yumɨiretɨ teɨteri mekanitawaɨritɨani me'ikwewietɨ.  
\v 41 Hikɨ tewi mana kaninuani Kairu titewatɨ, tuki mɨhɨritɨarie kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni. Ketsutsi hetɨa 'utihɨximakeka waɨriyarika kanitawawirieni kiena mɨmiekɨ.  
\v 42 Xeime xeikɨa kanexeiyakaitɨni yuniwe 'ukatɨme, tamamata heimana huta wiyari yakɨtɨtɨ hɨkame, kanemɨximekaitɨni.  
\p Merikɨtsɨ 'ayeyaku yumɨiretɨ teɨteri mekanitsaipɨnakaitɨni.  
\v 43 Hikɨ mana kaniuyeikakaitɨni watsata, 'uka mɨtikuyekai tamamata heimana huta wiyari mɨyuriekai xuriyaya kaheunuawekaku, teyu'uayemawamete wahetsɨa yupiini katiniutixɨtɨakaitɨni naime, nixewitɨ pɨkayɨwekai menayehɨanikɨ.  
\v 44 Mɨkɨ 'ahurawa kaniuyani waritana 'uyemietɨ kanimayɨani 'ɨkarieya putuniyaritsie, hikɨ yapauka kaneunuani xuriyaya.   
\p
\v 45 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —¿Kepaikɨ pɨnetsi'umayɨa?  
\p Yunaitɨ meyuku'imawakaku, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni Pekuru:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, yunaitɨ teɨteri 'a'aurie mepɨyukuxeɨri mepɨmatsitsaipɨna, ¿kepai pɨnetsi'umayɨa peraine?   
\p
\v 46 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xewitɨ pɨnetsi'umayɨa. Tɨrɨkariya nehetsie payene yanepɨretima.   
\p
\v 47 Hikɨ 'uka yatimaitɨ 'awie mɨkayɨanekaikɨ, 'utayɨyɨakatɨ kaninuani, hetɨana 'atiweka yunaime teɨteri wahɨrɨpa kanitaxatɨani kemɨtimayɨa meta yapauka kemɨranayehɨiya.   
\p
\v 48 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Neniwe, yuri pemɨti'eriekɨ 'aixɨa pereu'erietɨ pepatɨa. 'A'iyaritsie peka'uximatɨarietɨ kenemie.   
\p
\v 49 Merikɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ 'utainekaku 'akuxi, xewitɨ tuki mɨhɨritɨarie kie meyetɨa mana kaninuani mɨpaɨ titahɨaweke tuki mɨhɨritɨarie:  
\p —'Ari 'aniwe kanemɨni yemekɨ. Ti'ɨkitame pepɨkati'uxitɨaka.   
\p
\v 50 Hikɨ Ketsutsi 'u'enaka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Pepɨkaheumaka, yuri ketineuta'eri xeikɨa, kanitawikweitsitɨariemɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 51 Hikɨ Kepauka Ketsutsi Kairu kiita meutaha, hipame pɨkawarupitɨa hamatɨana memeutahaxɨanikɨ mɨwayekateitsie, Pekuru, Wani meta Kakuwu xeikɨa, 'ɨimari paapaya meta maamaya xeikɨa kaniwarupitɨani.  
\v 52 Yunaitɨ mekaniutitsuanakaitɨni mekane'eriwakaitɨni meyuhiwerietɨ. Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xepɨka'utitsuanani, pɨkamɨki, matsi pukutsu.   
\p
\v 53 Hikɨ mɨkɨ mekani'atsekaitɨni metemaitɨ yeme mɨmɨkikaikɨ.  
\v 54 Peru mɨkɨ mamayatsie kawiereka, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ɨimari 'aku, kenanukukexi.   
\p
\v 55 Hikɨ 'iyarieya kaninuani, yapauka kananukukeni. Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aita mɨtimikienikɨ.  
\v 56 Hikɨ 'ukiyarimama mekaniuhɨxiyani, peru Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe, nixeime tɨma memɨkatehaxaxatɨwanikɨ kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita.   
\c 9  
\s1 Tamamata heimana yuhutame kemɨtiwareutanɨ'axɨa teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete  
\r (Ruk 9:3-5,7-9 – Mat 10:9-15, 14:1-2, Mar 6:8-11, 14-16)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ warukuxeɨrieka tamamata heimana yuhutame, tɨrɨkariya kaniwarupitɨani meta heitserie memexeiyanikɨ kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene yunaime wahepaɨtsita meta kwiniyakɨ 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame memɨwarayeitɨwanikɨ.  
\v 2 Kaniwareutanɨ'axɨani memɨtekuxatanikɨ kemɨti'ane Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie, meta 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame memɨwarayeitɨwanikɨ teɨteri.  
\v 3 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Tixaɨ xepɨkatehetɨkɨni huyeta mieme: mumuxi, xerai, 'inɨa, tumini, huta kamixayari xepɨka'anakatɨkɨni meta.  
\v 4 Hakewa kiita xemeye'axɨani, muwa xekeneyuhayewani 'atsita kepaukake xemɨyehu.  
\v 5 Hakewa xemɨkahetanaki'eriwa, mɨkɨ kiekaritsie xe'ayekɨneme, tumuanari xekeneukatsixɨa yu'ɨkatetsie xemɨtewatahekɨatɨanikɨ mana kiekatari wahetsie kemɨrahɨiwani».  
\v 6 Mɨkɨ meheutayeixɨaka kiekaritetsie mekaniku'uwakaitɨni metekuxatatɨ 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame mewarayeitɨwatɨ tekwikwikate naitsarie.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ Herurexi mɨhɨritɨariekai mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie mɨti'aitanikɨ, mɨkɨ katiniutamarieni kemɨtiyurienekai Ketsutsi naime. 'Atsipɨkatimaikai kemɨtiyurienikekai hipatɨ mɨpaɨ memaitɨkateikɨ kename waniu Wani mɨkite watsata 'anukuketɨarie,  
\v 8 hipatɨta kename 'Eriyaxi matsiɨkɨtɨ 'atɨa, hipatɨta kename xewitɨ 'anukuke meripai miemete Kakaɨyari niukametemama.  
\v 9 Perutsɨ Herurexi mɨpaɨ kanainekaitɨni: «Wani mu'uya nanutiwitekieni yanetiuta'aitaku ne. ¿Peru kepɨpaikɨ 'ikɨ hepaɨtsitana mɨya 'anuyɨneme nemɨ'enie?» Nixeiyamɨkɨkaitɨni Ketsutsi.   
\s1 'Auxɨwime miriyari kemɨtiwarumi  
\r (Ruk 9:10-17 – Mat 14:13-21, Mar 6:32-44, Wa 6:5-13)  
\p
\v 10 Merikɨtsɨ nɨ'ariekate me'u'axɨaka, Ketsutsi naime mekateniutaxatɨani kememɨteheyuri. Hikɨ mɨkɨ warawitɨtɨ kaneyani yɨhɨkɨame kiekari Wetsaira mɨrakutewa 'aurie makumawetsie.  
\v 11 Peru teɨteri yamete'utamarieka mekanenukuweiya. Mɨkɨ waranunakeka katiniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aita hepaɨtsita. Meta 'aixɨa meteheu'eriekame kaniwarayeitɨani kemɨ'ane memɨteheuyehɨakai.   
\p
\v 12 Hikɨ tau 'akayunirɨmekaku tamamata heimana yuhutatɨ hetsɨana meyukuxeɨrieka mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Keniwarutateutɨari teɨteri, 'ahurawa memɨyehukɨ kiekarite 'emɨyeyeu 'etsimɨyeyeutsie muwa memeyehenikɨ 'ikwai memekaxeiyakɨ, 'ena makumawetsie tekaniu'uwani.   
\p
\v 13 'Iya mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xeme pɨta xeketeniwarumikwa.  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Waɨkawa 'ikwai tepɨkahexeiya, paa 'auxɨwime meta tsapari yuhutame xeikɨa, mexɨka hɨrixɨa 'ikwai tenanaiyuni 'ikɨ teɨteri yunaime wahetsiemieme.  
\v 14 'Auxɨwime miriyari yakɨtɨtɨ mekaniyupaɨmekaitɨni 'ukitsi.  
\p Peru Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:  
\p —Yaxeketeniwarutahɨawi memɨkuyaxixɨanikɨ huta tewiyari heimana tamamata meyupapaɨmetɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniuyurieni, yunaime mepɨwareukuyatsaxɨa.  
\v 16 Hikɨ 'enu'ɨka paa 'auxɨwime meta tsapari yuhutame, taheima heutinieretɨ pamɨpariyutsi Kakaɨyari kaniupitɨani. Hikɨ 'ititaratɨ kaniwata'ɨitɨwakaitɨni teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete memɨwamikwanikɨ teɨteri.  
\v 17 Yunaitɨ mekateniukwani mekaniutihuxani, tarimeyari kaniukuxeɨriyani manuyuhayewaxɨ, tamamata heimana huta tsikɨiwitiyari paɨmetɨ kanayani.   
\s1 Pekuru kemɨtiuyutahekɨataxɨ Ketsutsi hetsie tiwiyatɨ  
\r (Ruk 9:18-20, 22-27 – Mat 16:13-16, 21-28, Mar 8:27-29, 31–9:1)  
\p
\v 18 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi kaniyunenewiekaitɨni yuxaɨta, teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mana me'u'uwakaku, mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Teɨteri kemetekuxata kemɨ'ane nepɨhɨkɨ ne?   
\p
\v 19 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Hipatɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuaneni, kename Wani Ti'ɨyame pehɨkɨ, hipatɨta kename 'Eriyaxi pehɨkɨ, hipatɨta kename xewitɨ Kakaɨyari niukameya meripai miemete pehɨkɨ pemanukuke.   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ mɨpaɨta katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Xemete kexe'utiyuane, kemɨ'ane nepɨyɨane ne?  
\p Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Kɨritsitu Kakaɨyari hetsɨa mieme.   
\p
\v 21 Ketsutsi kwinimieme katiniwaruhɨritɨani, xeime memɨkatehaxaxatɨwanikɨ 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita.  
\v 22 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Kaneuyeweka 'akuxi ne Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa waɨkawa nemɨtikwinekɨ, ta'ukiyarima, mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete, meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitamete mekanenitixani'eriekuni. Kaneuyeweka nemɨmierieni, meta nemanukukeni hairieka tukaritsie.   
\p
\v 23 Mɨpaɨta katiniwakuxaxatɨwakaitɨni yunaime:  
\p —Tewi xɨka yuwaɨriyani nehamatɨa muyeikanikɨ, ketihayewani kemɨtinake yuhetsiemieme tiyurienetɨ, keyuwaɨriyani tukarikɨ tsepa kuruxitsie mumierie, nehetsie ketiwiyani.  
\v 24 Kemɨ'ane yutukari mɨwikweitsitɨamɨkɨ kanitatɨmaiyamɨkɨ, peru kemɨ'ane yutukari mɨtatɨmaiya nehetsiemieme, mɨkɨ kanitawikweitsitɨamɨkɨ.  
\v 25 ¿Tewi naime kwiepa mɨtixuawe xɨka ra'iwake, tita ra'iwakeyu xɨka yutatɨmaiya meta xɨka yuka'una yuxaɨta?  
\v 26 Kemɨ'ane mɨnetsitewiya mitewiya neniuki, neta Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa nepitewiyani 'iya kepauka nemunuani nemariwetɨ, ne'ukiyari hepaɨ witsine'anetɨ, niuki tuayamete memɨpatsie Kakaɨyaritsie mieme wahamatɨa.  
\v 27 Meta, yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, hipatɨ 'ena memu'uwa mepɨkakwini mexi mekanenieriwawe Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aita.   
\s1 Yɨkɨ tiyuxexeiyatɨ kemɨratɨa  
\r (Ruk 9:28-36 – Mat 17:1-8, Mar 9:2-8)  
\p
\v 28 Merikɨtsɨ 'inɨka 'ikɨ niuki, 'atahaika tukari yakɨtɨtɨ 'anukayaku, yemuritsie kanitiyune yutanenewienike, Pekuru, Wani, Kakuwu warawitɨtɨ.  
\v 29 Hikɨ yunenewiekaku yuhɨxie yɨkɨ tiyuxexeiyatɨ kanayani, 'ixurikiteya tuxatɨ xawawatɨtɨ kanayani.  
\v 30 Hikɨ yuhutatɨ 'ukitsi hamatɨana mekateniutixatatɨkɨne ―Muitsexi meta 'Eriyaxi― mekanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni.  
\v 31 Witsi meteyuxexeiyatɨ Ketsutsi hepaɨ mekatenikuxatakaitɨni kemɨtiyemiekai, kemɨraye'anikekai Kerutsareme hetsie.  
\v 32 Merikɨtsɨ Pekuru hipatɨta hamatɨana memu'uwakai yunaitɨ mekanikutsukaitɨni, kwini mieme mekateneukutsikukaitɨni, me'anutaneniereka mekanixeiya witsi'aneme, 'ukitsi mekaniwaruxeiya yuhutame 'auriena meti'ukame.  
\v 33 Mɨkɨ Ketsutsi meku'eiriximekaku, Pekuru mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p ―Ti'ɨkitame 'aixɨa kani'aneni 'ena temu'uwakɨ. Hikɨmɨ haika xamaruyari tepɨtiwewieni, 'ahetsiemieme xeime, Muitsexi hetsiemieme xeime meta 'Eriyaxi hetsiemieme xeime.  
\p Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni 'atsikatimaitɨ kemainekai.  
\v 34 Tikuxatakaku 'akuxi yapauka haiwitɨri kaniwaranukanani, mɨkɨkɨ mekaniutimamani.  
\v 35 Hikɨ haiwitɨritsata xewitɨ mɨpaɨ kanetayɨni: «'Ikɨ kanineniwetɨni, nemenayexei, xekene'enieka».  
\v 36 Niuki heunuatɨyaku, Ketsutsi yuxaɨta kaniuyuhayewa. Hikɨ mɨkɨ 'atsimepɨka'utiyua, 'ana mɨtiyehane nixeime mepɨkatehaxaxatɨwakai tita memɨte'uxei hepaɨtsita.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨrenayehɨa nunutsi kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane miwiyakai  
\r (Ruk 9:37-42, 43-45 – Mat 17:14-18, 22-23, Mar 9:14-27, 30-32)  
\p
\v 37 Merikɨtsɨ 'uxa'arieka, kepauka yemuritsie memakanexɨa, yumɨiretɨ teɨteri mekaniwaranunake.  
\v 38 Hikɨ xewitɨ tewi teɨteri watsata 'uwetɨ mɨpaɨ katiniuhiwa:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame 'aku, kwerietɨ xɨa neniwe 'uki keneuxeiya, mɨkɨ xeikɨa kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 39 Kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane pikuwiwiya, meta yapauka 'utahiwatɨ payeika, metatsiere hau'erietɨ petihɨpa meta kwaimuxari 'uhewame payeitɨwa. Kepauka mikuwiwiya haweri mieme pikuhayeikawa.  
\v 40 Nekaniwarutawawirieni 'ahetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete memenuyenɨ'anikɨ peru mepuyutatexi.   
\p
\v 41 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xeme hikɨ xemɨmiemete yuri xepɨkate'erie meta kemɨkatiheitserie xepɨteyurie. ¿Kepaɨmexɨa peuyewetse 'akuxi xehamatɨa nemuyeikani meta nemɨxenewieka? 'Ena kenahani 'aniwe.   
\p
\v 42 Kepauka temaikɨ hurawa mamiekai kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane kaniwiya, kanetihɨani meta kanitayɨyɨakitsitɨani karima. Peru Ketsutsi kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane kaniutatieni, temaikɨ 'aixɨa reu'erietɨ kanayani, meta 'ukiyarieya kaniyetuirieni.  
\v 43 Yunaitɨ mekani'iyarixiekaitɨni Kakaɨyari mɨya mɨtitɨrɨkaɨyekaikɨ.  
\p Hikɨ yunaitɨ mehɨxiyakaku naime kemɨtiyurienekaikɨ, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:   
\p
\v 44 —Xeme 'ikɨ niuki yemekɨ xekeneu'eni: Yuri Tewi kenemɨtihɨkɨ nekaniyetuiyamɨkɨ teɨteri wahetsɨa.   
\p
\v 45 Mɨkɨ mepɨkaheitimaiwawekai 'ikɨ niuki. Wahetsiemieme ni'awiekaitɨni, ya'ayumieme yamepɨkatehetimaiwawekai, memamatɨ mepɨkayuwaɨriyakai memita'iwawiyakekai 'ikɨ niuki hepaɨtsita.   
\s1 Kemɨ'ane mɨwe'eme  
\r (Ruk 9:46-50 – Mat 18:1-5, Mar 9:33-40)  
\p
\v 46 Merikɨtsɨ teyu'ɨkitɨwamete niuki mekaniutixɨatɨatɨkɨne, kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ matsi waɨkawa meuyewetse mayanikekai.  
\v 47 Ketsutsi timaitɨ kememɨteyɨkɨhɨawekai yu'iyaritsie, nunutsi 'ahanaka yu'aurie kanitakeni.   
\p
\v 48 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kemɨ'ane mitanaki'erieni 'ikɨ nunutsi nehetsɨa mɨmiemekɨ, mɨkɨta ne pɨnetsitanaki'erieni, meta kemɨ'ane mɨnetsitanaki'erieni, kemɨ'ane mɨnetsiheyenɨ'a kanitanaki'erimɨkɨta. Kemɨ'ane yunaime xetsata matsi waɨkawa tixaɨ mɨkatihɨkɨ, mɨkɨ matsi kanimariweni.   
\p
\v 49 Hikɨ Wani mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, xeime tepuxei 'ahetsɨa waniu miemetɨtɨ mɨtiwa'aitɨakai kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene memɨwaxɨnakɨ teɨteri, peru tekanita'imaiya 'ahetsie mɨkatiwiyakɨ tahepaɨ.   
\p
\v 50 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Xepɨkahe'imaiyani, xɨka katatsi'aye'unieka kataniparewieka.   
\s1 Tsamariyatari Ketsutsi kememɨkate'utanaki'eri  
\p
\v 51 Merikɨtsɨ tukari 'aye'aximekaku manutiwitɨkienikɨ, 'ana Ketsutsi kaneyani Kerutsareme kayukunuitɨanɨatɨ.  
\v 52 Niuki tuayamete kaniwaranukuhaitsitɨiya, mɨkɨ mana me'uyehutɨ Tsamariyatari wakiekaritsie mekaniu'axɨani tixaɨtɨ memɨtekuha'aritɨanikɨ hetsiena mieme,  
\v 53 kiekatari mepɨkaheitanaki'eri yemekɨ, Kerutsareme tamietɨ mɨyɨanekaikɨ.  
\v 54 Teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete Kakuwu, Wani matɨa mete'utamarieka mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿kamatinake temɨtaniunikɨ 'Eriyaxi kemɨtiuyuri, tai taheima makanenikɨ mɨkɨ mɨwatitaiyakɨ?   
\p
\v 55 Peru Ketsutsi ta'aurie 'aweka kaniwarutatieni.\f + \fr 9:55 \ft RV60 meta hipatɨ mepenanɨitɨa \fq —¿Kari xeme 'atsixepɨkatemate kemɨ'ane 'iyaritsie xemɨtewiya? Yuri Tewi netitewatɨ, kenemɨtinua, teɨteri wa'iyari neheuyexɨrienike nepɨkanua, matsi newatawikweitsitɨanike pɨta nekaninuani.\f*  
\v 56 Hikɨ xeime kiekaritsie pɨta mekanekɨne.   
\s1 Kemɨraye'axe Ketsutsi hetsie mɨtiwiyani  
\r (Ruk 9:57-60 – Mat 8:19-22)  
\p
\v 57 Merikɨtsɨ huyeta me'uyehukaku, xewitɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame, 'ahetsie nekatiniwiyamɨkɨ, hakewa pememie, neta nekanimieni.   
\p
\v 58 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kauxaitsi yuterɨ mekanexeiyani meta wikixi taheima miemete yu'itua metehexeiya, perutsɨ ne Yuri Tewi netitewatɨ tixaɨ nepɨkarexeiya hakewa nemɨnetamuritaritɨani.   
\p
\v 59 Hikɨ xeimeta mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Nehetsie ketinewiyani.  
\p Mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Keneneupitɨa meri nemɨyemiekɨ, ne'ukiyari nemɨkateukukɨ hemɨyuke.   
\p
\v 60 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Mɨkite keniwaruhayewa mɨkɨ pɨta memɨwakateukukɨ yuhetsɨa miemete mɨkite, 'ekɨ pɨtatsɨ kenemie, ketinekuxatani kemɨti'ane Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku.   
\p
\v 61 Hikɨ xewitɨta mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ahetsie nekatiniwiyamɨkɨ Ti'aitame, keneneupitɨa xeikɨa ne'iwama nemɨwatateutɨanikɨ meri.   
\p
\v 62 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikumayɨame hararu, xɨka yu'utɨma 'ukuniere, 'aixɨa pɨkayɨni, Kakaɨyari yakɨ xeikɨa kanexeiyakamɨkɨ ti'aitɨwametɨme.   
\c 10  
\s1 Kemɨtiwarutanɨ'a haika tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana huta  
\r (Ruk 10:4-15, 21-24 – Ruk 9:3-5, Mat 11:21-23, 25-27, 13:16-17)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'arike Ti'aitame hipameta waruhɨritɨaka haika tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana huta meyupaɨmeme, yuhutatame kaniwareutanɨ'axɨani memanukuhaitɨtɨanikɨ naime kiekaritsie naime kiepa hakewa mɨkɨ meta'anikekai.  
\v 2 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Itsanari pɨwaɨkawa, peru 'itsanamete mepɨkayumɨire. 'Ayumieme xekeneutawawiri 'itsanari kutsiyari, 'itsanamete mɨwatanɨ'anikɨ yu'itsanarita.  
\v 3 Xekenehu xeme. Kamɨ kenemɨtixetanɨ'axɨani, muxatsi tɨrixi wahepaɨ xekaniyɨakakuni 'ɨrawetsixi watsata xe'u'uwatɨ.  
\v 4 Tumini maname xepɨkahehuruwani, kɨtsiuri, kakai, huyeta xeime xepɨkawaɨritɨaka.   
\p
\v 5 »Hakewa xeme'axɨani kiita, mɨpaɨ meri xekeneutiyuaneni: “'Uwa kiekatari 'aixɨa xeketexeiyarieka”.  
\v 6 Xɨka mana 'ukani kemɨ'ane mɨyuwaɨriya 'aixɨa mɨtixeiyarienikɨ, hetsiena tinaketɨ kanayeimɨkɨ xewaɨritsika, mexɨka mɨpaɨ 'anetɨ ka'ukani, xewaɨritsika kaninuamɨkɨ xehetsie.  
\v 7 Mana mɨkɨ kiita xekeneyuhayewani xetekwatɨ xete'ietɨ tita memɨtexemikwani, ti'iwame hetsie katininakeni 'iwarikaya. Xepɨkayupatatɨweni hipame wakiita.   
\p
\v 8 »Hakewa kiekaritsie xeme'axɨani, hakewa memɨxetanaki'erieni, xeketenekwaka tita xemɨtemikieka.  
\v 9 'Aixɨa meteheu'eriekame xekeniwarayeitɨa tekwikwikate mana miemete, mɨpaɨ xeketeniwakuxaxatɨwani: “Hikɨrixɨa kanaye'aniri, Kakaɨyari kanitsutɨani 'ena ti'aitatɨ”.  
\v 10 Peru, kepauka xeime kiekaritsie xeheutahaxɨayu xemɨkahetanaki'eriwa, memayukuxexeɨriwatsie xe'axɨame mɨpaɨ xekeneutiyua:  
\v 11 “'Atsita tumuanari xekiekaritsie mieme mɨtatsikwiema ta'ɨkatetsie, tepeikatsixɨani texehekɨatɨatɨ. Tsepanetɨ xemɨkatatsi'utanaki'eri, 'ipaɨ xeketenemaika, tukari maye'akɨ Kakaɨyari mitsutɨakɨ ti'aitatɨ”.  
\v 12 'Ipaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, tukari 'aye'ayu 'etsiwa xeikɨa mekatenikwinitɨariekuni Tsuruma kiekatari, mɨkɨ kiekari waɨkawa matsi mekatenikwinitɨariekuni».   
\p
\v 13 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Xɨa'ui, Kuratsini kiekatari. Xɨa'ui Wetsaira kiekatari. Tirutsie meta Tsirunitsie xɨka mariwemekɨ tiuyɨnike kemɨtiuyɨ xehetsɨa, mana kiekatari meripaitɨri mepɨte'uhayewake kememɨteyuriekai, waɨkawa yemekɨ mepɨyuheiweriekakeyu maixa me'anakatɨtɨ heiwerika 'inɨariyari, naxi meyukawiriwatɨ.  
\v 14 Peru kepauka 'itsɨkame muwatahɨawe Tiru meta Tsiruni kiekatari 'etsiwa xeikɨa mekatenikwinitɨariekuni, xeme waɨkawa matsi xekatenikwinitɨariekuni.  
\v 15 Xemeta Kaperunaumetari, ¿muyuawitsie paitɨ xe'anuwitɨkienike xeteyu'erie? Hawaikɨ, mɨkite wahetsɨa xepeukaxɨriyani pɨta.   
\p
\v 16 »Kemɨ'ane mɨxe'enie, ne pɨnetsi'enie, kemɨ'ane mɨxexani'erie, ne pɨnetsixani'erie, kemɨ'ane ne mɨnetsixani'erie, kemɨ'ane mɨnetsiheyenɨ'a pɨxani'erie».   
\p
\v 17 Merikɨtsɨ haika tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana huta kepauka memakunuaxɨa, mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani meyutemamawietɨ:  
\p —Ti'aitame 'aku, 'atsita kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene yamepɨtekahu ketemɨtewa'aitɨa 'ahetsɨa temɨmiemetekɨ.   
\p
\v 18 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mɨkɨ:  
\p —Netsɨ nekanixeiya Kauyumarie muyuawitsie 'anakahɨiyaku merɨkariya hepaɨ.  
\v 19 Neuxei, heitserie nekanixe'upitɨani kuterixi terɨkaxi xemɨwatiketsinanikɨ, 'iya mɨtatsi'aye'unie tɨrɨkariyaya naime xema'iwakɨ heitserie nekanixe'upitɨani, tixaɨtɨ 'atsipɨkatixeyurieni.  
\v 20 Mɨkɨkɨ xepɨkayutemamawieka, kakaɨyarixi yamemɨtekahukɨ kexemɨtewa'aitɨa xeikɨa, matsi xekeneyutemamawieka xemaka'utɨariekɨ taheima kexemɨtetetewa.   
\p
\v 21 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana Ketsutsi kaniyutemawiekaitɨni 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata yatipitɨakaku, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Ne'ukiyari, taheima pemɨti'aita meta kwiepa, pamɨpariyutsi nepɨmatsipitɨa, pemɨtiuti'awietaxɨkɨ 'ikɨ naime memɨkaheitimanikɨ mɨkɨ memɨteyɨ'ɨkitɨawawe meta memɨtemaiwawe, tɨɨri pɨta wahetsiemieme matsiɨkɨme pemayeitɨakɨ. Huu, ne'ukiyari, pepɨ'awaɨriyakai mɨpaɨ pemɨtiyurienenikɨ.   
\p
\v 22 »Ne'ukiyari naime netiniyetuirieni. Xewitɨ 'atsipɨkatimate kemɨpaikɨ Nu'aya, 'ukiyarieya xeikɨa mɨpaɨ katinimaika, xewitɨ 'atsipɨkatimate kemɨpaikɨ 'ukiyarieya, nu'aya xeikɨa mɨpaɨ katinimaika, meta nu'aya xɨka yuwaɨriyani mixeitsitɨanikɨ xeime, mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ katinimaikamɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ ta'aurie 'aweka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete yɨhɨkɨate metitekaku: «Mɨkɨ memunenierixɨ kexemɨte'unenierixɨ xeme, 'aixɨa mekani'itɨarieka mɨkɨ.  
\v 24 Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, yumɨiretɨ Kakaɨyari niukametemama meta te'aitamete, mepixeiyakukai tita xemɨte'uxei xeme, peru mepɨka'ixei, mepi'eniekukai tita xemɨte'u'eni, peru mepɨka'i'eni».   
\s1 Tsamariyatanaka 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyari  
\r (Ruk 10:25-28 – Mat 22:34-40, Mar 12:28-31)  
\p
\v 25 Merikɨtsɨ xewitɨ 'inɨarikɨ mɨti'ɨkitametɨkai kananukukeni 'i'inɨatamɨtɨ, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, ¿tita reuyewetse kenetiyurieni, nehetsie mɨtinakekɨ tukari mɨkaxɨwe?   
\p
\v 26 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ rehɨawe:  
\p —¿'Inɨari niukiyaritsie kere'uxa? ¿Kepetikuterɨwa?   
\p
\v 27 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —“Pekaninaki'eriekamɨkɨ Ti'aitame mɨ'akakaɨyari naime 'a'iyarikɨ, naime kepemɨti'amatekɨ, naime 'atɨrɨkariyakɨ, meta naime 'a'eriwamekɨ”, metatsiere: “'ahepaɨ tewi kenenaki'erieka 'ekɨ kepemɨti'anaki'erie”.   
\p
\v 28 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Heitseriemekɨ peputa'a. Mɨpaɨ xɨka petiyurieneni, pekanayeyurikamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 29 Peru mɨkɨ heitseriemekɨ yatikamiekame yuhekɨatamɨtɨ mɨpaɨ Ketsutsi katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Merikɨte, kepɨpaikɨ nehepaɨ tewi?   
\p
\v 30 Hikɨ 'ita'eiyaka, Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Heiwa tewi Kerutsareme heyeyaka Keriku neukamiekaitɨni, merikɨtsɨ tenawayamete mekanenukunake. Me'itikemaripieka me'ikuwaxɨaka mekanekɨne mɨximeme me'uku'eirieka.  
\v 31 Merikɨte 'atsikatimaitɨ kemɨtiuyɨ mana neukamiekaitɨni mawari wewiwame mɨkɨ huyeta, 'ixeiyaka mana kaniuyeyani yatewa.  
\v 32 Yaxeikɨata Rewi nuiwarieyatsie mieme xewitɨ tukita mɨtiparewiwametɨkai mana kaniuyeyani yatewa kaniuyeyani.  
\v 33 Perutsɨ xewitɨ tsamariyatanakatɨtɨ mana 'uyemietɨ hetsɨana kaninuani, 'ixeiyaka kanitinenimayata.  
\v 34 'Ahurawa 'uyaka 'ixuriki kaneiwerieni xuriya maneikakaitsie, hatseitikɨ winukɨ 'i'uayemaka, 'enuti'ikataka yupuxutsie metsuni paitɨ kani'atɨani, mana kani'ɨwiyakaitɨni.  
\v 35 Hikɨ 'uxa'arieka xeitewiyari 'inɨariyari wati'ɨka kani'ɨitɨani metsuni kutsiyari mɨpaɨ tikɨhɨawetɨ: “Kene'ɨwiyani, hetsiena mieme xɨka tixaɨtɨ petinanaimɨkɨ, xɨka 'akuxi heuyeweka, nepɨtinetuani kepauka nemayeneni”.  
\v 36 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ mi'inɨatanekai katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Merikɨte kepetiku'eriwa, 'ikɨ yuhaikatɨ kemɨ'ane yuhepaɨ tewi hepaɨ pɨtixei, tenawayamete memenukunakixɨ mɨkɨ tewi?   
\p
\v 37 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Kemɨ'ane mitinenimayataxɨ, mɨkɨ pɨhɨkɨtɨkai.  
\p Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Ekɨtari kenemie, hepaɨna ketineyurieneni.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨreku'iwataxɨ Marita meta Mariya wahetsɨa  
\p
\v 38 Merikɨtsɨ mana mekaniu'uwakaitɨni, hikɨ Ketsutsi xeime kiekaritsie kaneutahani, mana 'uka Marita titewatɨ kanita'inieni yukiita.  
\v 39 Yu'iwa 'ukatɨme pexeiyakai Mariya titewakame, mɨkɨ Ketsutsi hetɨa 'ukaitɨ kani'eniekaitɨni niukieya.  
\v 40 Merikɨtsɨ Marita pɨyuxamuriekai waɨkawa tikumaɨwatɨ mɨtiwaminikɨ. Mana 'utakeka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿yapekara'eriwa ne'iwa nexaɨta mɨnetsi'uku'eirikɨ nemɨtixeminikɨ? Yaketineutahɨawi pɨnetsiparewieni.   
\p
\v 41 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei Marita, tiwaɨkawamekɨ pepɨti'a'iyaritɨa pepɨ'amuina,  
\v 42 tixewitɨ xeikɨa peuyewetse. Mariya kanenuyexeiya tita matsi 'aixɨa mɨti'ane, pɨkanawaiyarieni.   
\c 11  
\s1 Nenewieri hepaɨtsita kemɨti'ɨkitakai Ketsutsi  
\r (Ruk 11:2-4, 9-13 – Mat 6:9-13, 7:7-11)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ heiwa 'aniukateitɨni yunenewietɨ. Yunenewieri 'unɨku, hetsɨana miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete xewitɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ketatine'ɨkitɨaka temɨtanenewiekakɨ, Wani kemɨtiwaru'ɨkitɨa yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete.   
\p
\v 2 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kepauka xemɨyunenewie 'ipaɨ xekeneutiyuaneni:  
\q1 »“Ta'ukiyari taheima pemakawe,  
\q1 kepemɨtitewa patsietɨ kehayeitɨariwani.  
\q1 'Enata keneutsutɨa peti'aitatɨ.  
\q1 Kwiepa yameketeyurieka kemɨmatinake, taheima kememɨteyurie.\f + \fr 11:2 \ft Kɨriyekutsie paine \fq Ta'ukiyari, kepemɨtitewa patsietɨ kehayeitɨariwani. 'Enata keneutsutɨa peti'aitatɨ.\f*   
\q1
\v 3 'Ikwai tukarikɨ ketemɨteheiyehɨwa, tukarikɨ yaketatinemikwani.   
\q1
\v 4 'Axaketemɨte'uyuri ketatineuyehɨwirieka,  
\q1 tameta temɨtewareuyehɨwiriekaku mɨkɨ 'axamemɨtatsiyurie yunaime.  
\q1 Pepɨkatatsipitɨaka temɨta'inɨatsienikɨ”.\f + \fr 11:4 \ft RV60 meta hipatɨ mepenanɨitɨa \fq matsi ketaneutawikweitsitɨa 'axatemɨka'itɨarienikɨ.\f*   
\p
\v 5 »Mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe: Xɨka xewitɨ xeme yuhamiku hexeiyani, mɨkɨ xɨka hetsɨana nuani tɨkari hixɨapa mɨpaɨ xɨka titahɨawe: “Nehamiku 'aku, haika payari keneneuniɨtɨa,  
\v 6 neuxei xewitɨ nehamiku nehetsɨa kanenuani tewa hanuyaka, tixaɨtɨ nekarexeiyakaku, tita netimini”.  
\v 7 Kiita mayeka xɨka mɨpaɨ tita'eiya: “Ketinehayewa. Kitenie pɨreuname, netɨriyama tanaitɨ tepuhe, nepɨkayɨwe nemanukukeni nemɨmatiniɨtɨanikɨ”.  
\v 8 Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, kanihamikuyatɨni, peru mɨkɨ 'ayumiemeyarikɨ xeikɨa pɨka'anukukeni pɨka'iniɨtɨani, 'iya mɨkatihayewakɨ matsi tiwawirietɨ 'ayumieme naime pɨtiniɨtɨani tita mɨreuyehɨwa.   
\p
\v 9 »'Ayumieme nepɨtixekɨhɨawe ne: Xɨka xe'ita'iwauni xekatehayewatɨ xekanimikiekuni, xɨka xe'ikuwauni xepitaxeiya, 'itupari xɨka xe'uyuitɨani xepɨteheuyepiyarieni.  
\v 10 Yunaitɨ memita'iwau, mepɨyetuiriyarɨwa yu'iwaurika, yunaitɨ memikuwautɨwe, mepitaxeiya yunaitɨ, 'itupari memɨkuyuitɨwa, mepɨteheuyepiyarɨwa.   
\p
\v 11 »¿Kemɨ'ane xeme yuniwe\f + \fr 11:11 \ft RV60 meta hipatɨ mepenanɨitɨa \fq paa ha'iwawakaku tete pituitɨawe pɨta? Yatɨni. \f* tsapa ha'iwawakaku, kuu pimiwe pɨta?  
\v 12 Yatɨni tawari ha'iwawakaku, ¿kemɨ'ane terɨka pimiwe pɨta?  
\v 13 Xɨka xeme 'axaxeteyuruwametetɨtɨ 'aixɨa ti'aneme xetewamikwani yɨtɨriyama, matsi xe'ukiyari taheima makawe matsi yemekɨ 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata taheima mɨmieme kaniwamimɨkɨ mɨkɨ memitawawiri».   
\s1 Kememutiyuanekai Ketsutsi kename kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane 'inɨkai  
\r (Ruk 11:14-15, 17-22, 24-26 – Mat 12:22, 24-29, 43-45, Mar 3:23-27)  
\p
\v 14 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi kaneyenɨ'ani kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane tewi mɨxɨnakɨ kaniuweme kanayeitɨakaitɨni. Hikɨ kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane 'ayeyaku, tewi niuwetɨ kanayani, hikɨ teɨteri mekanihɨxiyakaitɨni.  
\v 15 Peru hipatɨ mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani: «Mɨkɨ kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene tiwa'aitɨwame 'iparewiekaku kaniwarayenɨ'awani kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene».  
\v 16 Hipatɨta, me'i'inɨatakutɨ 'inɨari mekanitawawirieni muyuawitsie mieme.   
\p
\v 17 Mɨkɨ wa'iyaritɨarika maitɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xɨka kiekatari hixɨata meyutsana, mana pakumawere, xeime kie kiekatari xɨka hixɨata meyutsana mekanita'unikuni.  
\v 18 Kauyumarie xɨka hixɨata yutsana, ¿kereuteriwe ti'aitametɨtɨ? Xemetsɨ xeputiyuane kename Weheritsewutsie netiwiyatɨ newaranuyenɨ'awa kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene.  
\v 19 Merikɨte, xɨka ne Weheritsewu hetsie xeniu netiwiyatɨ newarayenɨ'awani kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene, ¿xemeta xemɨtewa'ɨkitɨa kemɨ'anetsie metewiyatɨ mepɨwaranuyenɨ'awa? 'Ayumieme mɨkɨ xehetsie mepɨte'ahɨpani.  
\v 20 Mexɨka Kakaɨyari tɨrɨkariyayakɨ pɨta newaranuyenɨ'awani kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene, Kakaɨyari 'ari kanitsutɨani ti'aitatɨ xehetsɨa.   
\p
\v 21 »Tewi mɨtɨrɨkaɨye kuya tepɨaya ma'ɨ mexi 'i'ɨwiya yukii, kayuwatɨ puma piiniteya.  
\v 22 Kemɨ'ane matsi yemekɨ mɨtɨrɨkaɨye nuame 'e'iwame, pinawairieni kuya tepɨaya hetsiena yuri mɨti'eriekai, meta yu'iwama pɨwamini tepɨateya.   
\p
\v 23 »Kemɨ'ane nehetsie mɨkatiwiya, mɨkɨ pɨnetsi'aye'unie, kemɨ'ane nehamatɨa mɨkatiukuxexeɨriwa, mɨkɨ pitaxɨrɨwa.   
\p
\v 24 »Kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane tewi hetsie 'ayeyame, makumawetsie pɨkuyeikani 'uxipiya kuwaunetɨ. Yutexienetɨ mɨpaɨ paineni: “Nepɨyemie nekita nemɨwayetɨatsie”.  
\v 25 Nuame pitaxeiya waye'itiyakame 'aixɨa tiuye'aneme.  
\v 26 'Ana pɨyemie hipame pɨwata'inieni kakaɨyarixi matsi kwini mieme 'axamemɨ'anene 'atahutame, meheutahaxɨame, muwa me'ayetetɨ mepakɨne. 'Imatɨrieka mɨkɨ tewi matsi yemekɨ 'axa'itɨarietɨ payani, kemɨka'itɨariekai matɨari paitɨ».   
\p
\v 27 Merikɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ tikuxatakaku, 'uka teɨteri watsata muyeikakai kaniutahiwa mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Aixɨa ke'itɨarieka kemɨ'anetsie pemɨyekatei, kemɨ'ane mɨmatsi'utsitsitɨa.   
\p
\v 28 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Matsitsɨ pɨta, 'aixɨa meke'itɨarieka mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari niukieya memɨ'enie meta yamemɨtekahu.   
\s1 Kemɨti'inɨari Kunatsi  
\r (Ruk 11:29-32 – Mat 12:39-42)  
\p
\v 29 Hikɨ teɨteri meyukuxeɨrieximekaku mɨpaɨ katiniutixatatɨyani: «Hikɨ miemete teɨteri 'axateyuruwamete mekanihɨkɨtɨni. Mekanikuwautɨweni 'inɨari, peru 'inɨari mepɨkapitɨarieni, Kunatsi 'inɨarieya xeikɨa mekanipitɨariekuni.  
\v 30 Kunatsi 'inɨari kemɨratɨa Niniwetari wahetsiemieme, neta Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa 'inɨari nekanayeimɨkɨ hikɨ miemete teɨteri wahetsiemieme.  
\v 31 Metatsiere 'uka ti'aitame Tsawa mekatei, mɨkɨ panukukeni titahekɨatake hikɨ miemete teɨteri wahepaɨtsita, wahetsie pɨrahɨani 'ana, mɨkɨ meyetɨakɨ kwie manuniere paitɨ, mi'enienikɨ Tsarumuni kemɨtimaiwekai, matsi 'ena kaniuyeikani xewitɨ waɨkawa mariwetɨ keyuri Tsarumuni.  
\v 32 Niniwe kiekatari mepanuku'uni metetahekɨatake hikɨ miemete wahepaɨtsita, wahetsie pɨrahɨiyani, Niniwetari memɨte'uhayewaxɨkɨ kememɨteyuriekai Kunatsi tiwarutaxatɨaku, matsi 'ena kaniuyeikani xewitɨ waɨkawa mariwetɨ keyuri Kunatsi.   
\s1 Tawaiyari kɨxemeya  
\r (Ruk 11:34-35 – Mat 6:22-23)  
\p
\v 33 »Kɨxeme 'utaiyame pɨka'iti'awieta, kakunikɨ pɨka'enukanani, matsi wapai pɨta pekayeni, teɨteri me'atahaxɨaximetɨ memixeiyakɨ hekɨariyaya.  
\v 34 Merikɨte, hɨxite tawaiyari kɨxemeya kanihɨkɨtɨni. Xɨka 'ahɨxi 'aixɨa reu'erieka, 'awaiyaritsie naitɨ pekanihekɨariwiyarieka. Mexɨka 'axa'aneneni 'ahɨxite, 'awaiyaritsie naitɨ pekaniyɨriyarieka.  
\v 35 'Ayumieme kene'akweriwayurieka, 'ahetsɨa mieme kɨxeme kapa 'uyɨrekɨ.  
\v 36 Xɨka 'awaiyaritsie pehekɨariwiyarieka naimetsie, mɨtiyɨwi xɨka tiumaweni, naitɨ kanihekɨakamɨkɨ, kɨxeme kemɨmatihekɨariwiya xawatɨtɨ».   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ paritseutsixi meta 'inɨarikɨ te'ɨkitamete  
\p
\v 37 Merikɨtsɨ tikuxatatɨ tiutahayewaku, paritseutɨtɨ kanita'inieni hetsɨana mɨtikwanikɨ, muwa heutahaka mana kanayerɨni.  
\v 38 Peru paritseu 'ixeiyaka kaniuhɨxiyani mɨka'ukamaimakɨ meri katikwaiwetɨ.   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kari xeme paritseutsixi tekɨxi xakɨ herie xepɨka'itiwa, peru yutaɨta xepɨhɨpɨne xetenawakutɨ 'axaxeteyurietɨ.  
\v 40 'Atsixepɨkatemate. ¿Kemɨ'ane mitawewi herie taɨtanata katitawewi?  
\v 41 Matsi taɨtana miemekɨ xeketeneyumikwani xeteyukanenimayatɨ, mɨkɨkɨ naitɨ 'itiyatɨ kanayeimɨkɨ xehetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 42 »Xɨa'ui xeme, paritseutsixi, tamamatatsie mieme xeime xepɨyuwaɨriya xemixatɨanikɨ Kakaɨyari yeruwawena, xura meta naime tupiriyate mukwaiwa, peru xepɨkayuwaɨriya heitseriemekɨ yaxemɨtekahunikɨ, xepɨkayuwaɨriya xeminaki'eriekakɨ Kakaɨyari. Mɨpaɨ xemɨtekahunikekai peuyewekai xekatehayewatɨ 'iya kexemɨteyurie.   
\p
\v 43 »Xɨa'ui xeme paritseutsixi. Pɨxenake yunaime wahɨxie xemayaxekɨ tuki 'etsimɨpepeta meta xemɨwaɨritɨarieka kiekari hixɨapa.   
\p
\v 44 »Xɨa'ui xeme, mɨki teukiyaya mɨkayuhekɨa herie xepɨhɨkɨ, hetsiena teɨteri memu'uwa 'atsimekatemaitɨ».   
\p
\v 45 Merikɨte xewitɨ 'inɨarikɨ mɨti'ɨkitametɨkai mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, mɨya pe'utaitɨ pepɨtatsiniukima tameta.   
\p
\v 46 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Xɨa'ui xemeta 'inɨarikɨ xemɨte'ɨkita, 'ika mukwaniwe teɨteri xepɨwaruti'ikatɨwa, peru wa'ika xemɨkumaɨwani niyu'itɨwamekɨ xepɨkayuwaɨriya xemɨwaparewienikɨ.   
\p
\v 47 »Xɨa'ui xeme, Kakaɨyari niukametemama wateukiya 'inɨariyari xemɨtiwewiwa, xe'ukiyarima memɨwarukwi.  
\v 48 'Ayumieme xepɨyuhekɨata, xe'iyari yakani'aneneni xe'ukiyarima kememɨte'uyuri, mɨkɨ mepɨwarukwi Kakaɨyari niukametemama, xemeta wa'inɨari xete'utiwewi.  
\v 49 Kakaɨyari timaiwetɨ 'ayumieme mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “Kakaɨyari niukametemama meta nɨ'ariekate ne nepɨwaranunɨ'airieni, hipame mɨkɨ mepɨwakwini meta hipame mepɨwataweiya”.  
\v 50 'Ayumieme hikɨ miemete teɨteri wahetsie katinahɨiyamɨkɨ yunaime Kakaɨyari niukametemama waxuriyakɨ kwie munetɨarietsie paitɨtɨ mieme,  
\v 51 'Aweri xuriyayakɨ meri 'atsita Tsakariyaxi xuriyayakɨ mɨkareutewike, mumierie mɨrayutimawatɨre yeyaka tukita kaheta'awetɨ. Huu, yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepaine hikɨ miemete teɨteri wahetsie katinahɨiyamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 52 »Xɨa'ui xeme 'inɨarikɨ xemɨte'ɨkitamete, xepinawa kitenie yawiyari kɨmana teɨteri metemaiwawetɨ memakɨnekekai. Xemetɨtɨ xepɨkaheutahaxɨawawe, meta hipame xepɨkawapitɨa memeutahaxɨani».   
\p
\v 53 Merikɨtsɨ wayeyaku, mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai meta paritseutsixi yunaitɨ mekanitixeɨmatɨkɨne kwini mieme, mekaniti'iwawiyatɨkɨne mɨtikuxatanikɨ waɨkawa hepaɨtsita.  
\v 54 Me'ihupietɨ memiwiniyakɨ niukieyakɨ.   
\c 12  
\s1 Tiyukuxanariyame paritseutsixi wahetsɨa mieme  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana teɨteri waɨkawa miriyari meyupaɨmetɨ meyukuxeɨrieku yuketatsie me'a'uwekaku. Kanitsutɨani mɨpaɨ tiwakuxaxatɨwatɨ yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete: «Xekeneyukweriwayurieka matsi paritseutsixi wahetsɨa mieme tiyukuxanariyame hepaɨtsita, wa'itarika yuri hepaɨ memɨte'ikuxata hepaɨtsita.  
\v 2 Karikɨ naitɨ tita mɨti'awietsie katinahekɨarimɨkɨ, meta naitɨ tita 'awie mɨtimieme katinitamariwamɨkɨ.  
\v 3 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ nepaine, naime tita xemɨtekuxata yɨwikɨta, hekɨaripa kani'enieriemɨkɨ, meta tita kiita yu'inɨkai xemɨtekuxata, kii heima paitɨ kanitahekɨatsiemɨkɨ hiwarikɨ.   
\p
\v 4 »Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe xeme, nehamikuma, xepɨkawamakarɨka mɨkɨ memɨyɨwawe tawaiyari memɨmieni xeikɨa, peru 'arike tawarita mepɨkayɨwawe yɨkɨ memɨte'uyurieni.  
\v 5 Nepɨtixetaxatɨani kemɨ'ane matsi xemɨmakarɨka: xekenemakarɨka kemɨ'ane, ramieme, heitserie mexeiya tai yamɨtita'atsie mɨreukahɨani. Huu, mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, mɨkɨ xekenemakarɨka.  
\v 6 Wikixi yu'auxɨwitɨ huta tsenitawuyari mepɨte'aye'axe, peru nixewitɨ mɨkɨ pɨkatɨmaiyarie Kakaɨyari hɨxie.  
\v 7 Mɨpaɨta yaxeikɨa xeme: xekɨpate xemu'utsie mieme naitɨ pɨti'inɨatsie. Xepɨkaheumamaka, yumɨiretɨ wikixi kememɨte'aye'atɨka, xeme matsi waɨkawa xepɨte'aye'atɨka.   
\p
\v 8 »Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, kemɨ'ane mɨyuhekɨata teɨteri wahɨxie kename nehetsɨa mieme, neta Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa nekaninehekɨatamɨkɨ kename hetsiena netiwiya Kakaɨyari hetsɨa miemete niuki tuayamete wahɨxie.  
\v 9 Peru kemɨ'ane muyuku'imawa teɨteri wahɨxie kename nehetsɨa kamieme 'utaitɨ, mɨkɨta pɨkamatiwani Kakaɨyari niuki tuayametemama wahɨxie.  
\v 10 Yunaitɨ memɨniukixie Yuri Tewi hepaɨtsita, mekaniyɨwaweni memɨteheuyehɨwiyarienikɨ, perutsɨ kemɨ'ane 'axamɨtayɨni 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata hepaɨtsita, mɨkɨ pɨkayɨweni mɨreuyehɨwiyarienikɨ.   
\p
\v 11 »Kepauka xemanuhapanieni tukiteta, kuwexinaruritsixi meta 'itsɨkate wahɨxie, xepɨkayu'iyaritɨaka kexemutiyuaneni yuhetsiemieme meta kehapaɨ xemutiyuaneni,  
\v 12 karikɨ 'ana 'Iyari Mɨtiyupata pɨtixeta'ɨkitɨani kexemutiyuaneni».   
\s1 Tewi mɨxikutɨkai 'atsimɨkatimaikai  
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ teɨteri watsata 'uwetɨ xewitɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, yaketineutahɨawi ne'iwa mɨnetsi'ɨitɨanikɨ tita nehetsie mɨtinake tapaapa tita mɨtatiuku'eiriri.   
\p
\v 14 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei, ¿kemɨ'ane xe'itsɨkame pɨnetsi'ayeitɨa xepiini hixɨata nemɨtitsananikɨ?   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xekeneyukweriwayurieka naimekɨ, xekeneyɨ'ɨwiyani kapa xete'ukahiwe'erieka, rapiinite ranayuhayewakaku pɨkatukari.   
\p
\v 16 Hikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruti'ɨkitɨatɨyani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Tewi mɨxikutɨkai kwie kanexeiyakaitɨni kwini mieme katiniutixuaweriyakaitɨni.  
\v 17 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni yu'iyaritsie: “¿Ketsɨ netiyurieni? Nepɨkaheixeiya hakewa nemeiti'uta netɨriku”.  
\v 18 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “Tsipara 'ipaɨ nepɨtiyurieni: Nepika'una nekaxetunite, 'epapame matsi nepɨtiwewieni, mana nepiti'uta netɨriku meta hipame nepiinitɨarika.  
\v 19 'Anari ne'iyaritsie mɨpaɨ nepɨtinekɨhɨaweni: Ne'iyari 'aku, waɨkawa piinite pekatiniuti'uta mɨixa wiyaritsie mieme. Kene'uxipieka ketinekwaka ketine'ieka pe'atemawietɨ”.  
\v 20 Perutsɨ Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Kari 'atsipepɨkatimate. Hikɨ tɨkarikɨ 'a'iyari pepɨtawawiyarieni. ¿Tita pemɨtiuti'utaxɨ, kemɨ'ane piiniteya pɨrayani 'ana?”   
\p
\v 21 »Mɨpaɨ katinikɨyɨneni kemɨ'ane yuhetsiemieme waɨkawa mɨtiyuti'utsiri hetsie, peru pɨkaxiku Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme».   
\s1 Kemɨkareuyewetse mɨyu'iyaritɨakakɨ  
\r (Ruk 12:22-31 – Mat 6:25-33)  
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:  
\p —'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe: Xepɨkayu'iyaritɨaka yutukari hepaɨtsita, kexemɨtekwani, yuwaiyari hepaɨtsita, kexemɨteyutikemaritɨani.  
\v 23 Tukari matsi waɨkawa pɨraye'axe keyuri 'ikwai, meta xewaiyari keyuri 'ixuriki.  
\v 24 Xekeneyɨ'ɨwiya kwatsari wahetsie: mepɨka'uka'etsa mepɨka'uka'itsana, kaxetuni 'iki mepɨkahexeiya, mɨyatɨtɨ Kakaɨyari katiniwamikwani. Wikixi kememɨte'aye'axe, xeme kwini mieme matsi xekate'aye'axe.  
\v 25 ¿Kemɨ'ane xeme waɨkawa yu'iyaritɨatɨ pɨyɨwe 'e'utewitɨ mayuyeitɨani xɨka 'etsi'utewini?  
\v 26 Merikɨ 'etsiwa xeikɨa xɨka xekayɨwaweni, ¿titayari xeteyu'iyaritɨa naimekɨ?   
\p
\v 27 »Tuturi xekena'eriwani, kemɨkatiwita kemɨkatitsa'a, peru 'ipaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, Tsarumuni kwini mieme witsikemɨ'anekai, witsipɨkaranakatɨkɨkai wahepaɨ nixeime hepaɨ 'ikɨ tuturi.  
\v 28 Merikɨ xɨka Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ tikemaritɨaka 'ɨxa 'ɨtsita mieme hikɨ muxuawe 'uxa'a huxunuta meukaxɨriyani, matsi yemekɨ katixekemaritɨaka xeme. Kari 'etsiwa xeikɨa yuri xepɨte'erie.  
\v 29 'Ayumieme xeme xepɨkayu'iyaritɨaka yu'ikwaikɨ meta tita xemɨte'ienikɨ, xeketeneuhayewa xe'iyarixietɨ.  
\v 30 Teɨteri naitsarie kwiepa miemete mɨpaɨ ti'aneneme naime mepɨtekuwautɨwe, xeme xe'ukiyari matsi mɨpaɨ pɨtimate xemeiyehɨwakɨ 'ikɨ.  
\v 31 Xemetsɨ xekeneyuwaɨriyani Kakaɨyari tixe'aitɨwame mɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ, mɨpaɨ xeteyurietɨ, mɨkɨ naime xepɨtemikienita.   
\p
\v 32 »Nemuxatsima, tsepa xemɨkayumɨire, xepɨkaheumamaka, xe'ukiyari kaniyuwaɨriyani mɨtixepitɨanikɨ tita mɨrexeiya ti'aitametɨtɨ.  
\v 33 Xeketenetuaka yupiinite, xeteyuparewietɨ xeketeneyumikwani. Xekenanuhuri tumini maname mɨkaye'iriwe, taheima xekeneuti'uta tita mɨkatixɨwe, hakewa tinawayame 'ahurawa mɨkaheyeika hakewa kwitsi mɨkaretikwitamawa.  
\v 34 Hakewa xemɨteheti'uta yupiinite mɨraye'atɨka, manata miemekɨ xe'iyari yakani'anemɨkɨ.   
\s1 Kemɨtita'ikwewani  
\r (Ruk 12:35-36, 39-40, 42-46 – Mat 24:43-51, 25:1-13, Mar 13:33-37)  
\p
\v 35 »Xekeneyuha'aritɨaka xe'ayɨhɨatɨkaitɨ xekɨxeme takaku.  
\v 36 Xemeta teɨteri wahepaɨ xekeneyɨaka yukutsiyari memɨkwewie, 'atsimekatemaitɨ kepauka neɨkiya 'ixɨararipa mayeyani, mekanikwewieka kwitɨwa memɨteheuyepienikɨ nuayu 'itupari heyuitɨayu.  
\v 37 'Aixɨa mekani'itɨariekakuni mɨkɨ te'uximayatamete xɨka wakutsiyari nuame waretaxeiya me'ayeneniereme. Yurikɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, panayɨhɨani, mexatsie pɨwarutiyatsa, mana 'uyeikatɨ pɨtiwamini.  
\v 38 Tsepa tɨkari hixɨapa tsepa yuimuana munua, mɨya meteyuriekaku xɨka waretaxeiya, 'aixɨa mekani'itɨariekakuni mɨkɨ.  
\v 39 Peru 'ipaɨ xeketenemaika, xɨka kiekame yatimaikake kemɨ'ane hurayaritsie munuani tinawayame, pɨta'ikwewanikeyu mɨka'ipitɨanikɨ kiita meutahani.  
\v 40 Mɨpaɨta xeme kaneuyeweka xemɨyuha'aritɨaka, karikɨ kepauka Yuri Tewi kanuaximeme xemɨ'erieka 'ana kaninuamɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 41 Hikɨ Pekuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿'ikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita peti'ɨkitatɨ tame petatixata, nutsu pepɨwaxata yunaime?   
\p
\v 42 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Ti'uximayatame yamɨtikamie meta mɨtimaiwe kanihɨkɨtɨni mɨyɨwe kutsiyarieya mɨtihɨritɨani mɨtiwa'aitɨakakɨ hipameta te'i'uximayatsiriwamete meta mɨtiwamikwanikɨ kepauka memeiyehɨwa.  
\v 43 'Aixɨa ke'itɨarieka mɨkɨ ti'uximayatame xɨka kutsiyarieya nuame 'itaxeiya yatiyurieneme kemɨtiuta'aitɨarie.  
\v 44 Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, pɨtihɨritɨani yupiinite tinaime.  
\v 45 Peru mexɨka mɨkɨ ti'uximayatame mɨpaɨ tiuyɨhɨawe: “Nekutsiyari 'epɨreutere kwitɨwa pɨkanuani”, hikɨ xɨka warutiwatɨyani te'uximayatamete 'ukitsi meta 'ukari, meta xɨka tikwaneni meta 'ieneni meta taweneni.  
\v 46 Mɨkɨ ti'uximayatame kutsiyarieya kaninuamɨkɨ kepauka mɨka'ikwewietsie, meta kemɨ'ane hurayaritsie yemekɨ mɨka'ikwewietsie. Hikɨ waɨkawa pi'uximatɨani meta yuri memɨkate'erie wahepaɨ katinipitɨamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 47 »Mɨkɨ ti'uximayatame yamɨtimaikai kemɨtinakekai kutsiyarieya, peru mɨkayukuha'aritɨa 'atsimɨkatiuyuri kemɨtinakekai, mɨkɨ kwini mieme kanikuweiyaxɨamɨkɨ.  
\v 48 Kemɨ'ane pɨta 'atsikatimaitɨ yamɨtiuyuri para mɨkuweiyaxɨanikɨ, 'etsiwa xeikɨa pɨkuweiyaxɨani. Kemɨ'ane waɨkawa mɨtiumikie, mɨkɨ waɨka pɨtitawawiyarieni, kemɨ'ane waɨkawa mɨhɨritɨarie, waɨkawa matsi pɨtitawawiyarieni.   
\s1 Ketsutsi hixɨata kemɨtiwatsana  
\r (Ruk 12:51-52 – Mat 10:34-36)  
\p
\v 49 »Ne nekaninuani tai nemeukahɨanikɨ kwiepa, yanepɨra'eriwakaku 'ari xɨka takake.  
\v 50 Peuyewetse nema'iwarienikɨ nemɨmierienikɨ, tewi kemɨranukanamiepaɨ hakɨ kepauka muka'ɨyarie, haweri mieme nepɨtiuka'eniwa mexi ka'aye'awe.  
\v 51 ¿Xeme mɨpaɨ xeteku'eriwa kename nenua newapitɨanike kwiepa memɨtama 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ? Hawaikɨ, hixɨata nemɨwatsanakɨ pɨta nepunua.  
\v 52 Hikɨ 'uxa'atɨni yu'auxɨwitɨ xeikiyarita miemete hixɨata mepɨyutsanani yuhaikatɨ yuhutame mewaraye'unietɨ, yuhutatɨ yuhaikame mewaraye'unietɨ.  
\v 53 Mepɨkayuxewini nuariekame yuniwe paye'unieka meta nu'aya yupaapa paye'unieka, niwekame yuniwe 'uka paye'unieka meta 'uka yumaama paye'unieka, niwekame yumu'e paye'unieka meta wikiekame yumu'e paye'unieka».   
\s1 'Inɨari 'ikɨ tukaritsie mieme  
\p
\v 54 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teɨteri:  
\p —Kepauka hai xemɨxeiya tau makayuyuipike hepatsie hatineikame, kwitɨ 'ana mɨpaɨ xeputiyuane: pɨkawiye, mɨpaɨta pɨtikɨyɨne.  
\v 55 Meta kepauka 'eka tatsutɨa hepatsie mieme mu'eka, mɨpaɨ xeputiyuane: pukɨxɨre, mɨpaɨta pɨtikɨyɨne.  
\v 56 Xemɨte'itawamete. Xepi'inɨatawawe kwie kemɨtiyuxexeiya muyuawi meta. ¿Titayari xekate'i'inɨatawawe 'ikɨ tukaritsie mieme?   
\p
\v 57 »¿Titayarita yɨkɨmana xekateheitimaiwawe tita mɨtiheitserie?  
\v 58 Kepauka 'itsɨkame hetsɨa pemanuhanieni, huyeta xe'uhutɨ keneunɨtɨa 'axanetame matsixɨnakɨ, kapa 'itsɨkame hɨxie matsihe'atɨanikɨ, 'itsɨkame kapa matsiyetuanikɨ tupiri hetsɨa, tupiri kapa matsi'anutahɨani katsariyanata.  
\v 59 Mɨpaɨ nepɨmatikɨhɨawe, muwa pepɨkawayeyani kepaukake naimekɨ pemɨti'atuani».   
\c 13  
\s1 Xɨka xekate'uhayewa kexemɨteyurie xekanikwikuni  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ hipatɨ 'ana me'u'axɨaka mekatenitaxatɨani karereyatari wahepaɨtsita, Piratu mɨtiuta'aitaxɨ memɨkwi'iwakɨ mexi metemawatɨwekai.  
\v 2 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «¿Kexeteku'eriwa, mɨya memɨte'ukwinixɨkɨ kemetematsiɨkɨ, kename mɨkɨ matsi yemekɨ 'axameteyuriekai, hipatɨ karereyatari yunaitɨ 'axakememɨkate'uyuri?  
\v 3 Pɨkatixaɨ. Matsi mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, xɨka xekate'uhayewa kexemɨteyurie xeme, wahepaɨ xekanikwi'iwakuni yunaitɨ.  
\v 4 ¿Mɨkɨ meta tamamata heimana 'atahaika memɨyupaɨmekai wahetsie mukawe Tsiruhe tuxiyuyari mɨwarukwi, kexeteku'eriwa mɨkɨ wahepaɨtsita, kemetematsiɨkɨ kename matsi kwinimieme wahetsie rahɨiwakai, hipatɨ teɨteri Kerutsareme memɨtama yunaime wahetsie kemɨkarahɨiwakai?  
\v 5 Pɨkatixaɨ. Matsi mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, xɨka xekate'uhayewa kexemɨteyurie, yaxeikɨa xekanikwi'iwakuni yunaitɨ».   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ 'ikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katini'ɨkitakaitɨni: «Tewi 'aniukateitɨni kɨye muka'iteɨritaxɨ yuharawerita, mana kani'axekaitɨni 'ikwaxi kuwaunetɨ kɨyetsie mieme, kakanitaxexeiyakaitɨni.  
\v 7 Hikɨ harawerita mɨhɨritɨariekai mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: “Neuxei haika wiyari nepeukuyeixɨa 'ikwaxi nekuwaunetɨ 'ikɨ kɨyetsie mieme, nepɨka'itaxeiyawe. Kenahɨwa, ¿titayari kwie titsewixima xeikɨa?”  
\v 8 Peru tihɨweme mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Nekutsiyari, 'ikɨ witsie keneuhayewa xeikɨa, ne hetɨana nepa'inetɨyani, meta kwie 'aixɨa mɨ'ane nepawiwietɨyani.  
\v 9 Heiwatɨ mɨpaɨ 'utixuawere, mexɨka katixaɨtɨni, tepewiteni kepemaine”».   
\s1 Ketsutsi 'uka kemɨranayehɨa 'uxipiya tukariyaritsie  
\p
\v 10 Merikɨtsɨ 'uxipiya tukaritsie katini'ɨkitakaitɨni heiwa xeime tukita,  
\v 11 'uka muwa kanayekateitɨni kakaɨyari 'axamɨ'ane miwiyakai tamamata heimana 'atahaika wiyari 'iweranariyatɨ. Nanakatutsikaitɨni, pɨkayɨwekai mɨyutatseiriyakɨ naime.  
\v 12 Hikɨ Ketsutsi 'ixeiyaka yu'aurie 'itahɨaweka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Uka pepuxɨnarie kepemɨtiweranikai.   
\p
\v 13 Hetsiena 'utimeku yapauka kaniutatseire, 'aixɨa nainekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita.  
\v 14 Hikɨ tuki mɨhɨritɨarie ha'atɨ Ketsutsi menayehɨakɨ 'uxipiya tukaritsie, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teɨteri:  
\p —'Ataxewi tukari puxuawe kepauka meuyewetse yamɨti'uximayakakɨ, mɨkɨ tukaritsie 'ayumieme xekene'axeni 'aixɨa xemɨte'uka'eritɨariwanikɨ, peru 'uxipiya tukaritsie pɨkatixaɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Xemɨte'itawamete. ¿Yuxexuitɨ xeme 'uxipiya tukariyaritsie xekatewaxɨna yutuurutsixi kwietsanamete yupuxurima hakewa memakuwɨ, xekatewarehapana xekatewaharitɨwa?  
\v 16 'Ikɨ 'uka 'Apɨrahami kaninu'ayatɨni, peru Kauyumarie kanekuwiekaitɨni tamamata heimana 'atahaika wiyari, ¿kareuyewetse 'uxipiya tukaritsie mɨxɨnarienikɨ 'akuwietɨ?   
\p
\v 17 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨku mekaniuyutitetewiya yunaitɨ memeye'uniekai, peru hipatɨ teɨteri yunaitɨ mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni waɨkawa mariweme mɨtiyurienekaikɨ.   
\s1 Mutsitatsa 'imɨariyari hepaɨtsita  
\r (Ruk 13:18-21 – Mat 13:31-33, Mar 4:30-32)  
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —¿Tita hepaɨ ti'ane Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aita? ¿Ke'aneme 'ɨkitsikayari nexatatɨ nepihekɨatani?  
\v 19 Mutsitatsa 'imɨariyari hepaɨ kani'aneni tewi xei 'imɨariyari 'anutɨka yuharawerita meika'e. 'Utawereka kɨye kanayani, wikixi taheima miemete mekaniyuti'ituatɨatɨkɨne mamateyatsie.   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ tawari mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —¿Ke'aneme 'ɨkitsikayarikɨ nepihekɨatani Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aita?  
\v 21 Paa kuxanariyame hepaɨ kani'aneni, 'uka 'iwatituka kanitimuina paa mɨtɨxiyaritsie waɨkawametsie, 'arikeke naitɨ kaniutikuxanare.   
\s1 Kitenie 'etsimayewa  
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ kiekarite 'emɨyeyeutsie 'etsimɨyeyeutsie kaniye'axekaitɨni ti'ɨkitatɨ, Kerutsareme tamietɨ.   
\p
\v 23 Merikɨtsɨ xewitɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿yakɨ yupaɨmetɨ xeikɨa metetawikweitsitɨarieni?  
\p Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:   
\p
\v 24 —Waɨriyarika xekeneyupitɨaka xemeutahaxɨanikɨ kitenie 'etsimayewatsie, mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, karikɨ yumɨiretɨ mepɨhakuni peru mepɨyutatexieni.  
\v 25 Kepauka kiekame 'anukukeme mɨreunani kitenie, xeme takwa xemu'uwa, 'itupari xekaniyuitɨakuni, mɨpaɨ xe'utiyuatɨ: “Ti'aitame 'aku, ketatineuyepiri”. Peru mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinixeta'eiyamɨkɨ: “Ne nepɨkaxemate meta nepɨkatimate hakewa xemeyekɨ”.  
\v 26 Hikɨ 'ana xekanitsutɨakuni mɨpaɨ xe'utiyuatɨ: “Tame tepɨte'ukwai meta tepɨte'u'i 'ahamatɨa, meta 'ekɨ takaye 'utɨa pepɨti'ɨkitakai”.  
\v 27 Peru mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinixeta'eiyamɨkɨ: “Nepɨkaxematerikɨ meta nepɨkatimate hakewa xemeyekɨ. Xekeneuyupata nehetsɨa xepɨka'u'uwani, xeme xeyunaitɨ kemɨkatiheitserie xemɨteyurie”.   
\p
\v 28 »Mana xekaniutitsuanakuni xekaniyutakewekuni, kepauka xemɨwaxeiya 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, Kakuwu meta texaxatamete yunaime mana me'u'uwame hakewa Kakaɨyari mɨre'aita, xeme pɨta xe'anuyexɨriyayu.  
\v 29 Tau matineikatsie miemete makayuyuipiketsie miemete mekani'axɨakuni, tatserieta miemete meta ta'utata miemete, mexa 'aurie mekanayaxikuni hakewa Kakaɨyari mɨre'aita.  
\v 30 Mana, hikɨ miemete 'imatɨremete 'ana hipatɨ mexɨakate mekanakɨnikuni, hikɨ miemete mexɨakate meta hipatɨ mɨkɨ 'imatɨremete mekanakɨnikuni».   
\s1 Ketsutsi yuhiwerietɨ kemutayɨ Kerutsareme kiekatari wahepaɨtsita  
\r (Ruk 13:34-35 – Mat 23:37-39)  
\p
\v 31 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana paritseutsixi hipatɨ hetsɨana mekaniu'axɨani mɨpaɨ mete'ikɨhɨawetɨ:  
\p —Xaɨtsie pɨta kenemie, Herurexi pɨmatsimiemɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 32 'Iya mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ xeketenetahɨawi netsimariutame: “Neuxei, ne hikɨ 'uxa'a nepɨwaranuyenɨ'awani kakaɨyarixi 'axamemɨ'anene memɨwatixɨnakɨ teɨteri, nepɨwaranayexɨrieni tekwikwikate, 'ayeimana nepaye'atɨarienitɨtɨ”.  
\v 33 Mɨkɨ xeikɨa neuyeweka hikɨ, 'uxa'a meta warie nemɨkuyeikanikɨ, peuyewetse yemekɨ yunaitɨ texaxatamete memɨkwi'iwakɨ Kerutsaremetsie, xaɨtsie pɨkatixaɨ.   
\p
\v 34 »Kerutsareme, Kerutsareme 'aku, 'ahetsɨa kiekatari mekaniwatakukuyani Kakaɨyari niukametemama meta mekaniwatituaxani Kakaɨyari nɨ'arimama 'ahetsɨa memɨ'axe. Mɨixa nepɨnewaɨriyakai nemɨwakuxeɨrienikɨ 'atɨriyama, wakana yuniwema kemɨtiwakuxexeɨriwa yu'anatɨa hepaɨ, peru mepɨkayuwaɨri.  
\v 35 Neuxei, xekii 'uyemawetɨ pɨyuhayewa. Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixetahɨawe, tawari xepɨkanetsixeiya mexi tukari ka'aye'awe kepauka mɨpaɨ xemutiyuaneni: “'Aixɨa ke'itɨarieka kemɨ'ane 'umamie Ti'aitame hetsɨa miemetɨtɨ”».   
\c 14  
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨrenayehɨa tewi meuhatɨkatei  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Ketsutsi xeime hetsɨa kaninuani 'uxipiya tukaritsie tikwanike. Mita'ini xewitɨ teɨteri wa'ukiyarima kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni meta paritseutɨtɨ, mɨkɨ mekanihupiekaitɨni.  
\v 2 Hikɨ tewi meuhatɨkatei hɨxiena kanakateitɨni.  
\v 3 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai meta paritseutsixi:  
\p —¿Tiyɨwe nutsu pɨkayɨwe 'uxipiya tukaritsie tewi 'aixɨa muyurienikɨ?   
\p
\v 4 Peru mɨkɨ kayuwatɨ mekaniumakaitɨni. Hikɨ tikwikame 'umayɨaka 'aixɨa reu'eriekame hayeitɨaka kaneinɨ'ani.   
\p
\v 5 Meta mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xewitɨ xeme xɨka niweya heukaweni muwatixawatsie yatɨni tuuruya, ¿kwitɨwa katiwatihana tsepa 'uxipiya tukaritsie?   
\p
\v 6 Mepɨkayɨwawekai tixaɨ memutiyuanenikɨ 'ikɨ hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ waruxeiyaka kememɨtehenuyexeiyakai hakewa matsi 'aixɨa mɨ'anenekai memayaxekɨ, 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruti'ɨkitɨatɨyani mɨkɨ memuta'inierie, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:   
\p
\v 8 —Kepauka tewi mɨxeta'inieni neɨkiya 'ixɨararipa, hakewa matsi 'aixɨa mɨ'ane mana xepɨka'ayaxikeni, kapa xeime matsi we'eme 'uta'inieni, 'ekɨ 'etsiwa pewe'emetɨkaku xeikɨa.  
\v 9 'Ahetsɨa nuame kemɨ'ane mɨxe'uta'ini mɨpaɨ pɨmatikɨhɨaweni: “Keneupitɨa 'ikɨ pɨta 'ena mayerɨnikɨ”. 'Ana 'ekɨ pe'atewiyatɨ 'imatɨreme 'ɨparieyatsie pe'akaitɨ pepayani.  
\v 10 Matsi kepauka pemɨta'inierieni, mana kenayexi 'imatɨreme 'ɨparitsie, kepauka munuani kemɨ'ane mɨmatsi'uta'ini, mɨpaɨ pɨmatitahɨawe: “Nehamiku, huma pɨta kenayexi 'ahurawa”. 'Ana witsipɨraniuwani 'ahepaɨtsita yunaime 'ahamatɨa memuta'inierie wahɨxie.  
\v 11 Yunaitɨ yuxaɨta mariweme memayuyeitɨwa tixaɨtɨ mekatehɨkɨtɨtɨ mekanayeitɨariekuni, peru kemɨ'ane tixaɨtɨ katihɨkɨtɨme mayuyeitɨwa mɨkɨ mariweme kanayeitɨariemɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Meta kemɨ'ane mita'ini mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Kepauka 'ikwai pemɨwewieka tuka ya taikai, pepɨkawa'inieka 'ahamikuma, 'a'iwama, 'amarema, 'aurawatari memeuka'u xeikɨa, mɨkɨta kapa mematsi'uta'inienikɨ, kapa mɨpaɨ perakapitɨarienikɨ.  
\v 13 Matsi kepauka 'ikwai pemɨwewieka, keniwa'inieka mɨkɨ tixaɨtɨ memɨkatehexeiya, memɨmamawawaki, memɨhurietɨka meta memakɨkɨpe.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ tixaɨtɨ mepɨkatehexeiya kɨmana tawarita memɨmate'apiniriekakɨ, mɨpaɨ petiyurienetɨ 'aixɨa pekani'itɨariekamɨkɨ, tawari pepɨrapiniyarieka kepauka memanuku'uni mɨkɨ heitseriemekɨ yamemɨtekahu.   
\s1 'Ikwai 'ixɨarariyari mɨmariwe niukiyari  
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ memuta'inierie xewitɨ, 'ikɨ 'u'enieka, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Aixɨa kani'itɨarieka kemɨ'ane mɨrekwani hakewa Kakaɨyari mɨre'aita.   
\p
\v 16 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Xewitɨ tewi 'ikwai 'ixɨarariyari kaniuwewieni mariweme, yumɨireme kaniwaruta'inieni.  
\v 17 Hikɨ tukari 'aye'aku memɨtekwanikɨ, yuhetsɨa mieme ti'uximayatame kaniutanɨ'ani mɨpaɨ mɨtiwatahɨawekɨ memuta'inierie: “Xekenakɨniri, 'ari naitɨ pɨrekuha'aritsie”.  
\v 18 Hikɨ yuxexuitɨ yunaitɨ mekaniuyuti'imatɨkɨne. Xewitɨ meri mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Kwie nepenanai, peuyewetse nemixeiyamiekɨ, nepɨkayɨwe nemɨmiekɨ, kenetineuyehɨwiri”.  
\v 19 Xewitɨta mɨpaɨ titahɨawixɨ: “Tuurutsixi kwietsanamete nepɨwaretinanai 'auxɨwime paritsiyari, newareta'inɨatake nepɨmie, kenetineuyehɨwiri”.  
\v 20 Xewitɨta mɨpaɨ titahɨawixɨ: “'Uka nepuwitɨtɨarie, 'ayumieme nepɨkayɨwe nemɨmiekɨ”.  
\v 21 Hikɨ ti'uximayatame nuaka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe yukutsiyari. Hikɨ kiekame 'uyeha'aka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe yuhetsɨa mieme ti'uximayatame: “Kwitɨ kiekaritsie kenemie kaye'utɨa huyeta, tixaɨtɨ memɨkateheuxeiya, memɨmamawawaki, memakɨkɨpe meta memɨhurietɨka keniwarawitɨki 'uwa”.  
\v 22 'Ariketa mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni ti'uximayatame: “Nekutsiyari, kepemɨtiuta'aitaxɨ yanepɨtiuyuri, peru mepɨkahɨne 'akuxi”.  
\v 23 Hikɨ kutsiyarieya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe yuhetsɨa mieme ti'uximayatame: “Huyeta kenemie tetsariya kemɨtiukumane, waɨriyarika keniwarepitɨa memahukɨ nekita memɨtahɨnekɨ.  
\v 24 'Ipaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, mɨkɨ memuta'inierie, nixewitɨ mɨkɨ pɨkahe'inɨata ne'ikwai”.   
\s1 Kemɨraye'axe xɨka Kɨritsitutsie tiwiyani  
\p
\v 25 Merikɨtsɨ yumɨiretɨ teɨteri 'utɨmana mekaniuhukaitɨni, ta'aurie 'aweka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\v 26 «Xɨka xewitɨ nehetsɨa nuani, xɨka kawa'uxiwe'erieka yupaapa meta yumaama, yɨ'ɨya, yɨtɨriyama, yu'iwama, meta xɨka ka'i'uxiwe'erieka yutukari, pɨkayɨwe nehetsɨa mieme tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame mayuyeitɨwanikɨ.  
\v 27 Kemɨ'ane mɨkayuwaɨriya kuruxitsie mɨmierieni, tsepa nehamatɨa muyeika nehetsie tiwiyatɨ, mɨkɨ pɨkayɨwe nehetsɨa mieme tiyɨ'ɨkitɨwame muhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.   
\p
\v 28 »Xewitɨ xeme xɨka tuxiyu tawewimɨkɨni, ¿mana karayerɨni meri titi'inɨatake kemɨraye'aka, xɨka heixeiyani kɨmana minɨni, mexɨka katixaɨtɨni?  
\v 29 Tenariyari xɨka 'utawewieni, xɨka yutatexieni minɨnikɨ, 'aixɨa pɨkayɨni, yunaitɨ mekanitinanaimatɨkɨnikuni memɨneniere  
\v 30 mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: “'Ikɨ tewi kii kaniutsutɨani, pɨyutatexi pɨka'inɨ”.   
\p
\v 31 »Yatɨni xewitɨ kwiepa ti'aitame xɨka yemieximeni xeime ti'aitame matɨa memɨyutakwinikɨ. ¿Mana meri karayerɨni, mɨpaɨ tiyɨkɨhɨawetɨ tamamata miriyari warawitɨtɨ xɨka 'aku yɨweni menukunakekɨ 'iya xeitewiyari miriyari warawitɨtɨ hepana mamie?  
\v 32 Mexɨka katixaɨtɨni, 'ateewa heyeikakaku 'akuxi meye'unie, nɨ'ariekate penunɨ'airieni, pitawawirieni 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ.  
\v 33 Yaxeikɨatari yunaitɨ xeme xɨka yupiinite nai xekate'uku'eirieni, xepɨkayɨwawe nehetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete xemayuyeitɨwanikɨ.   
\p
\v 34 »'Una 'aixɨa kani'aneni, xɨkate 'una hamuritɨ 'ayanike, ¿titakɨ ra'utsiɨrekeyu 'unatɨtɨ?  
\v 35 'Aixɨa pɨka'ane kwie hetsiemieme meta 'iteɨrite wahetsiemieme, tewa paitɨ xeikɨa kanewiwiyamɨkɨ.  
\p »Xewitɨ netɨ mu'enaxɨ, ke'u'ena».   
\c 15  
\s1 Muxa meuyewe niukiyari  
\r (Ruk 15:4-7 – Mat 18:12-14)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ yuwaɨkawatɨ kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tewawamete meta 'axateyuruwamete hetsɨana mekani'axekaitɨni yunaitɨ me'i'enienike kemɨtikuxatakaikɨ.  
\v 2 Hikɨ paritseutsixi meta mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai, mekaniniukixiekaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «'Ikɨ 'axateyuruwamete kaniwanaki'erieka, wahamatɨa katinikwaka».   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ mɨkɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruta'ɨkitɨani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\v 4 «Xewitɨ xeme xɨka xeitsienituyari warexeiyani yumuxatsi, xewitɨ mɨkɨ xɨka heuyeweni, ¿mana 'ɨxapa katiwaku'eirieni nauka tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'atanauka memɨyupaɨme, katiwaumie meuyewe, 'itaxeiyameke xeikɨa katihayewa?  
\v 5 Hikɨ, kepauka meitaxeiya, waɨkawa yutemawietɨ yunaiparitetsie neikutemɨkɨ.  
\v 6 Yukie nuame kaniwakuxeɨrimɨkɨ yumarema 'ahurawatari yunaime mɨpaɨ tiwakɨhɨawetɨ: “Xemeta xekeneyutemamawieka nehepaɨ, nemeitaxeikɨ nemuxa meuyewekai”.  
\v 7 Mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, mɨpaɨta katine'aneni muyuawisie: kwini mieme mekateniyutemamawieka taheima kepauka xewitɨ mɨtihayewa 'axatiyurienetɨ, keyuri nauka tewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'atanauka memɨyupaɨme heitseriemekɨ yamemɨtekahu memɨkaheiyehɨwa memɨtehayewakɨ 'axameteyurietɨ.   
\s1 Tumini meuyewe niukiyari  
\p
\v 8 »'Uka xɨka tamamata tuminiyari hexeiyani pɨrata tuminiyari, xeituminiyari xɨka heuyehɨani. ¿Katitaiya kɨxeme, katiuye'itieni yukiita, 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ katikuwauni 'itaxeiyameke katihayewa?  
\v 9 'Itaxeiyame kaniwakuxeɨrimɨkɨ yumarema 'ahurawatari yunaime mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Xemeta xekeneyutemamawieka nehepaɨ, netumini nemutaxeikɨ nemeiyehɨakai”.  
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, yaxeikɨa Kakaɨyari hetsɨa miemete niuki tuayamete temawierika mekanexeiyani, kepauka xewitɨ mɨtihayewa 'axatiyurienetɨ».   
\s1 Xewitɨ nu'aya meuyewe niukiyari  
\p
\v 11 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨnita: »Tewi yuhutame kaniwarexeiyakaitɨni yuniwema.  
\v 12 Hikɨ mutaya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe yu'ukiyari: “Ne'ukiyari, 'apiinitɨarikatsie timieme mɨkɨ kenetineyetuiri nehetsiemieme mayanikɨ kepaɨmetɨ nehetsie mɨtinake mɨti'apinitɨkai”. 'Ana yupiinitɨarika katiniwayetuirieni yuhutame yuniwema.  
\v 13 Hikɨ yapaɨmexɨa 'anukayaku mutaya naime tiukuxeɨrieka tewa kaneyani xeime kwieyaritsie, yupiini katineuyehɨani mana yakɨ xeikɨa.   
\p
\v 14 »Merikɨtsɨ naime tiutixɨtɨaku, haka kaniutaweni kwini mieme mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie, hikɨ 'ana reuyehɨatɨ kanayani.  
\v 15 Hikɨ mana kiekame hetsɨa nuaka hetsiena katiniuwiya, mɨkɨ kaneinɨ'ani tuixuri mɨtiwaremikwanikɨ kwiepana.  
\v 16 Huxaimɨtɨ kanihiwe'eriekaitɨni ketita memɨtekwakai tuixuri, peru nixewitɨ pɨkatimi.  
\v 17 Merikɨtsɨ 'uka'iyaritɨ kanayani, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “Ne'ukiyari hetsɨa miemete te'iwamete paa mepexeiya 'anayuhayewakame, ne matsi 'uwa nepɨmɨxime hakakɨ.  
\v 18 Nepɨyemie mekuxi ne'ukiyari hetsɨa, mɨpaɨ nepɨreitahɨawe: Ne'ukiyari, 'axanepɨtiuyuri, taheima makawe yamɨkahainetsie, 'ekɨta yapemɨkahainetsie nepɨtiuyuri.  
\v 19 'Aixɨa nepɨkatiuka'iyari, heitserie nepɨkahexeiya para hutarieka 'aniwe nemayanikɨ, 'ahetsɨa miemete te'iwamete wahepaɨ xeikɨa kenetinepitɨaka nemɨnehayewakɨ”.  
\v 20 Hikɨ yukuha'aritɨaka yupaapa hetsɨa kaneyani.  
\p »'Ateewa 'akuxi 'amiekaku paapaya kanixeiya, kanitinenimayata, 'utanautsaka 'enukunakeka 'enakawiyatɨkaitɨ kani'itseni.  
\v 21 Hikɨ nu'aya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Nepaapa, 'axanepɨtiuyuri, taheima makawe kemɨkatinaketsie, 'ekɨta kepemɨkahainetsie nepɨtiuyuri. 'Aixɨa nepɨkatiuka'iyari, heitserie nepɨkahexeiya para hutarieka 'aniwe nemayanikɨ”.  
\v 22 Paapaya matsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe te'uximayatamete: “Xeiya 'aixɨa, 'ixuriki matsi 'aixɨa mɨ'ane xekenanakatɨtɨa, hanira xekenakamaniri mamayatsie, meta xekeneukakaitɨaxɨa.  
\v 23 Xekenehaniyu tsikeru mɨwaiya 'aixɨa mɨ'ane, xekeneumi'a, tetekwatɨ tepɨtatemamawieka.  
\v 24 'Ikɨ neniwe 'umɨme nekani'eriekaitɨni peru kananutaniere, kaneuyewekaitɨni peru kaniutaxeiyarieni”. Hikɨ 'ana meyutemamawietɨ mekanakɨne yunaitɨ.   
\p
\v 25 »Merikɨtsɨ matsikaya xaɨtsie kaneyeikakaitɨni. 'Akunuaka, kii 'aurie 'ayemietɨ, yuitɨarika kaniu'enieni meta neiya.  
\v 26 Yu'aurie 'itahɨaweka ti'uximayatame xeime, kanita'iwawiya kemɨreyɨanekai.  
\v 27 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “'A'iwa kaninuani, 'apaapa kanimieni tsikeru mɨwaiya 'aixɨa mɨ'ane mitanaki'erikɨ 'aixɨa reu'eriekame”.  
\v 28 Hikɨ matsikaya kaniuyeha'ani, pɨkayuwaɨriyakai meutahanikɨ. Paapaya wayeyaka kanikunɨtɨwakaitɨni.  
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ yupaapa katiniutahɨawe: “Neuxei, mɨixa wiyari nekatini'uximayaka 'ahetsɨa, ne hatsuaku nepɨkamatsiku'imaiyakai, yanepɨtikamiekai, peru ne hatsuaku kapɨra nunutsi pepɨkanetsimiwe, nemarema wahamatɨa nemɨnetemawiekakɨ.  
\v 30 Hikɨri 'ikɨ 'aniwe kaninuani 'atumini naime hetixɨtɨaka 'ukarawetsixi wahetsie, ¿kari tsikeru mɨwaiya pepumi hetsiena mieme?”   
\p
\v 31 »Hikɨ paapaya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Neniwe, 'aheyemekɨ nehetsɨa pekaniukani, nepiini naitɨ katini'apinitɨni.  
\v 32 Kaneuyewekaitɨni temɨtatemamawiekakɨ, karikɨ 'ikɨ 'a'iwa 'umɨme nekani'eriekaitɨni, peru 'ari panutanierixɨ punua, meuyewekai kaniutaxeiyarieni”».   
\c 16  
\s1 Ti'uximayatame yamɨkatikamiekai niukiyari  
\p
\v 1 Mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete: «Tewi mɨxikutɨkai kaneixeiyakaitɨni ti'uximayatame naime mɨtihɨritɨakai yupiinitɨarika, mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawarieni kename ti'uximayatame piinite reuyehɨaximekai.  
\v 2 Hikɨ yu'aurie 'itahɨaweka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “¿Titayari niuki neti'enie 'ahepaɨtsita? 'Inɨari keneneutawewiri 'ahɨritɨarika hepaɨtsita mieme, nepɨkamatsipitɨani tawari pemɨhɨritɨariekakɨ”.  
\v 3 Hikɨ yu'iyaritsie mɨpaɨ katiniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni ti'uximayatame: “¿Kenetiyurieneni, nekutsiyari nehɨritɨarika 'ari mɨnetsinawairieni? Nepɨkatɨrɨkaɨye nemɨti'iwanenikɨ ne'inenetɨ, meta nepɨnetewiya 'ikwewarikɨ.  
\v 4 Hikɨrixɨa nepɨretima kenemɨtiyurieneni kepauka nemɨpatsieni kepauka nemɨkatihɨritɨarieka para hipame wakiita nemɨnaki'eriwanikɨ”.   
\p
\v 5 »Hikɨ yuxexuime kaniwarutakwewieni mɨkɨ memɨte'apitɨkatei kutsiyarieya hetsɨa. Mexɨakame mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: “¿Kepaɨmeme pepɨrapine nekutsiyari hetsɨa?”  
\v 6 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Xeitsienituyari kɨxauriyari hatseiti”. Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Ka'i 'axapa kenanuhuri kepaɨmemekɨ pemaye'uxa, kwitɨ mana kenayexi, xeime pɨta kenaka'utɨa huta tewiyari heimana tamamata maine”.  
\v 7 Mɨpaɨta katinitahɨawe xeime: “'Ekɨta, ¿kepaɨmetɨ peuyewetse pemɨrapikakɨ?” 'Iya rehɨawe: ”Xeitsienituyari nekayari tɨriku”. Mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Ka'i 'axapa kenanuhuri kepaɨmemekɨ pemaye'uxa maine, xeime pɨta kenaka'utɨa nauka tewiyari maine”.   
\p
\v 8 »Hikɨ kutsiyarieya 'aixɨa kanainekaitɨni ti'uximayatame hepaɨtsita tsepa heitseriemekɨ mɨkayɨanekai, timaitɨ mɨyɨanekaikɨ. Hikɨ miemete matsi metemaitɨ mekaniyɨaka yuteɨterima wahepaɨtsita, hekɨaripa miemete yamekayɨakaku wahepaɨ.  
\v 9 Neta mɨpaɨ nekatinixe'utahɨawe xeme, teɨteri yupinikɨ yamekateniyurieka kemɨkatiheitserie, peru xeme yupinikɨ hipame xekeniwatemawieritɨaka, mɨpaɨ xeteyurietɨ, kepauka pini mɨreutipare, xemeta xekanetanaki'eriwakuni hakewa kii mɨkahexɨwetsie.   
\p
\v 10 »Kemɨ'ane yamɨtikamie 'etsitipaɨmeme tihɨritɨarietɨ, mɨkɨ yakatinikamiemɨkɨ xɨka waɨkawa hɨritɨarieka, kemɨ'ane heitseriemekɨ yamɨkatikamie 'etsitipaɨmeme tihɨritɨarietɨ, mɨkɨta yapɨkatikamieni xɨka waɨkawa tihɨritɨarieka.  
\v 11 Hipatɨ pinitɨarika yamekateniyurieka kemɨkatiheitserie, xeme xɨka yaxekatekahuni mɨpaɨ 'aneme piinite hepaɨtsita xetehɨritɨarietɨ, ¿kepaikɨ pɨtixehɨritɨani tita yurikɨ mɨtipiinite hepaɨtsita, yaxetekahume'erietɨ? Hakewatsɨ.  
\v 12 Xɨka yaxekatekahuni xeime piiniteya hepaɨtsita xetehɨritɨarietɨ, ¿kemɨ'ane tita mɨtixepini pɨtixemini? Hakewatsɨ.   
\p
\v 13 »Ti'uximayatame pɨkayɨwe yuhutame yukutsiyarima wahetsiemieme mɨti'uximayakakɨ. Xeime kani'uxiwe'eriekamɨkɨ xeimeta naki'erietɨ, yaxeimetsie katiniwiyamɨkɨ xeimeta xani'erietɨ. Xepɨkayɨwawe xemɨte'uximayakakɨ Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme yupiinitetsieta xetewiyatɨ».   
\p
\v 14 Merikɨtsɨ paritseutsixi 'ikɨ naime mekateniu'enieni, mɨkɨ tumini memɨhiwe'eriekaikɨ mekanitawe'eriekaitɨni.  
\v 15 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xeme yuri xekateniwa'eritɨaka teɨteri kename heitserie xeyɨa xe'utiyuatɨ, peru Kakaɨyari pimate xe'iyari. Tita teɨteri mamariwaweme memɨtexeiya, mɨkɨ pɨtixani'eriwa, Kakaɨyari kemɨtixeiya.   
\s1 Hipatɨta 'ɨkitɨarika  
\p
\v 16 »'Inɨari niukiyari meta texaxatamete waniuki mekani'eniekaitɨni teɨteri 'atsita Wani munuatsie. 'Ana mɨtiyehane niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne pɨta kanikuxaxatsiwani Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aitatsie mieme, hikɨ yunaitɨ kwini mieme mekaniyuwaɨriyani hetsiena memɨtewiyanikɨ.  
\v 17 Matsi pɨkakwaniwe muyuawi meta kwie meutiparekɨ, peru kwini mieme pɨkwaniwe xei'utɨarikayari xeihɨxiyari mɨka'aye'anikɨ 'inɨari niukiyari kemaine.   
\p
\v 18 »Kemɨ'ane 'iku'eirieme yɨ'ɨya, xeime pɨta mɨtiwitɨni, mɨkɨ xeime pɨta kanikumaɨwani, meta kemɨ'ane mitiwitɨni 'uka muku'eiriwaxɨ, mɨkɨta kanikumaɨwani xeime 'ɨyaya.   
\s1 Xiku meta Ratsaru  
\p
\v 19 »Merikɨtsɨ tewi 'aniuyeikakaitɨni xikutɨtɨ, tataɨrawime kananakatɨkɨkaitɨni, rinu 'ixurikiyari meta tukarikɨ 'aixɨa ti'anemekɨ katinikwakaitɨni.  
\v 20 Xewitɨ tixaɨtɨ mɨkarexeiya Ratsaru titewatɨ mana kani'atɨariwakaitɨni xiku kitenie, kaneu'etsakaitɨni.  
\v 21 Kanihuxaimɨkɨkaitɨni, tikwaimɨtɨ tita mɨranakawiwiwekai xiku mexayatsie. Tsɨikɨri 'ahurawa me'akɨkatɨ mekanikatsenakaitɨni 'etsaya.   
\p
\v 22 »Merikɨtsɨ tixaɨtɨ mɨkarexeiya kaniumɨni, Kakaɨyari hetsɨa miemete niuki tuayamete mekanenutiwitɨni 'Apɨrahami 'aurie. Metatsiere xiku tiumɨ tiukateukie.  
\v 23 Mɨkite watsata 'ukaitɨ xiku kananukuniere 'uximatɨarietɨ, 'ateewa paitɨ kanixeiya 'Apɨrahami meta Ratsaru 'auriena 'utikaime.  
\v 24 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniuhiwa: “Nepaapa 'Apɨrahami, kenenenenimayaka, Ratsaru kenanɨ'a yu'itɨwame kɨtsimeyari tahawiyame mɨnetsixeriyakɨ nenenitsie, nemɨtiuka'eniwakɨ 'ena taipa”.  
\v 25 Hikɨ 'Apɨrahami mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “Neniwe, kena'eriwani 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ pepuyeikakai kepauka pemayeyurikai, peru Ratsaru 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ pɨka'uyeikakai, hikɨri mɨkɨ 'uwa kaninɨtɨarieka, 'ekɨ pɨta pepɨ'uximatɨarie.  
\v 26 Mɨkɨ meta, xeme tame tahixɨata 'aki 'emeukatewa putseiriyarie, para 'ena memɨkayɨwawenikɨ tsepa memanukɨniku xehetsɨa paitɨ, meta para muwa memɨye'uwa tahetsɨa paitɨ memɨka'anakɨnekɨ”.   
\p
\v 27 »Hikɨ xiku mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “Nepaapa, nepɨmatsiwawirie Ratsaru pemanunɨ'anikɨ nepaapa hetsɨa,  
\v 28 yu'auxɨwime nepɨwarexeiya ne'iwama, mɨwaraye'eritɨanikɨ, kapa mɨkɨta 'uwa me'u'axɨanikɨ 'uximatɨarika maxuawe”.  
\v 29 Peru 'Apɨrahami mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya: “Muitsexi xapaya mekanexeiyani, texaxatamete waxapa, mekewa'enieka mɨkɨ kememutiyuane”.  
\v 30 Xiku mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Tixaɨ nepaapa 'Apɨrahami, matsi xɨka xewitɨ mɨkite watsata mieme wahetsɨa henuani, mepɨtehehayewa kememɨteheyurie”.  
\v 31 'Apɨrahami mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “Xɨka mekawa'enieka Muitsexi meta texaxatamete, tsepa xewitɨ manukukenike mɨkite watsata, mepɨkayuwaɨriyanikeyu”».   
\c 17  
\s1 'Axaxɨkatiuyurieni, yuri kemɨti'erieka meta kemɨreuyewetse  
\p
\v 1 Mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe yuhetsɨa miemete teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:  
\p —Peuyewetse teɨteri memɨkunuitɨarienikɨ, peru xɨa'ui kemɨ'ane mɨwakunuitɨani.  
\v 2 Hetsiena mieme matsi 'aixɨa pɨyɨni xɨka matá 'akatɨtɨarieme yukɨipitɨa, xɨka haramaratsie heukahɨiyanike, kapa 'ikunuitɨanikɨ xeime 'ikɨ tsepa waɨkawa memɨkamamariwawe.  
\v 3 Xekeneyɨ'ɨwiyani xeme.  
\p »Xɨka 'a'iwa 'axatiuyurieni, keneutati'a, xɨka tiuhayewa kemɨtiyurienekai, ketineuyehɨwiri.  
\v 4 Tsepa xeitukaritsie mɨixa 'axamatsi'uyurieni 'atahutamexɨa, tawarita xɨka 'atahutamexɨa nuanike 'ahetsɨa, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Nepɨtihayewa kenetineuyehɨwiri”, 'ekɨta ketineuyehɨwiri».   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ nɨ'ariekate Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ketanepitɨaka matsi waɨkawa yuri temɨte'eriekakɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xɨka xeme mutsitatsa 'imɨariyari hepaɨ 'etsipemekɨ yuri xete'eriekake, xepɨyɨwawenike mɨpaɨ xemɨte'itahɨawe 'ikɨ xapa mana muwe: “Keniwatihuni, haramaratsie pɨta keneuka'iteɨtsie”, yapɨtikamienikeyu kexemutiyuane.   
\p
\v 7 »Xewitɨ xeme xɨka ti'uximayatame hexeiyani mukwietsanane, yamuxatsi mɨwahɨne, xɨka nuani ti'uximayatame retahayewame, ¿mɨpaɨ titahɨawe: “Kenaye'a xeiya, ketinekwaka”?  
\v 8 Pɨkatixaɨ, ¿mɨpaɨ matsi kutsiyari katitahɨawe: “'Aixɨa ketineuyuri para nemɨtikwanikɨ ne, kene'atikemaritɨa kena'ahɨa kenetineumikwa mexi netikwa'a mexi neti'ie, hikɨ 'ariketa pepɨtikwani pepɨti'ieni 'ekɨtari?  
\v 9 ¿Pamɨpariyutsi tipitɨani ti'uximayatame yatiyurienekaku kemɨtiu'aitɨarie? Tixaɨ xɨari.  
\v 10 Xemetari yaxeikɨa, kepauka yaxemɨteyurieka naime kexemɨte'u'aitɨarie, mɨpaɨ xekeneutiyuaneni: “Te'uximayatamete tekanihɨkɨtɨni xeikɨa, tixaɨtɨ tahetsie pɨkatinake, kemɨreuyewekai xeikɨa tepɨte'uyuri”».   
\s1 Tamamata kememɨte'u'itiya kwiniyakɨ  
\p
\v 11 Merikɨtsɨ Kerutsareme tamietɨ, Tsamariya kwieyari Karereya kwieyari mayunakekaitsie kaniuyemiekaitɨni.  
\v 12 Xeime kiekaritsie ta'aximekaku tamamata teɨteri menenukunake kwiniyakɨ memɨka'itiyatɨkatei. Tewa meti'utɨ  
\v 13 mekaniutihiwakaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Ketsutsi 'aku, Ti'ɨkitame 'aku, ketaneutinenimayata.   
\p
\v 14 Waruxeiyaka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xekenehu mawari wewiwamete memɨxexeiyakɨ.  
\p Hikɨ me'uhutɨ me'itiyatɨkaitɨ mekanakɨne.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ xewitɨ mɨkɨ 'uniereka kemɨranayehɨiya, pukunua 'aixɨa 'utaitɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, karima 'utaniutɨ.  
\v 16 Kaniutihɨximakeni Ketsutsi hetɨa pamɨpariyutsi 'ipitɨatɨ, mɨkɨ Tsamariya kanikiekametɨkaitɨni.   
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —¿Tamamata mekate'u'itiya? ¿'Atanaukatɨ kemeteheuyunixɨ?  
\v 18 ¿Xewitɨ tawari katiukunua para 'aixɨa mɨtayɨnikɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, 'ikɨ xeikɨa xaɨtsie kiekametɨtɨ?   
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenanukukexi kenemie, yuri pemɨtiuta'erikɨ 'ayumieme peputawikweitsitɨarie.   
\s1 Kepauka tukari maye'ani Kakaɨyari mitsutɨani ti'aitatɨ  
\r (Ruk 17:26-27 – Mat 24:37-39)  
\p
\v 20 Merikɨtsɨ paritseutsixi mekaniku'iwawiyakaitɨni kepauka maye'anikekai tukari para Kakaɨyari mitsutɨanikɨ ti'aitatɨ. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Tanieretɨ xeikɨa 'atsipɨkaretimani kepauka mitsutɨani ti'aitatɨ Kakaɨyari.  
\v 21 Pɨkayɨweni mɨpaɨ mɨtayɨni: “Kamɨ 'ena. Kamɨ huma”. Kemɨti'ane Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku, 'ari xetsata kanitsutɨani ti'aitatɨ.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:  
\p —Tukari kanaye'amɨkɨ kepauka mɨpaɨ xemutiyuaneni: “Xɨka tɨma 'aye'anike Yuri Tewi tukarieya tsikere xewitɨ”. Peru xepɨka'ixeiya mɨkɨ tukari.  
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ mepɨtexetahɨawe: “Kamɨ huma peyeika. Kamɨ 'ena”. Muwa xepɨkaheuhuni, xepɨkawareweweiyani.  
\v 24 Merɨkariya muyuawitsie naitsarie kemɨtihekɨariwie 'umerɨkatɨ tatserieta ta'utata paitɨ, mɨpaɨta yaxeikɨa nepɨtimatsiɨkɨre naitsarie netukari 'aye'ayu ne Yuri Tewi.  
\v 25 Perutsɨ kaneuyeweka meri waɨkawa nemɨtikwinekɨ, memɨnetsitixani'erienikɨ hikɨ miemete teɨteri.  
\v 26 Kemɨtiuyɨ kepauka Nuhexi 'amuyeikakaitsie, mɨpaɨta yaxeikɨa katiniyɨmɨkɨ kepauka Yuri Tewi munuani.  
\v 27 'Ana mepɨtekwatɨwekai, mepɨ'ietɨwekai, mepɨneɨketɨwekai meta mepɨtewikitɨatɨwekai, kepauka Nuhexi meutaha kanuwatsie, 'ana haa tiyaka yunaime katiniwareuyehɨani.   
\p
\v 28 »Mɨpaɨrita kemɨtiuyɨ kepauka Ruti 'amuyeikakai yapɨtiyɨni: 'Ana mepɨtekwatɨwekai meta mepɨ'ietɨwekai, mepɨtenanekai meta mepɨtetuakai, mepuka'etsakai meta mepɨkitɨwekai.  
\v 29 Tukari 'aye'aku kepauka Ruti meyetɨa Tsurumatsie, 'ana muyuawitsie tai 'atsupɨreyari kaniukawiye, yunaime kaniwareuyehɨani.   
\p
\v 30 »Mɨpaɨta katiniyɨmɨkɨ kepauka nematsiɨkɨtɨ nemayani, Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa.  
\v 31 'Iya tukaritsie, kemɨ'ane yukii heima makakani, yupiinite yukiita xɨka tiyepika, mɨkɨ 'anakayame pɨkatiwayepineni. Yaxeikɨata kemɨ'ane yuwaxata meyeika yu'utɨma pɨkahakununuwani.  
\v 32 Xekena'eriwani Ruti 'ɨyaya kemu'itɨarie.  
\v 33 Kemɨ'ane yutukari yemekɨ mɨwikweitsitɨamɨkɨ kanitatɨmaiyamɨkɨ, kemɨ'ane mitatɨmaiya, mɨkɨ kanitawikweitsitɨariemɨkɨ.  
\v 34 Mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, 'iya tɨkaritsie yuhutatɨ mepɨkahini xei'utayaritsie: xewitɨ kananutiwitɨkiemɨkɨ, xewitɨta kaniku'eiriwamɨkɨ.  
\v 35 Yuhutatɨ 'ukari mepɨtɨxɨni 'axeikɨa: xewitɨ panutiwitɨkieni xewitɨta kaniku'eiriwamɨkɨ.  
\v 36 Yuhutatɨ waxata mepe'uwani: xewitɨ panutiwitɨkieni, xewitɨta pɨku'eiriwa».   
\p
\v 37 Mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿hakewa mɨpaɨ pɨreyɨni?  
\p Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kanimatsiɨkɨni kaxari tsepa hakewa meka, mana mekaniyukuxeɨrikuni wirɨkɨxi.   
\c 18  
\s1 Wiura meta 'itsɨkame niukiyari  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'ikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'ɨkitɨani kename heuyewetse yuheyemekɨ mɨyunenewiekakɨ, kawaɨripietɨ.  
\v 2 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «'Itsɨkame xeime kiekaritsie kanekateitɨni, Kakaɨyari pɨkamakarɨkai, pɨkawa'eniekai teɨteri.  
\v 3 Merikɨtsɨ 'uka kɨnaya mumɨ mana kanekateitɨni mɨkɨ kiekaritsie, 'itsɨkame hetsɨa kani'axekaitɨni mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Heitserie keneneupitɨa mɨnetsi'aye'unie yamɨkatiyurienenikɨ”.  
\v 4 Mɨixa pɨkayuwaɨriyakai 'itsɨkame, peru 'arike mɨpaɨ katiniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni: “Tsepa nemɨka'imakaxe Kakaɨyari, tsepa nemɨkawa'enie teɨteri,  
\v 5 'ikɨ 'ukaratsi kɨnaya mumɨ kanetini'uxitɨaka, mekuxi heitserie nekanipitɨamɨkɨ, tawariri mɨkanetsi'uximatɨakakɨ”».   
\p
\v 6 Merikɨtsɨ Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Xekani'enieni niukieya kemutayɨ mɨkɨ 'itsɨkame heitseriemekɨ yamɨkatiyurienekai.  
\v 7 ¿Kakaɨyari matsi heitserie katiwapitɨani mɨkɨ mɨwaranayexei tukarikɨ tɨkarikɨ memihiwie? ¿'Areutere kawaparewimɨtɨ?  
\v 8 Yanepɨtixekɨhɨawe, kwitɨ heitserie kaniwapitɨamɨkɨ. Matsi, kepauka nemunuani Yuri Tewi nehɨkɨtɨtɨ, ¿yuri mete'eriekame netiwataxeiya kwiepa 'aku?»   
\s1 Paritseu meta tiwawame niukiyari  
\p
\v 9 'Ipaɨta katini'ɨkitakaitɨni 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ, hipatɨ yuhetsie yuri memɨte'eriekaikɨ kename heitseriemekɨ yametekahukai, mewaxani'erietɨ hipame, mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\v 10 «Teɨteri tukipa mekaneutiyune meyutanenewienike yuhutatɨ, xewitɨ paritseu pɨhɨkɨtɨkai, xewitɨta tewi kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tiwawame pɨhɨkɨtɨkai.  
\v 11 Merikɨtsɨ paritseu mana 'utakeka nenewieri kaniyupitɨakaitɨni mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Kakaɨyari, pamɨpariyutsi nekamanipitɨaka hipame teɨteri wahepaɨ nemɨka'anekɨ ne ―mɨkɨ mepɨtenawaya, heitseriemekɨ yamepɨkatekahu, hipame wa'ɨitama mepɨwakumaɨwa― meta nitsikere 'ikɨ tiwawame hepaɨ nepɨka'ane.  
\v 12 Ne matsi hutakɨa nepunetihakiwa xexuime tsemanatsie, ne'iwarika tamamatatsie mieme xeime nepɨyetuaya tukita”.  
\v 13 Hikɨ tiwawame yatewa 'uwetɨ pɨkayuwaɨriyakai tsikere yuheima meutinierekɨ, matsi yutawitsie yukuhutsunatɨ hiwerikakɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutainekaitɨni: “Kakaɨyari 'aku, kene'awaɨriya 'aixɨa pemɨnetixeiyakɨ, 'axanetiyuruwametɨme”.   
\p
\v 14 »Mɨpaɨ nepɨtixekɨhɨawe, mɨkɨ matsi yukie kaneyani heitserie hexeiyatɨ, paritseu pɨkatixaɨ. Yunaitɨ yuxaɨta mariweme memayuyeitɨwa tixaɨtɨ mekatehɨkɨtɨtɨ mekanayeitɨariekuni, peru kemɨ'ane tixaɨtɨ katihɨkɨtɨme mayuyeitɨwa mɨkɨ mariweme kanayeitɨariemɨkɨ».   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiuyuri tɨɨri wahetsie  
\r (Ruk 18:15-17 – Mat 19:13-15, Mar 10:13-16)  
\p
\v 15 Merikɨtsɨta tɨɨri mekaniwa'atɨwakaitɨni hetsɨana wahetsie mutimenikɨ. Mewaruxeiyaka, teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mekaniwarutate'akaitɨni memɨwa'atɨwakai.  
\v 16 Peru Ketsutsi yu'aurie kaniwarutahɨawe tɨɨri mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Xekeniwapitɨaka tɨɨri nehetsɨa memɨ'axenikɨ, wahɨxie xepɨka'u'uka, mɨpaɨ memɨ'anene kaniwahetsiemiemetɨni Kakaɨyari mɨra'aita.  
\v 17 Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, kemɨ'ane mɨka'itanaki'erieni Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aita nunutsi hepaɨ yuri ti'erietɨ, pɨkayɨwe mana meutahani».   
\s1 'Uki mɨxikutɨkai  
\r (Ruk 18:18-30 – Mat 19:16-29, Mar 10:17-30)  
\p
\v 18 Merikɨtsɨ xewitɨ teɨteri watsata mexɨakametɨtɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame 'aixɨa pemɨtiuka'iyari, ¿tita reuyewetse kenetiyurieni, nehetsie mɨtinakekɨ tukari mɨkaxɨwe?   
\p
\v 19 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya: ¿Titayari 'aixɨa netiuka'iyarime penetixata? Tewi 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyari 'apɨka'uyeika, Kakaɨyari yuxewitɨ 'aixɨa pɨtiuka'iyari pɨta.  
\v 20 'Ekɨtsɨ 'aitsikate pepɨmate: “Xeime 'ɨyaya kɨnaya pepɨkakumaɨwani, pepɨkati'amemiwani, pepɨkatinawayani, xeimetsie pepɨkarahɨpani peti'itawatɨ, 'apaapa meta 'amaama keniwareu'enieka”.   
\p
\v 21 'Iya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨkɨ naimetsie yanepɨtikamie temaikɨyari paitɨ.   
\p
\v 22 Ketsutsi 'u'enaka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Akuxi xewitɨ xeikɨa peuyewetse yapemɨtiyurieni: ketinetua 'apiinitɨarika naime, ketiniwarutamikwa haweri memɨ'anene, mɨpaɨ petiyurieme waɨkawa perexeiyatɨ pepayani taheima. 'Ana kenaye'a nehetsie ketineuwiya.   
\p
\v 23 Kepauka tewi 'ikɨ niuki mu'eni, waɨkawa kaniyukahiwerieni waɨkawa mɨrexeiyakaikɨ.  
\v 24 Hikɨ Ketsutsi 'ixeiyaka waɨkawa yuheiweriekame, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Kanikwaniweni xikutsixi memeutahaxɨanikɨ Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie.  
\v 25 Yurikɨ matsi, pɨkakwaniwe kameyu 'iwipame hɨxieyatsie manuyehanikɨ matsi pɨkwaniwe xiku meutahanikɨ Kakaɨyari mɨra'aitatsie.   
\p
\v 26 Memɨ'enanakai mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Kamɨtsɨ, ¿kemɨ'ane pɨyɨwe mɨtawikweni?   
\p
\v 27 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Teɨteri titatsie memɨkateyɨwawe, Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme katiniyɨweni.   
\p
\v 28 Hikɨ Pekuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Neuxei, tame tapiini tepɨte'uku'eiri naime 'ahetsie temɨtewiyakɨ.   
\p
\v 29 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, kemɨ'ane mɨtiuku'eiri Kakaɨyari kemɨti'aita hetsiemieme yukii, yɨ'ɨya, yu'iwama, yupaapama yatɨni yɨtɨriyama,  
\v 30 mɨkɨ kwini mieme matsi waɨkawa warexeiyatɨ kanayeimɨkɨ hikɨ, meta tukari 'umamietsie kepauka maye'ani, tukari mɨkaxɨwe hexeiyatɨ kanayeimɨkɨ.   
\s1 Tawari Ketsutsi kemutayɨ kemɨtimierienikekai  
\r (Ruk 18:31-33 – Mat 20:17-19, Mar 10:32-34)  
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ tamamata heimana memɨyuhuta yatewa warewitɨka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Neuxei, Kerutsareme tekanitahuni hikɨ, naitɨ kemɨre'uxa Kakaɨyari niukametemama waxapatsie Yuri Tewi hepaɨtsita, naitɨ katinaye'amɨkɨ.  
\v 32 Nekaniyetuiyamɨkɨ mɨkɨ memɨkahuriyutsixi wahetsɨa. Nekanitewiyatsitɨariemɨkɨ, 'axanekatinitahɨawariemɨkɨ,  
\v 33 mekaneniti'aɨtsikawiyakuni meha'atɨ, hikɨ menetsikuwaxɨame mekanenimiekuni. Peru hairieka tukari 'aye'ayu nekananukuketɨariemɨkɨ».  
\v 34 Mɨkɨ 'atsimepɨkatemaikai tita mɨtixatakai. Niukieya matsi pɨ'awietsiekai wahetsiemieme, 'atsimepɨkatehetima kemɨtikuxatakai.   
\s1 Makɨpekai kemɨranutanierixɨ kerikutanaka  
\r (Ruk 18:35-43 – Mat 20:29-34, Mar 10:46-52)  
\p
\v 35 Merikɨtsɨ Keriku kiekariyaritsie 'aye'aximekaku Ketsutsi, xewitɨ tewi mɨkaheuniere mana huye tetsita kaniukateitɨni tiwautɨ.  
\v 36 Hikɨ waru'enieka yumɨireme teɨteri me'anuyekɨkame kaniuta'iwauni kemɨtiyɨanekai.  
\v 37 Mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe kename Ketsutsi natsaretitanaka mana 'uyemiekai.   
\p
\v 38 Hikɨ mɨkaheuniere karima kaniutahiwa mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Ketsutsi, Rawiri pemɨnu'aya, keneneutinenimayata kwerietɨ.   
\p
\v 39 Memanuyetekai mekanitate'akaitɨni kayuwatɨ mɨtikanikɨ, peru matsi mɨkɨ karima mɨpaɨ katiniuhiwakaitɨni:  
\p —Rawiri pemɨnu'aya 'aku, keneneutinenimayata kwerietɨ.   
\p
\v 40 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mana 'utakeka kanita'aita mahanienikɨ hetsɨana. Nuaku 'auriena mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:   
\p
\v 41 —¿Tita pereuyehɨwa kenetiyurieni 'ahetsiemieme?  
\p Mɨkɨ rehɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame, nepeunierenikeyu.   
\p
\v 42 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Peheunieretɨ kenaye'a. Yuri pemɨti'eriekɨ 'aixɨa pe'anetɨ pepatɨa.   
\p
\v 43 Yapauka heunieretɨ kanayani. Hikɨ 'aixɨa 'utaitɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, Ketsutsi 'utɨa kaneyani, meta yunaitɨ teɨteri memixei witsimekaniutiyuanekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita.   
\c 19  
\s1 Tsakeu kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme tiwawame  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ heutahaka Kerikutsie hixɨata kaniuyemiekaitɨni.  
\v 2 Merikɨtsɨ tewi mana kaniukateitɨni Tsakeu titewatɨ, mɨkɨ tewawamete katiniwa'aitɨwametɨkaitɨni kuwiyexinu hetsiemieme, pɨxikutɨkai.  
\v 3 Kanixeiyamɨkɨkaitɨni Ketsutsi kemɨpaikɨtɨkai, peru 'etsimutewikaikɨ puyutatexi teɨteri memɨyumɨirekaikɨ.  
\v 4 Wahɨxie 'utanautsaka wapaitɨ kanitimake xapatsie mixeiyakɨ, mana muyeyanikekaikɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mana 'uyemietɨ kaneutiniere, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Tsakeu, kenakamaki xeiya. Peuyewetse 'akita nemenuanikɨ hikɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Kwitɨwa kanakamake, yutemawietɨ kanitanaki'erieni yukiita.   
\p
\v 7 Me'ixeiyaka yunaitɨ mekaniniukixiekaitɨni hepaɨtsitana mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Tewi 'axatiyuruwame hetsɨa punua».   
\p
\v 8 Peru Tsakeu mana 'uwetɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe Ti'aitame:  
\p —Neuxei, Ti'aitame: Nepiinite hixɨata 'arɨkame nepɨtiwamini tixaɨtɨ memɨkatehexeiya, 'itarikakɨ kenemɨtiwakwamanakai hipame, naukamekɨ nepɨrapika.   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kamɨ, 'ikɨ kie kiekatari meputawikweitsitɨarie hikɨ, 'ikɨta 'Apɨrahami kanixiɨyarieyatɨni.  
\v 10 Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa, nekaninuani nemɨwakuwaunenikɨ mɨkɨ memeuyexɨrie nemɨwatawikweitsitɨanikɨ.   
\s1 Tumini niukiyari  
\p
\v 11 Merikɨtsɨ 'ikɨ me'eniekaku tawari 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruta'ɨkitɨani, Kerutsareme mehurakaikɨ, meta teɨteri mɨpaɨ memɨteku'eriwakaikɨ kename kwitɨ 'itsutɨanikekai ti'aitatɨ Kakaɨyari matsiɨkɨtɨ 'ayame.  
\v 12 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Tewi we'eme mɨnu'ayatɨkai tewa kaniyemiekaitɨni xeime kwieyaritsie, mana ti'aitame mayeitɨarienikɨ, 'arikeke kaninuanikekaitɨni.  
\v 13 Hikɨ tamamata yuhetsɨa miemete te'uximayatamete warutakwewieka yuhɨxie, tumini kaniwaru'ɨitɨani xeitsienituyari yuxexuime. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: “Xekenemɨiriyani 'ikɨ tumini mexi nekanuawe”.  
\v 14 Merikɨtsɨ hetsɨana miemete kiekatari mekani'uxiwe'eriekaitɨni, niukamete mekaniwarenɨ'ani 'utɨmana mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: “Tame tepɨka'inaki'erie 'ikɨ mɨtati'aitɨakakɨ”.   
\p
\v 15 »Peru mɨyatɨtɨ, ti'aitame kanayeitɨarieni. Kepauka makunua yukwieyaritsie, katiniuta'aita hetsɨana memɨ'axɨanikɨ te'uximayatamete tumini mɨwaru'ɨitɨakai, yamɨretimanikɨ yuxexuitɨ kememɨte'itimɨiriyaxɨa.  
\v 16 Merikɨtsɨ mexɨakame kaninuani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Neti'aitɨwame, 'atumini xeitsienituyarikɨ, tamamata tsienituyari nepana'iwaxɨ”.  
\v 17 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “'Aixɨa pepɨtiuyuri, ti'uximayatame 'aixɨa pemɨtiuka'iyari pekanihɨkɨtɨni, 'etsitipaɨmeme petiuhɨritɨarieka yapemɨtikatɨakɨ, heitserie nekamenipitɨamɨkɨ tamamata kiekariyaritsie kuwexinaruri pemayanikɨ”.  
\v 18 Hikɨ xewitɨ kaninuani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Neti'aitɨwame, 'atumini xeitsienituyarikɨ, 'auxɨwi tsienituyari nepana'iwaxɨ”.  
\v 19 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: “'Ekɨta nekamanihɨritɨamɨkɨ 'auxɨwime kiekariyari”.   
\p
\v 20 »Hikɨ xewitɨta kaninuani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: “Neti'aitɨwame, kamɨ 'atumini, nepi'utakai tuwaxakɨ 'eimeme.  
\v 21 Nematsimakatɨ tewi pemɨti'akawawiriemɨkɨ pemɨhɨkɨkɨ: pemenu'ɨwe tita pemɨkatiyetua meta pemika'itsana tita pemɨkatiuka'e”.  
\v 22 Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya: “Ti'uximayatame 'axapemɨtiuka'iyari, 'ahetsie pepɨrahɨpa 'akɨmana kepemutayɨ. 'Ekɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ pepɨtimaikai kenemɨtiuyukawawiriemɨkɨ, nemenu'ɨwe tita nemɨkatiyetua meta nemuka'itsana tita nemɨkatiuka'e.  
\v 23 Kamɨtsɨ, ¿titayari tsikere netumini pekatiyetua tumini hɨwemete wahetsɨa, ne nenuame nemɨwaye'ɨnikekai mena'iwaxɨ?”  
\v 24 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mana memɨtanenierekai: “Mɨkɨ tumini xekeneunawairi, meta xekeneu'ɨitɨa 'iya tamamata tsienituyari mexeiya”.  
\v 25 Mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe: “Ti'aitame, tamamata kanexeiyaniri mɨkɨ”.  
\v 26 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe ti'aitame: “Mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, kemɨ'ane tixaɨtɨ mɨrexeiya, tawari matsi pɨtimikieni, peru kemɨ'ane mɨkarexeiya, tsepa 'etsiwa mɨrexeiya katininawaiyariemɨkɨ.  
\v 27 Mɨkɨ meta memɨnetsi'aye'uniekai memɨkanetsinaki'eriekai netiwa'aitɨwame nemayanikɨ, xekeniwarahapaka, nehɨxie xekeniwarukuya”».   
\s1 Kerutsareme kiekariyaritsie kemɨreutaha  
\r (Ruk 19:29-38 – Mat 21:1-9, Mar 11:1-10, Wa 12:12-15)  
\p
\v 28 Merikɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka kaneyani Kerutsareme tiyuneke.  
\v 29 Kepauka Wetɨpake meta Wetaniya kiekariyaritetsie mɨta'aximekai, yemuri Huriwa Mati'u mɨrakutewatsie hetɨa, teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete yuhetsɨa miemete yuhutame kaniwarutanɨ'ani,  
\v 30 mɨpaɨ haitɨ: «Kiekari 'anutaɨye mukumatsie xekenehu, meta mana xemeutahaxɨanitsie, xepeitaxeiya puxu temaikɨ hakuwiekame, tewi hetsiena mɨka'anutiyerɨwe 'akuxi. Xekenakuxɨna meta xekenahani 'ena.  
\v 31 Xewitɨ xɨka mɨpaɨ tixeku'iwawiyani: “¿Titayari xete'ekuxɨna?”, mɨpaɨ xeketenetahɨawi: “Ti'aitame peiyehɨwa”».   
\p
\v 32 Hikɨ memutanɨ'arie mekanekɨne, mekaneitaxeiya kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ.  
\v 33 Puxu temaikɨ me'akuxɨnakaku, kutsiyarimama mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayari xete'ekɨxɨna puxu temaikɨ?   
\p
\v 34 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame peiyehɨwa.   
\p
\v 35 Hikɨ Ketsutsi hetsɨa mekaneihana. Hikɨta yɨ'ɨkarite me'anuti'itaka puxu temaikɨ hetsie, Ketsutsi mekananutiyeni.  
\v 36 Kepauka mumiekai, teɨteri mekani'itɨaximekaitɨni yɨ'ɨkarite huyeta.   
\p
\v 37 Hikɨ Huriwa Maku'u yemuriyari hetɨa wiyeta me'ukahutɨ, yunaitɨ teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete meyumɨiretɨ meyutemamawietɨ mekanitsutɨani karima 'aixɨa me'utiyuatɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, naime kememɨte'uxei tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:   
\q1
\v 38 —'Aixɨa ke'itɨarieka Ti'aitame 'umamie Tati'aitɨwame hetsɨa miemetɨtɨ.  
\b  
\q1 —Taheima 'aixɨa meketeyuxeiyani, wapaitɨ witsimeke'utiyuaneni.   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ paritseutsixi hipatɨ memu'uwakai teɨteri watsata mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, 'ahetsɨa miemete keniwarutati'a teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete.   
\p
\v 40 Mɨpaɨ mɨkɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, 'ikɨ xɨka kayuwatɨ me'umakake, tetexi pɨta mepɨtihiwakeyu.   
\s1 Ketsutsi tukita  
\r (Ruk 19:45-46 – Mat 21:12-16, Mar 11:15-18, Wa 2:13-16)  
\p
\v 41 Merikɨtsɨ 'ahurawa 'umietɨ 'ixeiyaka kiekari, kaniutatsuani he'eriwatɨ,  
\v 42 mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Ekɨtɨtɨ tsikere 'ikɨ tukaritsie xɨka tɨma peheitimanike tita mɨreuyewetse para 'aixɨa pemɨtixeiyariekakɨ. Matsi kaniuti'awietsieni hikɨ 'ahɨxikɨ pemɨka'ixeiyakɨ.  
\v 43 Tukari kanaye'amɨkɨ, 'ana mɨkɨ memɨmatsi'aye'unie kuya tetsariyayari mekaniti'uitɨakuni 'a'aurie, 'ana 'a'aurie mekaniti'uikuni, para teɨteri memɨkawayekɨnekɨ.  
\v 44 Mekamanatihɨakuni kwiepa 'ekɨ meta 'ateɨterima 'ahetsie memɨyetei mepatixɨriyani kwiepa. 'Ahetsie tete xewitɨ pɨkaku'eiriwa yuheima 'atetɨ, mɨpaɨ katiniyɨmɨkɨ 'ekɨ yuri pemɨkatiuta'erikɨ kepauka Kakaɨyari munua matsitawikweitsitɨanike.   
\p
\v 45 Meta Kakaɨyari tukieya kuraruyarita kaneutahani hikɨ kanitsutɨani waranuyeweweiyatɨ muwa memɨtetuakai,  
\v 46 mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Ipaɨ katine'uka: “Nekii nenewieri kiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨni”. Peru xeme terɨ xekanayeitɨani “hakewa tenawayamete memeyu'awieta”».   
\p
\v 47 Merikɨtsɨ tukarikɨ katini'ɨkitakaitɨni tuki kuraruyarita, mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete, meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai, meta teɨteri wa'ukiyarima yunaitɨ mekanikuwautɨwekaitɨni me'imienike.  
\v 48 Peru mɨkɨ mekaniyutatexieni mɨpaɨ meteyurienike, yunaitɨ teɨteri memi'eniekaikɨ me'ihiwe'erietɨ niukieya.   
\c 20  
\s1 Ketsutsi heitserie kemɨrexeiyakai  
\r (Ruk 20:1-8 – Mat 21:23-27, Mar 11:27-33)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ heiwa teɨteri tiwa'ɨkitɨakaku tuki 'amɨpa kuraruyarita, niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne wakuxaxatɨwakaku, mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai meta 'ukirawetsixi hurawa mekaniukɨne.  
\v 2 Mɨpaɨ mekatenita'iwawiya:  
\p —Ketatineutaxatɨa, ¿Hakewa miemekɨ heitserie pehexeiyatɨ mɨya pepɨtiyuriene? ¿Kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ heitserie pɨmatsi'upitɨa?   
\p
\v 3 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Netatsiere nepɨxeta'iwawiya xeme. Yaxekeneteneutahɨawi:  
\v 4 Wani kemɨti'ɨyanekai, ¿taheima timiemetɨkai, nutsu teɨteri wahetsɨa pɨmiemetɨkai?   
\p
\v 5 Mɨkɨ, mɨpaɨ mekateniyutahɨawekaitɨni: «Xɨka tame mɨpaɨ te'utiyuani: “Taheima makawe pipitɨakai”, mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ pɨtatitahɨawe: “Merikɨte, titayari yuri xekate'ita'eriri”.  
\v 6 Xɨkata mɨpaɨ te'utiyuani: “Teɨteri mepipitɨakai”, yunaitɨ teɨteri tetekɨ mepɨtatsitituaxa, yuri memɨte'eriekɨ kename Wani Kakaɨyari niukameya hɨkɨtɨkai».   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —'Atsitepɨkatemate hakewa mieme mepitɨariekai.   
\p
\v 8 Mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Merikɨte, neta 'atsinepɨkatixetahɨawe kemɨ'ane heitserie mɨnetsi'upitɨa yanemɨtiyurienenikɨ 'ikɨ naime.   
\s1 Te'ɨwiyamete 'axamemɨte'u'iyari niukiyari  
\r (Ruk 20:9-19 – Mat 21:33-46, Mar 12:1-12)  
\p
\v 9 Merikɨtsɨta kaniwarutaxatɨani teɨteri 'ikɨ 'ɨxatsi 'inɨarikɨ mɨtikuxata mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Tewi kaxie haraweriyari kaniutawewieni, te'ɨwiyamete kaniwaruhɨritɨani wakwetatɨatɨ, hikɨ 'ateewa paitɨ kaneyani mɨixa heuyehunike.  
\v 10 Hikɨ tukari 'aye'aku matikwakwaxetsie, xeime ti'uximayatame kaniutanɨ'ani te'ɨwiyamete wahetsɨa memiyetuirienikɨ harawerita timieme yapaɨmeme kutsiyari hetsiemieme. Peru te'ɨwiyamete mekanitiwaxɨani meta yumaweme mekanenɨ'ani.  
\v 11 Hikɨ tawarita xeime ti'uximayatame kaniutanɨ'ani, peru mɨkɨta mekaneitiwaxɨani, mekanititieni meta yumaweme mekanenɨ'ani.  
\v 12 Tawari hairieka xeime kaniutanɨ'ani, mɨkɨta mekanixuritɨani meta mekaneyeweiya.   
\p
\v 13 »Hikɨ kaxie haraweriyari kutsiyari mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: “¿Keri netiyurieni? Neniwe nepanunɨ'ani neminaki'erie, yurikɨ mɨkɨ hɨrixɨa mekanetimakakuni”.  
\v 14 Peru, kepauka te'ɨwiyamete memixei, niuki mekaniutixɨatɨatɨkɨne mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: “'Ikɨ hetsie 'arike katininakimɨkɨ kutsiyari tipiinieya. Hikɨmɨ tepimieni, tita hetsiena mɨtinakekekai tapiini pɨrayani”.  
\v 15 Hikɨ haraweri warie mekaneikahɨani meta mekanimieni.  
\p »¿Kewayurieni haraweri kutsiyari?  
\v 16 Kaninuamɨkɨ, kaniwakwimɨkɨ mɨkɨ te'ɨwiyamete, hipame pɨta kaniwahɨritɨamɨkɨ yuharaweri».  
\p Mɨkɨ memɨ'enanakai mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ mɨkatiniuyɨnike.   
\p
\v 17 'Iya waxeiyatɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Merikɨte, xɨka mɨpaɨ katiuyɨni, ¿titayari 'ipaɨ raine 'utɨarika:  
\q1 »“Mɨkɨ teté memitixani'eri kii wewiwamete,  
\q2 mɨkɨ teté 'itsikina mieme kanayani”?   
\m
\v 18 Yunaitɨ mɨkɨ tetetsie memɨkaxɨrieni mepɨtanexɨani, xɨka mɨkɨ teté xeime hetsie 'ukaweni, kwauni xeikɨa pɨtanexɨani».   
\p
\v 19 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai meta mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete mekatenikuwautɨwekaitɨni kememɨte'iwiyakɨ, mɨpaɨ metehetimaika mɨkɨ mɨwaxatakaikɨ mɨkɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita ti'ɨkitatɨ, peru mekaniwamakarɨkaitɨni teɨteri.   
\s1 Kuwiyexinu tuminieya  
\r (Ruk 20:20-26 – Mat 22:15-22, Mar 12:13-17)  
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ me'itihupienike mekaniwarutanɨ'ani 'awie nenieremete teɨteri heitseriemekɨ yamemɨtekahu wahepaɨ meteyumaikame. Me'iwiyame niukieyakɨ mekaniyetuanikekaitɨni, kuwexinaruri mita'iwawiyakɨ 'itsɨkame.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ mɨkɨ mekaniku'iwawiyakaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, tame tepɨtemate 'ekɨ heitseriemekɨ pepɨtikuxata, heitseriemekɨ pepɨti'ɨkita. Yɨkɨ pepɨkatiwaxeiya teɨteri, matsi Kakaɨyari huyeya hepaɨtsita pepɨti'ɨkita yurikɨ.  
\v 22 ¿Ti'aitame Tsetsaxi tumini kemɨtiwawa, 'aixɨa ti'ane temɨteyutuaka nutsu pɨkatixaɨ?   
\p
\v 23 Timaitɨ kememɨte'i'irɨwiyakai, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Titayari xenete'inɨatatɨwe.  
\v 24 Tumini xekeneneuxeitsitɨa. ¿Kepai ramu'u pɨra'uxa, kepai pɨra'utɨarika?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Tsetsaxi mu'uya kanihɨkɨtɨni meta pɨ'utɨarikaya.   
\p
\v 25 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kamɨtsɨ xeketeneyetua Tsetsaxi hetsɨa tita Tsetsaxi hetsɨa mɨtimieme, meta xeketeneyetua Kakaɨyari hetsɨa tita Kakaɨyari hetsɨa mɨtimieme.   
\p
\v 26 Mepɨyutatexi niukieyatsie me'iwiyakutɨ teɨteri wahɨxie, mehɨxiyatɨ mɨya mɨtiwarutahɨawixɨkɨ, kayuwatɨ mekaniutamare.   
\s1 Mɨkite kememɨte'anuku'uni hepaɨtsita  
\r (Ruk 20:27-40 – Mat 22:23-33, Mar 12:18-27)  
\p
\v 27 Merikɨtsɨ hipatɨ tsarutseutsixi mekaniu'axɨani, mɨpaɨ memutiyuanekai kename mɨkite meka'anuku'uwe, hikɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'iwawiya:   
\p
\v 28 —Ti'ɨkitame, Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniu'utɨani tahetsiemieme, tewi xɨka 'umɨni xɨka 'uka 'uku'eirieni tɨɨri kawarayexeiyawetɨ, mutaya kanitiwitɨmɨkɨ yukwe, tɨɨri mɨwarayexeiya matsieya nuiwarieya memakɨnekɨ.  
\v 29 Merikɨtsɨ 'amenititekaitɨni 'iwamarixi 'atahuta meyupaɨmetɨ. Wamatsika 'utineɨkeka kaniumɨni tɨɨri kawarayexeiyawetɨ.  
\v 30 Hikɨ hutarieka mieme  
\v 31 meta hairieka mieme mekanitiwitɨni mɨkɨ 'uka, mɨpaɨ yaxeikɨa 'atahutatɨ yunaitɨ mekaniukwini tɨɨri mekawarayexeiyaka.  
\v 32 'Imatɨrieka, kaniumɨnita 'uka.  
\v 33 Merikɨte, kepauka xeniu memanuku'uni, 'atahutatɨ memitiwitɨ, ¿kemɨ'ane ra'ɨya pɨrayani?   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Hikɨ miemete teɨteri mepɨneneɨke mepɨwikie.  
\v 35 Mɨkɨ wahetsie mɨtinake mɨkɨ kwie mɨhekwatsie memaye'axɨanikɨ, wahetsie mɨtinake memanuku'unikɨ mɨkite watsata, mɨkɨ mepɨkatineɨkixɨani meta mepɨkatiwikitɨariexɨani.  
\v 36 Mɨkɨ meta, 'ana mepɨkayɨwaweni tawari memɨkwinikɨ, Kakaɨyari niukieya tuayametemama wahepaɨ mepɨ'aneneni. Matsi Kakaɨyari niwemama mekanihɨkɨtɨni, mɨkɨ memanuku'uikɨ.  
\v 37 Mɨkite kememɨte'anuku'uni, mɨpaɨta Muitsexi katiniu'ɨkita, yuxapatsie hakewa 'ɨtsi maxaxata, mana Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ pɨrahɨawe: “'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu wakakaɨyari”.  
\v 38 'Ayumieme mɨkite pɨkawaxata kename wakakaɨyari maine, memayeyuyuri pɨta wakakaɨyari kaniyuxatani, tsepa memukwi, yunaitɨ mɨkɨ mepayeneniere hepaɨtsitana.   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai hipatɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, 'aixɨa pepaine.   
\p
\v 40 Hikɨ tawariri mepɨkayuwaɨri tixaɨtɨkɨ memɨte'ita'iwawiyakɨ.   
\s1 Kɨritsitu kemɨ'ane pɨranuiwari  
\r (Ruk 20:41-47 – Mat 22:41–23:7, Mar 12:35-40)  
\p
\v 41 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe Ketsutsi:  
\p —¿Titayari mɨpaɨ mete'utiyuane kename Kɨritsitu Rawiri nuiwarieya hɨkɨ?  
\v 42 Mɨkɨ Rawiri tɨtɨ kwikari xapayaritsie mɨpaɨ kanaineni:  
\q1 »“Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe Neti'aitɨwame:  
\q2 ‘Netserieta kenakani,   
\q1
\v 43 ne nekaniwaka'unamɨkɨ memɨmatsi'aye'unie,  
\q2 'ahɨxie nekaniwa'atɨamɨkɨ’ ”.   
\m
\v 44 Rawiri “Neti'aitɨwame” Kɨritsitu katiniuterɨwani, ¿kehapaɨtɨtɨ nu'aya pɨhɨkɨtɨni?»   
\p
\v 45 Merikɨtsɨ yunaitɨ teɨteri me'i'eniekaku mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete:   
\p
\v 46 —Xekeneyukweriwayurieka mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitamete wahepaɨtsita. Mɨkɨ pɨwanake 'etɨtɨme me'anakatɨtɨ memeu'uwanikɨ, meta yemekɨ pɨwanake waɨritsika memɨpitɨarienikɨ kiekari hixɨapa meta teɨteri wahɨxie memayaxekɨ tuki 'etsimɨpepeta, meta kiekame 'aurie memayaxekɨ 'ixɨararipa.  
\v 47 Mɨkɨ wiuratsixi wapiini mepɨtewarutixɨtɨiri, meta 'emepɨteheutetere meyunenewietɨ mɨkamatsiɨkɨnikɨ kememɨteyurie. Mɨkɨ wahetsie matsi waɨkawa katinahɨiyamɨkɨ.   
\c 21  
\s1 Wiura Kakaɨyari tumini kemɨti'atɨiri  
\r (Ruk 21:1-4 – Mar 12:41-44)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ heutaniereka kaniwaruxeiya xikutsixi tumini mawariyari me'akaxɨrɨwame tumini kakuniyaritsie tukita.  
\v 2 Meta 'uka tiuxei kɨnaya mumɨ tuminikɨ mɨmawekai mana heikaxɨrɨwame huta tsenitawuyari.   
\p
\v 3 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, 'ikɨ wiura tuminikɨ mawetɨ kakunitsie kaneikaxɨrieni waɨkawa, mɨkɨ yunaitɨ 'etsiwa xeikɨa mekaneikaxɨrieni.  
\v 4 Mɨkɨ yunaitɨ manayuhayewa mekaneukaxɨrieni Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme 'imikieri. 'Ikɨ 'uka yuhaweri mieme pɨta neukaxɨrieni kɨmana mɨtiyumikwakai naime.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemutayɨ tuki kemɨtika'unarienikekai  
\r (Ruk 21:5-36, 12-17 – Mat 24:1-51, 10:17-22, Mar 13:1-37)  
\p
\v 5 Merikɨtsɨ hipatɨ teyɨ'ɨkitɨwametemama tuki 'amɨpa hepaɨtsita mekatenikuxatakaitɨni, kemɨtikemaritɨariekai tete witsi'anenemekɨ mawari witsi'anenemekɨ. Peru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni Ketsutsi:   
\p
\v 6 —Xepixeiya 'ikɨ, tukari kanaye'amɨkɨ kepauka mɨkahayewarieni tete yuheima 'atetɨ, naitɨ kanika'unariemɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 7 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'iwawiya:  
\p —Ti'ɨkitame, ¿kepauka mɨpaɨ pɨtiyɨni kepemaine, tita ti'inɨariyaritɨni maye'aximenitsie mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨnitsie?   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xekeneyukweriwayurieka nɨka xete'u'itaiyarieni. Yumɨiretɨ mepɨ'axɨani kename ne neyɨane, mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: “Neri nepɨhɨkɨ. Tukari kanaye'aniri”. Wa'utɨma xepɨkahekɨkani.  
\v 9 Kepauka mɨpaɨ xemɨte'enanani kename xaɨtsie kuyaxa hexuawe, meta kepauka xemɨtetamarieni kename hipatɨ me'anuku'uixime kuyakɨ, xepɨkamamaka. Peuyewetse mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨnikɨ meri, peru 'akuxi 'ana kwitɨ kwie pɨkaheutipare.   
\p
\v 10 'Ana mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Nuiwarite mekaniwatakwikuni hipame nuiwarite meta xexuime kwieyaritsie kiekatari hipame kwieyaritsie kiekatari.  
\v 11 Kwie karima kanitayuamɨkɨ, haka kanitawemɨkɨ meta waɨkawa kwiniya naitsarie mɨtiuyehane, muyuawitsie 'inɨari mamariwawetɨ kanitixuawerimɨkɨ kɨmana xekanimamakakuni.   
\p
\v 12 »Peru 'ikɨ yakatiyɨwekaku 'akuxi, mepɨxetiwiya xeme meta mepɨxe'anuyeweiya. Mepɨxeyetuani tukiteta meta katsariyanata xemanutaxɨriyanikɨ, meta nehetsɨa xemɨmiemetekɨ xepanuhapanieni te'aitamete meta kuwexinaruritsixi wahɨxie.  
\v 13 Mɨpaɨ xe'itɨarieme xeme xekaniyɨwawekuni xemɨtetahekɨatakɨ mɨkɨ wahɨxie.  
\v 14 'Ayumieme yu'iyari xekenetseiriyani, xetiwiyarieme xepɨkayu'iyaritɨaka kexemutiyuaneni,  
\v 15 ne pɨta temaiwawemete nekanixe'ayeitɨamɨkɨ, xemɨtiniunikɨ, 'ayumieme yunaitɨ memɨxe'aye'unie mekaniyutatexikuni mexe'a'iwakutɨ mexeniukimakutɨ.  
\v 16 'Atsita xe'ukiyarima, xe'iwama, xemarema, xehamikuma mekanixeyetuakuni, meta hipatɨ xeme xekanikwi'iwakuni.  
\v 17 Yunaitɨ mekanixe'uxiwe'eriekakuni nehetsɨa xemɨmiemetekɨ.  
\v 18 Peru nixei kɨpayari pɨkaheuyeweni xemu'utsie mieme.  
\v 19 Xɨka xeme heitseriemekɨ xe'uhuni, xekaniyutawikweitsitɨakuni.   
\p
\v 20 »Kepauka xemɨwaxeiya kuyaxi Kerutsareme 'aurie meyukuxeɨrieximekaku, 'ana mɨpaɨ xekatenimaikakuni kename 'ari hehura kepauka 'akumawetɨ mayani.  
\v 21 Hikɨ 'ana mɨkɨ Kureya kwieyaritsie memu'uwani meke'uyuta'una hɨritsie, kemɨ'ane kiekaritsie memɨtiteni mekewayekɨne, meta kemɨ'ane yeuta memu'uwani mepɨkahakununuwani kiekaritsie.  
\v 22 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie heitseriemekɨ mepɨte'apiniyarieni kiekatari, 'ana katinaye'amɨkɨ naitɨ kemɨre'uxa.  
\v 23 Xɨa'ui mɨkɨ memuhukani meta memɨtetsitsitɨwani mɨkɨ tukaritsie. Karikɨ 'uximatɨarika waɨkawa kanitawemɨkɨ kwiepa, meta haxɨa kanitixuawerimɨkɨ 'ikɨ teɨteri wahepaɨtsita.  
\v 24 'Ixiparakɨ mekanitakwi'iwakuni, yunaime nuiwarite wahetsɨa mekananuhapaniekuni waɨriyarika. Nuiwarite memɨkatateɨterima mepika'una Kerutsareme mexi mɨkɨta watukari katapariwe.   
\p
\v 25 »'Inɨarite pɨtixuawere, tautsie, metsatsie meta xurawetsixi wahetsie. Kwiepa, nuiwarite mepɨyuhiwerieka meta mekanimamakakuni haramara yuarikaya me'enietɨ meta hamewari.  
\v 26 Marikakɨ teɨteri mepɨ'amɨxɨani metemaitɨ kwiepa memɨtama kememɨ'itɨarieni, karikɨ tɨrɨkariya memexeiya muyuawitsie miemete mepɨkuyuitɨarieni.  
\v 27 Hikɨ 'ana Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa mekanenixeiyakuni haitsata ne'akamieme netɨrɨkaɨyeme meta waɨkawa nexawatɨme.  
\v 28 Yatitsutɨarieximekaku xekeneutineniereni 'aixɨa xeketeneyumaika, 'ana paye'aximeni kepauka xemɨtixɨnarieni».   
\p
\v 29 Hikɨ 'ɨxatsi hepaɨtsita tikuxatatɨ katiniwaruta'ɨkitɨani mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Xekeneu'ixɨari pini meta hipame kɨyexi.  
\v 30 Kepauka mɨtixawata, xe'i'ixɨarietɨ yɨkɨmana xepɨtemaika tatsɨari 'ahurakaku.  
\v 31 Yaxeikɨata 'ikɨ, kepauka xemɨneniere kenemutayɨ tiyɨaneme, mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika Kakaɨyari kemɨtita'aita 'ari kanehuraniri.   
\p
\v 32 »Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, 'ikɨ naitɨ yapɨtiyɨni mexi hikɨ miemete mekakwiwawe.  
\v 33 Muyuawi meta kwie pukumawere, peru neniuki pɨkakumawere.   
\p
\v 34 »Xekeneyɨ'ɨwiyani kapa xe'iyari 'u'itutuperekɨ xeku'ixɨaratɨwekaku xetarɨwekaku kwiepa mieme tukarikɨ xeyu'iyaritɨakaku. Xɨka mɨpaɨ xeteyuriekake, 'iya tukari yapauka pɨxe'axe,  
\v 35 winiyari hepaɨ, mɨkɨ tukaritsie mekanita'axiyariekuni yunaitɨ kwiepa memɨtama naitsarie.  
\v 36 Xekenayeneniereni 'aixɨa, yuheyemekɨ xeyunenewietɨ para xemɨyɨwawenikɨ, Yuri Tewi hɨxie xemaye'axɨanikɨ xetawikweme 'uximatɨarikatsata 'umɨramie».   
\p
\v 37 Merikɨtsɨ tukarikɨ tuki 'amɨpa kuraruyarita kaniuyeikakaitɨni ti'ɨkitatɨ, tɨkarikɨ wayeyeikatɨ Huriwa Maku'u yemuriyaritsie nehupukaitɨni.  
\v 38 Yunaitɨ teɨteri ximeri yuimuana mekani'axekaitɨni hetsɨana me'i'enienike tukipa.   
\c 22  
\s1 Kura Ketsutsi kemɨtiyetuanikekai  
\r (Ruk 22:1-2 – Mat 26:2-5, Mar 14:1-2, 10-11)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka 'ixɨarariyari kanahurakaitɨni, Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari mɨtitewakai.  
\v 2 Hikɨ mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai tixaɨtɨ mekatenikuwautɨwekaitɨni Ketsutsi kememɨtemienikekai, teɨteri mewamakatɨ.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ Kauyumarie Kura 'Itsikariutitanaka hetsie kaneutahani, mɨkɨ tamamata heimana memɨyuhuta mɨwanɨkai.  
\v 4 Heyaka mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete meta wakuyaxima wahetsɨa, katiniwarutaxatɨani Ketsutsi kemɨtiwayetuirienikekai.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ mekaniyutemamawiekaitɨni, mekaniuyu'enieni kename tumini me'i'ɨitɨanikekai.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨta yakatiniutanaki'erieni, hikɨ katinikuwaunekaitɨni kepauka 'aixɨa mɨyɨnikekai mɨwayetuirienikɨ teɨteri me'umawekaku.   
\s1 Ti'aitame 'ikwaiya  
\r (Ruk 22:7-34 – Mat 26:17-35, Mar 14:12-31, 14:18-21, 1Kur 11:23-25, Wa 13:21-30, 37-38)  
\p
\v 7 Merikɨtsɨ kepauka Paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka 'ixɨarariyari maye'a, kepauka muxa nunutsi mutimemieriwa Patsikwa 'ikwaiyari hetsiemieme.  
\v 8 Hikɨ Ketsutsi kaniwarutanɨ'ani Pekuru meta Wani mɨpaɨ tiwarahɨawetɨ:  
\p —Xekenehu 'aixɨa xeketenekuyuri Patsikwa 'ikwaiyari temekwanikɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Hakewa pɨmatsihenake 'aixɨa temɨtehekuyurienikɨ.   
\p
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xeme xeheutahaxɨaximekaku kiekaritsie tewi mana pɨxe'anukunake ye'ɨ 'ahanatɨ hekuhanɨka. Mɨkɨ xekenanuweiya kiita hakewa meutahani.  
\v 11 Mɨpaɨ xeketenetahɨawi kiekame: “Ti'ɨkitame mɨpaɨ paine: ¿Hakewa kii mɨkɨ muwa nemɨtiwa'ɨkitɨa wahamatɨa Patsikwa 'ikwaiyari nemukwani?”  
\v 12 Mɨkɨ kii taɨta xeheutiwitɨme kanixexeitsitɨamɨkɨ hipame kii 'amuyeyewa naitɨ 'ureyepikame. Muwa 'aixɨa xeketeneyuri.   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ mekanekɨne, mekaneitaxeiya kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ. Muwa Patsikwa 'ikwaiyari hetsiemieme 'aixɨa mekateniukuyurieni.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ 'aye'aku, mexatsie kaniutiyerɨni meta nɨ'arimama yaxeikɨa.  
\v 15 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kwinimieme nepihiwe'eriekai xehamatɨa 'ikɨ 'ixɨarari 'ikwaiyari nemɨkwanikɨ nekatikwiniwetɨ 'akuxi.  
\v 16 Yanepɨtixekɨhɨawe, tawari 'ikɨ nepɨkakwani mexi ka'aye'awe tita 'ixɨarari mɨti'inɨariyari Kakaɨyari ti'aitametɨkaku.   
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ tekɨxi 'anuhanaka pamɨpariyutsi 'ipitɨaka Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xekenanuhani 'ikɨ, yuxexuitɨ xekenanuti'inɨataxɨa.  
\v 18 Mɨpaɨ nepɨxerahɨawe, tawari kaxie hayari nepɨka'anu'ieni mexi ka'aye'awe Kakaɨyari mitsutɨani ti'aitatɨ.   
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ paa 'anu'ɨka pamɨpariyutsi 'ipitɨaka Kakaɨyari 'ititaraka kaniwarumini mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Ikɨ kaninewaiyaritɨni xehetsiemieme mɨyetuiyani, 'ipaɨ xeketeneyurieka xemɨnetsiha'eriwanikɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Yaxeikɨata katiniuyurieni tekɨxi hepaɨtsita mete'ukwaku, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Ikɨ tekɨxita mieme tɨratu mɨhekwa kanihɨkɨtɨni nexuriyakɨ 'aixɨa mɨ'itɨarieni, xehetsiemieme kemɨtitayeuriyani.  
\v 21 Perutsɨ kemɨ'ane mɨnetsiyetuani 'ena paka, mamaya mexatsie pama hakewa nemaka.  
\v 22 Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa, nekaniyemieni nemɨmierienikɨ, kemɨti'aitsie yamɨtiyɨnikɨ, perutsɨ xɨa'ui kemɨ'ane mɨnetsiyetuani.   
\p
\v 23 Mɨkɨ mekanitsutɨani niuki mexɨatɨatɨ kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ mɨxatakai kename mɨya tiyurienikekai 'utaitɨ.   
\p
\v 24 Metatsiereta meyuniukimatɨ mekanakɨne kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ matsi waɨkawa meuyewetse mayanikekai.  
\v 25 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Nuiwarite tewa'aitɨwamete mekateniwa'uxitɨaka yuteɨterima, meta mɨkɨ wahetsie 'itsɨkate memɨhɨkɨ yuhetsiemieme mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuaneni kename 'aixɨa meteyuruwamete.  
\v 26 Xeme pɨta mɨpaɨ xepɨkayɨaka. 'Apɨta, kemɨ'ane xeme mɨmariwe mɨkɨ kemɨ'ane tixaɨtɨ mɨkatihɨkɨ hepaɨ keyɨaneni, meta kemɨ'ane mɨtixe'aitɨa mɨkɨ kemɨ'ane xehetsiemieme mɨti'uximaya hepaɨ keyɨaneni.  
\v 27 Kexeteku'eriwa, ¿kemɨ'ane matsi pumariwe, kemɨ'ane kiekametɨtɨ mɨtikwa'a, kemɨ'ane miparewie timikwatɨ, mɨkɨ nutsu pumariwe? Xɨari kiekame matsi pumariwe. Perutsɨ ne xetsata nepuyeika xehetsiemieme neti'uximayatɨ pɨta.  
\v 28 Xeme nehetsie xekateniwiyakaitɨni xekatehayewatɨ ne'inɨatsienekaku.  
\v 29 Ne'ukiyari kemɨnerayeitɨa ti'aitame, neta yaxeikɨa te'aitamete nekanixe'ayeitɨamɨkɨ.  
\v 30 Nehamatɨa xekatenikwaikuni xekateni'ikuni mexa 'aurie ne'akaime neti'aitametɨkaku, 'itsɨkate xekanakɨnikuni, 'uwenitsie xe'ayaxeme xekateniwa'aitɨakakuni teɨteri tamamata heimana huta 'Ixaheri nuiwarimama.   
\p
\v 31 »Neuxei, Tsimuni, yumarima 'aixɨa, Kauyumarie pɨxe'uta'iwau, pɨxeta'inɨata, pɨxetikatse tɨriku hepaɨ.  
\v 32 Ne matsi nepɨnetanenewi 'ahetsiemieme pemɨkatihayewakɨ yuri peti'erietɨ. 'Ekɨta kepauka pemɨtihayewa peheuyewautsetɨ keniwatuikani 'a'iwama».   
\p
\v 33 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ti'aitame, nepɨnewaɨriya 'ahetsie nemɨtiwiyani tsepa nemanutahɨiya tsepa nemumierie.   
\p
\v 34 Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Pekuru 'aku, mɨpaɨ nepɨmatikɨhɨawe, wakana katahiwawekaku 'akuxi hikɨ, 'ekɨ haikakɨa pekani'aku'imawamɨkɨ, kename pekanetsimate pe'utaitɨ.   
\p
\v 35 Hikɨ mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kepauka nemɨxeheutanɨ'axɨa kɨtsiuri, xerai, kakai xekate'upikame, ¿tixaɨ xeteheuyehɨakai 'aku?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Tixaɨ.   
\p
\v 36 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Hikɨtsɨ pɨta mɨpaɨ pɨkatiyɨni, kemɨ'ane kɨtsiuri mexeiya keheihurieni, xerai meta yaxeikɨa. Kemɨ'ane mɨkaheixeiya kuya kutsiraya yɨ'ɨkari ke'utuani ke'inaneni.  
\v 37 Yanepɨtixekɨhɨawe, peuyewetse nehetsie maye'atɨarienikɨ mɨpaɨ kemɨre'uxa: “'Inɨari niukiyari tsanamete wahepaɨ kaniu'itɨarieni”. Naitɨ nehepaɨtsita kemɨre'uxa kanaye'atɨarieximeni.   
\p
\v 38 Hikɨ mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Ti'aitame, neuxei 'ena kutsirate hutatɨ.  
\p Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei 'ariri.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiyutanenewi Ketitsemanitsie  
\r (Ruk 22:40-46 – Mat 26:36-46, Mar 14:32-42)  
\p
\v 39 Merikɨtsɨ wayeyaka kaneyani hakewa me'axekai Huriwa Maku'u yemuriyaritsie, teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete mekaniweiyakaitɨni.  
\v 40 Hikɨ muwa heta'aka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xekeneyunenewieka, kapa 'axaxete'uyurienikɨ xemɨta'inɨatsienitsie».  
\v 41 Hikɨ yuxaɨta kananayeyani memakutekaitsie yatewa kaniuyani tete kemɨrehɨiwa yakɨtɨtɨ, 'utitunumakeka kaniyutanenewieni,  
\v 42 mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Ne'ukiyari, xɨka pe'awaɨriyani, yanepɨra'eriwakaku mɨka'aye'anikɨ kenemɨtikwinitɨarieni, matsi kemɨnetinake ne pɨkatixaɨ, kemɨmatinake 'ekɨ pɨta yaketiuyɨni».  
\v 43 Hikɨ niuki tuayame matsiɨkɨtɨ kanayuyeitɨani hɨxiena taheima mieme 'itɨrɨkariyatɨ.  
\v 44 Hikɨ kwiyɨanetɨ hiwerikakɨ, matsi kwini mieme yutatuatɨ kaniyunenewiekaitɨni, kwaxiyaya xuriya tsuniriyari hepaɨ kani'anenekaitɨni kwiepa kaxɨrɨwetɨ.   
\p
\v 45 Kepauka mɨtiutahayewaxɨ yunenewietɨ 'anukukeka teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wahetsɨa nuaka mana kaniwarutaxeiya mekutsume hiwerikakɨ.  
\v 46 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayari xetekutsu? Xekenanuku'uti xekeneyunenewieka kapa 'axaxete'uyurienikɨ xemɨta'inɨatsienitsie.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiuwiyarie  
\r (Ruk 22:47-53 – Mat 26:47-56, Mar 14:43-50, Wa 18:3-11)  
\p
\v 47 Merikɨte 'utaniukakaku 'akuxi yumɨiretɨ teɨteri mekaniu'axɨani, xewitɨ kaniwarawitɨkɨkaitɨni tamamata heimana memɨyuhuta mɨwanɨkai Kura titewatɨ. Ketsutsi 'aurie kaniutakeni 'i'itsenike.  
\v 48 Peru Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kura, ¿penetsi'itseme penetiyetuani Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa?   
\p
\v 49 Teɨterimama metemarietɨ kemɨtiyɨanekai mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Ti'aitame, ¿takutsiratekɨ tetewatakwini?   
\p
\v 50 Xewitɨ mɨkɨ tewi mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame hetsɨa mieme ti'uximayatame nakaya kanawiteni tserietana mieme.  
\v 51 Peru Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Ari xeketeneuhayewa.  
\p Hikɨ 'imayɨaka nakaya 'aixɨa kaniuyurieni.  
\v 52 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete, kuyaxi tukipa miemete, meta 'ukirawetsixi memeyekɨ me'iwiyake:  
\p —¿Kari xepeyekɨ 'ixiparate meta kɨyexite xete'u'ɨtɨ xenetsiwiyake, kemɨtiwiwiyarɨwa tinawayame?  
\v 53 Tukarikɨ xehetsɨa ne'uyeikakaku tukipa xepɨkanetsi'umayɨa. Peru hikɨ xetukari kanihɨkɨtɨni yamɨtiyɨnikɨ, Yɨwikame heitserie pexeiya hikɨ.   
\s1 Pekuru kemɨtiyuku'imawakai  
\r (Ruk 22:55-62 – Mat 26:69-75, Mar 14:66-72, Wa 18:16-18, 25-27)  
\p
\v 54 Merikɨte me'iwiyaka mekaneihana mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame kiita mekani'atɨani. Pekuru kaniweiyakaitɨni yatewa.  
\v 55 Hikɨ takwa hixɨapa metinaika mana mekaniutiyaxe meta Pekuru wahamatɨa kaniutiyerɨni.  
\v 56 Hikɨ xewitɨ 'ɨimari mana mɨti'uximayakai 'ixeiyaka hekɨaripa 'ukaime 'ixeiyatɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Ikɨta hamatɨana kaniuyeikakaitɨni.   
\p
\v 57 Mɨkɨ kaniyuku'imawakaitɨni mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Uka 'aku, ne nepɨka'imate.   
\p
\v 58 Yareutewikakuta xewitɨ 'ixeiyaka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Ekɨtsɨ xewitɨ mɨkɨ wa'iwa pekanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\p Pekuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Tewi, ne nepɨkahɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 59 Hikɨ xeihurayari 'aye'aku yakɨtɨniketɨ xewitɨta heitseriemekɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yurikɨ 'ikɨ hamatɨana kaniuyeikakaitɨni, neuxei Karereya kiekame kanihɨkɨtɨni.   
\p
\v 60 Pekuru mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Tewi, ne 'atsinepɨkatimate kepemaine.  
\p Yapauka haniukakaku 'akuxi, wakana kenetahiwa.  
\v 61 Ti'aitame ta'aurie 'aweka kaneutaniere Pekuru kaniuxeiya. Hikɨ Pekuru Ti'aitame niukieya kanaye'erieni kemɨtitahɨawixɨ: «Wakana katahiwawekaku 'akuxi hikɨ, 'ekɨ haikakɨa pepɨ'aku'imawani kename pekanetsimate pe'utaitɨ».  
\v 62 Wayeyaka kaniutatsuani kwini mieme tiyuhiwerietɨ.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtinanaimariekai kemɨtikuweiwakai  
\r (Ruk 22:63-65 – Mat 26:67-68, Mar 14:65, Wa 18:22-23)  
\p
\v 63 Hikɨ teɨteri Ketsutsi memɨ'ɨwiyakai mekanitsutɨani me'inanaimatɨ meta mekanikuwayakaitɨni.  
\v 64 Hɨxiena meheikɨhɨaka, mekanikuwayakaitɨni, meta mɨpaɨ mekateniku'iwawiyakaitɨni:  
\p —Ketatineutahekɨatɨa, kemɨ'ane pɨmatsi'uwa.   
\p
\v 65 Waɨkawa matsi mɨpaɨ mekatenikɨhɨawekaitɨni 'axame'utiyuatɨ.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiutahɨawarie 'itsɨkate wahɨxie  
\r (Ruk 22:67-71, 23:2-3, 18-25 – Mat 26:63-66, 27:11-26, Mar 14:61-63, 15:2-15, Wa 18:19-21, 29-37, 39–19:16)  
\p
\v 66 Merikɨtsɨ 'ukatareku mekaniyukuxeɨrieni teɨteri wa'ukiyarima meta mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete, meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai, mɨkɨ mekani'atɨani memayuxeɨriekaitsie.  
\v 67 Mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ketatineutaxatɨa, xɨka 'ekɨ Kɨritsitu pehɨkɨtɨni.  
\p Mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Xɨka yanetixe'utahɨawe, yuri xepɨkaneteta'eririeni.  
\v 68 Xɨka nexeku'iwawiyanike xepɨkanetsita'eiyakeyu, meta xepɨkanetsixɨnakeyu.  
\v 69 Peru hikɨtɨtɨ Yuri Tewi kenemɨtitewa Kakaɨyari Naimekɨmɨtɨrɨkaɨye tserieta nepakani.   
\p
\v 70 Yunaitɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —'Aa, ¿'ekɨ xeniu Kakaɨyari petinu'aya?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xemetsɨ mɨpaɨ xekaniutiyuaneni kename nehɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 71 Hikɨ mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —¿Ketitayari 'akuxi tetewareuyehɨwa tehekɨatamete? tametsietɨ tepi'eni tetana mieme.   
\c 23  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ yunaitɨ mekananuku'uni mekaneihana mɨta'iwawiyarienikɨ Piratu hetsɨa.  
\v 2 'Ana menitsutɨani me'ixanetatɨ mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Te'iku'iwawiyatɨ 'ipaɨ tekatenimaika, kwamanarika wewietɨ tiniwa'ɨkitɨaka tateɨterima, pɨkawapitɨa memɨteyukutuayanikɨ Tsetsaxi kuwiyexinuya hetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ kanaineni kename heitserie 'upitɨarie Kɨritsitutɨtɨ, ti'aitame yuxatatɨ.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ Piratu mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿'Ekɨ huriyutsixi teɨteriyari tiwa'aitɨwame petihɨkɨ?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —'Ekɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ pekanaineni.   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Piratu mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete meta teɨteri memɨyukuxeɨri:  
\p —Kenemɨtimate, tixaɨ pɨkareuyewetse 'ikɨ tewi mɨxanetsiekakɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Mɨkɨ matsi kwini mieme meniku'imawakaitɨni yame'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Kaniwaxamurieneni teɨteri, ti'ɨkitatɨ naitsarie Kureya kwieyaritsie, Karereya kwieyaritsie heitsutɨaka 'uwapaitɨta.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiutahɨawarie Herurexi hɨxie  
\p
\v 6 Merikɨtsɨ Piratu 'u'enaka kaniku'iwawakaitɨni xɨka karereyatanaka hɨkɨtɨkaitɨni tewi.  
\v 7 Tiutamarieka Herurexi mehɨritɨariekaitsie mɨkiekametɨkaikɨ, hetsɨana neinɨ'ani, Herurexi Kerutsareme muyeikakaikɨ 'ana.   
\p
\v 8 Merikɨtsɨ Herurexi Ketsutsi xeiyatɨ kaniyutemawiekaitɨni waɨkawa, mɨixa kanixeiyamɨkɨkaitɨni mɨ'enakaikɨ hepaɨtsitana, mɨpaɨ katiniku'eriwakaitɨni, Ketsutsi tixaɨtɨ mɨtiyurienikekaikɨ 'inɨari, 'ixeiyamɨtɨ.  
\v 9 Waɨkawa kaniku'iwawiyakaitɨni, peru Ketsutsi 'atsipɨkatita'ei.  
\v 10 Manata mekaniku'ukaitɨni mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete meta 'inɨarikɨ memɨte'ɨkitametetɨkai, mɨkɨ mepɨkatehayewakai me'ixanetatɨ.  
\v 11 Hikɨ Herurexi yukuyaxima wahamatɨa tixaɨtɨ mekate'eyeitɨatɨ me'inanaimatɨ, 'ixuriki witsi'aneme me'enakuwirieka tawari mekaneinɨ'ani Piratu hetsɨa.  
\v 12 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Herurexi meta Piratu mekaniyutemawiekaitɨni, mepayuka'uniekai mɨixa, 'anake 'aixɨa mepɨteyuxeiyakai.   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ Piratu warukuxeɨrieka mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete, 'itsɨkate meta teɨteri yunaime,  
\v 14 mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Nehetsɨa xepi'atɨa 'ikɨ tewi, kename kwamanarika wewietɨ tiwa'ɨkitɨa teɨteri xe'utiyuatɨ, kamɨ, xehɨxie ne'ita'iwawiyaka ne, kenemɨtimate, tixaɨ pɨkareuyewetse 'ikɨ tewi hetsie mɨrahɨiyanikɨ kexemɨte'ixaneta.  
\v 15 Herurexi meta yaxeikɨa kaniutayɨni, nexe'utanɨ'aku hetsɨana, tawari nehetsɨa kaneiyenɨ'ani. 'Atsipɨkatiuyuri hetsiena mɨtinakenikɨ mɨmierienikɨ.  
\v 16 'Ayumieme nepɨtita'aita mɨkuweiyaxɨanikɨ, 'arike nepixɨna.   
\p
\v 17 Merikɨtsɨ 'ixɨararipa kaneuyewekaitɨni xeime mɨwaxɨnirienikɨ 'anutahɨiyakame.  
\v 18 'Ana yunaitɨ yaxeikɨa mekateniuhiwa mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Keneumi'a mɨkɨ, ketaneuxɨniri Waxawaxi.   
\p
\v 19 Mɨkɨ mɨyumienekaikɨ kiekaritsie, meta xeime mumikɨ katsariyanata kananutahɨiyakaitɨni.  
\v 20 Piratu tawari kaniwarutahɨawe, Ketsutsi xɨnamɨtɨ.  
\v 21 Mɨkɨ matsi mekaniutihiwakaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Kuruxitsie keneukawi, Kuruxitsie keneukawi.   
\p
\v 22 Hairieka mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titakɨ 'axatiuyuri 'ikɨ tewi? Kenemɨtimate ne, tixaɨtɨ 'atsipɨkatiuyuri pɨkaheuyewetse mɨmierienikɨ, 'ayumieme kuweiyaxɨayu nepixɨna.   
\p
\v 23 Mɨkɨ matsi karima mekaniwawiriekaitɨni kuruxitsie mɨmierienikɨ. Teɨteri meta mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨritɨariekai hiwarikɨ mekane'iwa.  
\v 24 Hikɨ Piratu mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aita yamɨtiyɨnikɨ kememɨte'iwawiriekai mɨkɨ.  
\v 25 Kanixɨna kemɨ'ane memɨwaukai, kemɨ'ane manutahɨiyakai katsariyanata mɨyumienekaikɨ meta xeime mumikɨ, meta Ketsutsi kaniyetuani wahetsɨa kemɨtiwanakekai.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiukawiya kuruxitsie  
\r (Ruk 23:33-43 – Mat 27:33-44, Mar 15:22-32, Wa 19:17-24)  
\p
\v 26 Merikɨtsɨ kepauka memiwitɨximekai meheimienike, xeime mekaniuwiya Tsimuni titewakame Tsirenetanaka, mɨkɨ xaɨtsie hanuyaka kiekaritsie kanaye'aximekaitɨni, hikɨ mekanititɨtɨani kuruxi Ketsutsi 'utɨma menutɨnikɨ.  
\v 27 'Ana yumɨiretɨ teɨteri meniweiyakaitɨni, 'ukari meta me'utitsuatɨ me'itsuariwiyatɨ.  
\v 28 Hikɨ ta'aurie 'aweka mɨpaɨ Ketsutsi tiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xeme 'ukari Kerutsaremetari xepɨka'utitsuanani nehepaɨtsita, yuhepaɨtsita pɨta meta yuniwema wahepaɨtsita xekeneutitsuanani.  
\v 29 Tukari kanaye'amɨkɨ kepauka mɨpaɨ memutiyuaneni: “Mɨkɨ memɨkayɨwawe tɨɨri memɨwarexeiyanikɨ, mɨkɨ 'aixɨa mepɨ'itɨarie, mɨkɨ memɨkatiniwewawe mɨkɨ memɨkatetsitsitɨawawe 'aixɨa mepɨ'itɨarie”.  
\v 30 'Anari mekanitsutɨakuni:  
\q1 »“Mɨpaɨ meteniwatahɨawikuni hɨrite: ‘Taheima kenanakaxɨri’,  
\q2 yemurite meta mɨpaɨ meteniwatahɨawikuni: ‘Xeketaneuti'awieta’”.   
\m
\v 31 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ xɨka mete'uyurieni kɨye yurikaku, ¿ketsɨ tiyɨni tawayu?»   
\p
\v 32 Hipatɨta yuhutatɨ mepehapanie 'axateyuruwamete memɨkwi'iwakɨ hepaɨna.  
\v 33 Merikɨte kepauka memu'axɨa Mɨki Mu'uya Manuka mɨrakutewatsie, mana kuruxitsie mekanikawieni meta tenawayamete wahamatɨa, tserietana xeime meta 'utatana xeime.   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne'ukiyari, ketiniwareuyehɨwirieka, 'atsimemɨkatematekɨ kememɨteyurie.  
\p 'Ana kuyaxi mekaniyuta'iwa 'ixurikiteya meyutahuritɨanike.   
\p
\v 35 Teɨteri mana mekaniti'ukaitɨni metanenieretɨ, 'itsɨkate mekanitawe'eriekaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Hipame waniu kaniwatawikweitsitɨwakaitɨni, yɨkɨmana keyutawikweitsitɨani xɨka 'aku Kɨritsitu hɨkɨtɨni Kakaɨyari hetsɨa mieme, kemɨ'ane manayexeiyarie.   
\p
\v 36 Meta kuyaxi yaxeikɨa mekaninanaimakaitɨni hurawa me'ukɨneka, matsina mekanixatɨakaitɨni menu'ienikɨ,  
\v 37 mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —'Ekɨ huriyutsixi tiwa'aitɨwame xɨka pehɨkɨtɨni, keneu'atawikweitsitɨa.   
\p
\v 38 Meta mu'uya heima mekaneimani 'utɨarika, mɨpaɨ pɨre'ukai: «\sc 'Ikɨ Huriyutsixi Tiwa'aitɨwame Kanihɨkɨtɨni\sc*».   
\p
\v 39 Hikɨ teyukwikate mana memutiwɨkai xewitɨ 'axakatinikɨhɨawekaitɨni, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —¿'Ekɨ pekatihɨkɨ Kɨritsitu? Merikɨte, kene'atawikweitsitɨa, meta tame ketaneutawikweitsitɨa.   
\p
\v 40 Xewitɨ pɨta tapa mutiwiekai nitatieni mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —¿Kari 'ekɨ Kakaɨyari pepɨkamakaxe tsepa hepaɨna pemɨ'itɨariene yaxeikɨa petiutahɨawarieka?  
\v 41 Peru kaniheitserietɨni tahetsie kemɨtiunakixɨ, kemɨreuyewetse xeikɨa tepɨ'itɨarietɨwe yatemɨteyuriekaikɨ. 'Ikɨ matsi tixaɨ 'atsipɨkatiyuriewe.   
\p
\v 42 Mɨpaɨ meta kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ketsutsi 'aku, kenena'eriwani kepauka pemunuani ti'aitame pehɨkɨtɨtɨ.   
\p
\v 43 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Yurikɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨmarahɨawe, hikɨtɨtɨ nehetsɨa pepeyeikani witsimɨraku'anetsie.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiyetua yu'iyari  
\r (Ruk 23:44-49 – Mat 27:45-56, Mar 15:33-41)  
\p
\v 44 Merikɨte tuka kaniukuyɨre yemekɨ naitsarie kwiepa tau kɨa kawiekakuke kaniukuhekɨare.  
\v 45 Tau 'uyɨreku 'ixuriki meuwiekai tuki 'amɨpata hixɨata kanitsane.  
\v 46 Hikɨ Ketsutsi karima 'utahiwaka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne'ukiyari, ne'iyari nepɨmatsihɨritɨa.  
\p Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka kaniumɨni.   
\p
\v 47 Xeitsienituyari kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame 'uniereka kemɨtiuyɨ 'aixɨa kaniutayɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —Yurikɨ 'ikɨ tewi heitserie pexeiyakai.   
\p
\v 48 Yunaitɨ teɨteri meneniereke memɨyukuxeɨri, me'uneniereka kemɨtiuyɨ, yu'utɨma mekanekɨne yutawitsie meyukuhutsunatɨ hiwerikakɨ.  
\v 49 Peru yunaitɨ memimatekai mana mekaniti'ukaitɨni yatewa, meta 'ukari hamatɨana memeyekɨ Karereyatsie, mɨkɨ mana mekaniti'ukaitɨnita menenieretɨ.   
\s1 Ketsutsi kemɨtiuteukie  
\r (Ruk 23:50-56 – Mat 27:57-61, Mar 15:42-47, Wa 19:38-42)  
\p
\v 50-51 Merikɨtsɨ tewi 'akaniuyeikakaitɨni Kutse titewatɨ, 'itsɨkate muwanɨ'ɨ kanihɨkɨtɨtɨkaitɨni, 'aixɨa pɨtiuka'iyarikai heitseriemekɨ yapɨtikamiekai, mɨkɨ yapɨkara'eriwakai kememɨteyu'eni kememɨte'uyuri. 'Arimateya kanikiekametɨkaitɨni Kureya kwieyaritsie, yuri katini'eriekaitɨni ta'ikwewatɨ Kakaɨyari mitsutɨanikɨ ti'aitatɨ.  
\v 52 Mɨkɨ Piratu hetsɨa nuaka kanitawawirieni Ketsutsi kaxarieya.  
\v 53 Hekakweka kanita'eima rinu tsawanayarikɨ, kaneikuteuku teukiyapa 'aitɨa muwaye'inieriekaitsie hakewa tewi hatsuaku mɨkaheutatekiewekaitsie.  
\v 54 Merikɨtsɨ pɨpienixitɨkai 'ana, 'uxipiya tukari pɨtsutɨarieximekai.   
\p
\v 55 Mekaneiweiya 'ukari Karereyatsie memeyekɨ 'utɨmana, mekanixeiya teukiya, meta kaxarieya mekaniuxeiya kemɨtiutekie.  
\v 56 Yu'utɨma mehekɨneka 'aixɨa meniyurieni witsimu'ɨa mixaxi nɨkame 'uaye.  
\p Merikɨtsɨ 'uxipiya tukaritsie mekani'uxipiekaitɨni 'aitsika kemaine.   
\c 24  
\s1 Kemɨranutanierixɨ 'umierieka  
\r (Ruk 24:1-10 – Mat 28:1-8, Mar 16:1-8, Wa 20:1-8)  
\p
\v 1 Tsemana mexɨakame tukaritsie ximeri kwitɨwa, teukiyapa mekanekɨne 'ukarawetsixi witsimu'ɨa me'ahapatɨ memikuha'aritakai.  
\v 2 Hikɨ teté mekaniutaxeiya heuhɨiyakame kitenie meukatei.  
\v 3 Meheutahaxɨaka teukiyapa, mepɨka'itaxei Ti'aitame Ketsutsi kaxarieya.  
\v 4 'Atsimepɨkatemaikai kememɨteyurienikekai mɨpaɨ mɨtiuyɨkɨ, hikɨ 'ukitsi yuhutatɨ wa'aurie mekaniti'uni merɨkawime me'anakatɨtɨ.  
\v 5 Memamatɨ kwiepa mekaniukahɨxima'uni, peru mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayari mɨkite watsata xete'iwautɨwe mɨkɨ mayeniere?  
\v 6 'Uwa pɨkayeka, kananukuketɨarieni. Xekena'eriwani kemɨtixe'utahɨawixɨ Karereyatsie 'uyeikatɨ 'akuxi,  
\v 7 kexemɨte'utahɨawarie: “Yuri Tewi hepaɨtsita, kemɨreuyewekai mɨyetuiyanikɨ 'axateyuruwamete memiwiyakɨ, kuruxitsie mɨmierienikɨ, hairieka tukaritsie manukukenikɨ kemɨreuyewekai”.   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ 'ana Ketsutsi niukieya menaye'erieni.  
\v 9 Hikɨ teukiyapa mewayekɨneka mekanekɨne, 'ikɨ naime mekateniwarutaxatɨani tamamata heimana xeime, meta hipame yunaime.  
\v 10 'Ukari Mariya Mararatanaka, Wana, Mariya Kakuwu mɨwarutsieyatɨkai metenitetewakaitɨni meta hipatɨta wahamatɨa memu'uwakai 'ukari yunaitɨ yamekateniwarutaxatɨani nɨ'ariekate.  
\v 11 Peru mɨkɨ yakɨ me'utiyuaneme mekani'eriekaitɨni metekuxatakaku, yuri mepɨkatewaruta'eriri.  
\v 12 Perutsɨ Pekuru kaneyani teukiyapa 'unautsarɨmetɨ. 'Anahuka nixeiya 'ixuriki mana 'akateme 'uyemaweme. Yukie kaneyani waɨka 'iyarixietɨ kemɨtiunierixɨ hepaɨtsita.   
\s1 Kememɨte'ixei 'Emahu huyeyari 'utɨa me'uhutɨ  
\p
\v 13 Merikɨtsɨ mɨkɨ tukaritsie yuhutatɨ mɨkɨ huyeta menekɨne, kiekaritsie meneta'axɨanikekaitɨni 'Emahu mɨrakutewatsie, Kerutsareme nehurakaitɨni, yanetewakaitɨni tamamata heimana huta kirumetɨruyari xeikɨa.  
\v 14 Metenikuxatakaitɨni naitɨ kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita.  
\v 15 Merikɨtsɨ metekuxatakaku niuki mexɨatɨakaku Ketsutsitɨtɨ niwaranuku'axe me'uhukaku, wahamatɨa niumiekaitɨni,  
\v 16 peru mepɨkapitɨariekai memeitimanikɨ.  
\v 17 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Ketitita 'ikɨ niuki xemɨxɨatɨa xe'uhutɨ, titayari xeteyuhiwerie?  
\p Mɨkɨ mana meniti'uni me'ayexɨxɨnitɨ yɨhɨxie,  
\v 18 xewitɨ mɨkɨ Kɨreupaxi mɨtitewakai mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —¿Kari 'ekɨ 'atsipepɨkatimate Kerutsareme kemɨreyɨ takai 'atu, 'atsita kɨkamete mɨpaɨ mepɨtemate?   
\p
\v 19 'Iya mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Kereyɨkuta?  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Ketsutsi Natsaretitanaka, kemɨranayetɨa pekatimate. Mɨkɨ tewi Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme katinixaxatametɨkaitɨni, kemɨtiyurienekai kemɨtikuxatakai, kanitɨrɨkaɨyekaitɨni Kakaɨyari hɨxie yunaime teɨteri wahɨxie.  
\v 20 Mawari wewiwamete tewa'aitɨwamete ta'itsɨkate meta mekaniyetuani hetsiena mɨrahɨiyanikɨ mɨmierienikɨ, 'arike kuruxitsie mepeimi.  
\v 21 Tametsietɨ tekanita'ikwewakaitɨni yuri tete'erietɨ 'iya mɨhɨkɨtɨkaikɨ kemɨ'ane mɨtatsitixɨnakekai 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari. Mɨkɨ meta, haika tukari kaniyuriekari hikɨ, mɨya reyɨku.  
\v 22 Matsi meta 'ukari tatsata miemete mepɨtatsi'ɨhɨxiyatsitɨa hikɨ, ximeri waniu menekukɨnixɨani teukiyapa,  
\v 23 peru kaxarieya mepɨkahexei. Mekaniu'axɨani mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ kename niuki tuayamete mewarexei meteheinɨme meyu'erietɨ, mɨkɨ waniu kename Ketsutsi 'ayeniere mekateniwaretahɨawe.  
\v 24 'Ana hipatɨta tahamatɨa memu'uwa teukiyapa mekanekɨne, 'ukari kememaitɨkatei, mɨpaɨ 'aneme mepetaxei, peru Ketsutsi mepɨkahexei.   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ Ketsutsi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Kari 'atsixepɨkatemate, yu'iyaritsie xepu'itutupe, 'akuxi yuri xepɨkateta'eriwawe texaxatamete kememɨtekuxatakaitsie naime.  
\v 26 ¿Kareuyewekai Kɨritsitu mɨpaɨ mɨtikwinekɨ, 'arike mɨkake witsi'anetɨ karayanikekai?   
\p
\v 27 'Ana Muitsexi xapaya xatatɨ meri yunaime texaxatamete waxapa xatatɨ, kanitsutɨani tiwahekɨatsitɨiyatɨ kemɨre'ukai hepaɨtsitana naime 'utɨarikatsie.   
\p
\v 28 Merikɨtsɨ kiekaritsie hakewa memeta'axɨanikekai mekaneta'axɨani, 'iya matsi 'ateewa kaniumiekaitɨni.  
\v 29 Mɨkɨ kwinimieme mekani'iniekaitɨni mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ:  
\p —Tahamatɨa kene'ahayewa, 'etsiwatɨkaku putaikai pakayunirɨme.  
\p Hikɨ muwa kaneutahani wahamatɨa mɨyuhayewakɨ.  
\v 30 Hikɨ wahamatɨa 'ayerɨka mexa 'aurie, 'enu'ɨka paa, 'aixɨa kaniutayɨni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita paa hepaɨtsita, 'ititaraka kaniwarumini.  
\v 31 'Ana wahɨxie katineukuyepiere hikɨ mekaneitimani, peru mɨkɨ kamatsiɨkɨtɨ kanayuyeitɨani tawari mepɨka'ixei.  
\v 32 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ mekateniyɨkɨhɨawekaitɨni:  
\p —'E'e, 'ayumieme ta'iyaritsie kwini mieme tepɨtayetuakai mexi tatikuxaxatɨwakai huyeta te'uhukaku, mexi tatsihekɨatsitɨiyakai 'utɨarika kemaine.   
\p
\v 33 Hikɨ me'anuku'uka kwitɨ, Kerutsareme mekanekɨne yu'utɨma. Tamamata heimana xeime hipameta mekaniwaretaxeiya meyuxeɨriekame.  
\v 34 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni: «Kaniyuritɨni, Ti'aitame panukuke. Matsiɨkɨtɨ kanayuyeitɨani Tsimuni 'ixeiyakaku».   
\p
\v 35 Mɨkɨ meta mekateniwarutaxatɨani huyeta kemɨreyɨ, kememɨteheitima paa 'utitaraku.   
\s1 Ketsutsi matsiɨkɨtɨ kemɨrayuyeitɨa teyɨ'ɨkitɨwamete wahɨxie  
\p
\v 36 Merikɨtsɨ metekuxatakaku 'akuxi, 'iya wahixɨata kaniutakeni, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Aixɨa 'aku.   
\p
\v 37 Mɨkɨ mekaniutimamani, mɨki mexeiyame meyu'erietɨ.   
\p
\v 38 Mɨkɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayari xeteyuxamurie? ¿Titayari xete'itsutɨa niuki xexɨatɨatɨ yu'iyaritsie?  
\v 39 Xekeneu'ixɨari nemamate ne'ɨkate, ne nekanihɨkɨtɨni, xekeneneumayɨa xekeneneuxeiya, 'iyari 'ume pɨkahexeiya wai pɨkahexeiya nehapaɨ.   
\p
\v 40 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka yumamate yɨ'ɨkate kaniwaruxeitsitɨani.  
\v 41 Meyutemamawietɨ mehɨxiyatɨ, kayuritɨme mepɨ'eriekai 'akuxi, hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Tixaɨ xekatehexeiya 'ena tikwaiwame?   
\p
\v 42 Tsaapa waiyari yayeukame mekanimini warikime.  
\v 43 'Enu'ɨka kanitakwani wahɨxie.  
\v 44 Merikɨtsɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikɨ niuki nekanixekuxaxatɨwakaitɨni xehamatɨa ne'uyeikatɨ 'akuxi, mɨpaɨ ne'utaitɨ kename heuyewekai maye'atɨarienikɨ naitɨ nehepaɨtsita kemɨre'uxa Muitsexi 'inɨarieya niukiyaritsie, texaxatamete waxapatsie meta kwikari xapayaritsie ne'utaitɨ.   
\p
\v 45 'Ana wa'iyari kaniwatiyepieni memeitimanikɨ tita 'utɨarika xapayari mɨtixatakai.   
\p
\v 46 Mɨpaɨta katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ pɨre'uxa, kemɨreuyewekai Kɨritsitu nehɨkɨtɨtɨ mɨya nekatinikwinekekaitɨni, hairieka tukaritsie nekananukukenikekaitɨni mɨkite watsata.  
\v 47 Mɨkɨ meta, yunaitɨ nuiwarite mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawariekuni, xɨka xete'uhayewa kexemɨteyuriekai, xɨka pɨta xenetsihahɨaweni kemɨ'ane nemɨhɨkɨ, xepɨteheuyehɨwiyarieni 'axaxemɨte'uyurikɨ, Kerutsareme meri, 'ariketa xaɨtsie yakatinikuxaxatsiwamɨkɨ.  
\v 48 Xeme xekanihɨkɨtɨni xemunenierixɨ xemihekɨata 'ikɨ kemɨtiuyɨ hepaɨtsita.  
\v 49 Ne meta nepɨtixehanɨ'airieni tita ne'ukiyari mɨrainekai mɨtixeminikekaikɨ, xeme kiekaritsie xekeneyuhayewani tukari 'aye'ayuke kepauka tɨrɨkariya xemɨpitɨarieni taheima mieme, 'anake xepayekɨne.   
\s1 Kemɨranutitɨa  
\p
\v 50 Hikɨ kaniwarayewitɨni Wetaniya 'aurie, yumamá teikɨ hetseratɨ kaniutaniuni 'aixɨa memɨ'itɨarienikɨ.  
\v 51 Mexi 'utaniukakai wahetsɨa kanayeyani, muyuawitsie kananutiwitɨkieni.  
\v 52 Mɨkɨ nenewieri me'ipitɨaka Kerutsareme mekanekɨne kwini mieme meyutemamawietɨ.  
\v 53 Tukarikɨ tuki kuraruyarita mekaniu'uwakaitɨni 'aixɨa me'utiyuatɨ Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita. Mɨpaɨ xeikɨa kani'aneni.   